(1509670, 200197, 30061, '<td valign="top">I think this photograph suffers somewhat from composition.  The human eye tends to focus more just above the center of a photo, and since the spring is situated mostly toward the bottom right, my eye tends to focus on the upper blurry part of the spring rather than the crisp lower area.  I do like the picture, please don''t misunderstand. 7</td>', 'I think this photograph suffers somewhat from composition.  The human eye tends to focus more just above the center of a photo, and since the spring is situated mostly toward the bottom right, my eye tends to focus on the upper blurry part of the spring rather than the crisp lower area.  I do like the picture, please don''t misunderstand. 7', '2005-07-06 01:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
