(1510032, 200392, 3932, '<td valign="top">This shot works for me... but I think it would be a much stronger composition without the horizon visible.  Maybe cropped a little higher on the bottom, and cropped a little tighter on the left would help retain the strength of the vertical crop? - 7 - JeB</td>', 'This shot works for me... but I think it would be a much stronger composition without the horizon visible.  Maybe cropped a little higher on the bottom, and cropped a little tighter on the left would help retain the strength of the vertical crop? - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 01:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
