(1510048, 200445, 33899, '<td valign="top">great, the chrome tones of the sink stopper look nice, maybe throw the image into grayscale and boost contrast so you dont have that pinkish cast on your sink though?  whenever colors dont come out the way i like them to, i go blakc and white and boost contrast to give it a little artsy feel to it. lol just my 2 cents :)</td>', 'great, the chrome tones of the sink stopper look nice, maybe throw the image into grayscale and boost contrast so you dont have that pinkish cast on your sink though?  whenever colors dont come out the way i like them to, i go blakc and white and boost contrast to give it a little artsy feel to it. lol just my 2 cents :)', '2005-07-06 01:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
