(1510143, 200444, 33899, '<td valign="top">blue! 10! and a fav! i wish i knew who you were so i could also add you to my favorite photographer list too! ur awesome!</td>', 'blue! 10! and a fav! i wish i knew who you were so i could also add you to my favorite photographer list too! ur awesome!', '2005-07-06 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510144, 198145, 15711, '<td valign="top">Image - clear.  Offset slightly  - good.  Overall - a bit ho hum for me.</td>', 'Image - clear.  Offset slightly  - good.  Overall - a bit ho hum for me.', '2005-07-06 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510146, 200723, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think your crop is too close to the top and right.  The left side of the photo contains nothing that adds to the photo at all.  The right side is lit, but you cropped off the edge.  Colors are neat, and great focus for being a low light shot.  There is a small bright something in the background to the left that is distracting from the subject itself.  overall I think this is a really neat image, technically well done, but needs a different crop to increase visual appeal.  if the background was an issue, try placing a black cloth or something behind the subject to eliminate background elements.  looks almost like you cropped to get rid of background crap.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I think your crop is too close to the top and right.  The left side of the photo contains nothing that adds to the photo at all.  The right side is lit, but you cropped off the edge.  Colors are neat, and great focus for being a low light shot.  There is a small bright something in the background to the left that is distracting from the subject itself.  overall I think this is a really neat image, technically well done, but needs a different crop to increase visual appeal.  if the background was an issue, try placing a black cloth or something behind the subject to eliminate background elements.  looks almost like you cropped to get rid of background crap.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-06 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510147, 199842, 15711, '<td valign="top">For some reason the sculpture doesn''t POP enough - maybe it''s the busy green foliage in the background. Maybe it woiuld''ve worked better with a black and white filter and more contrast?</td>', 'For some reason the sculpture doesn''t POP enough - maybe it''s the busy green foliage in the background. Maybe it woiuld''ve worked better with a black and white filter and more contrast?', '2005-07-06 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
