(1510299, 199313, 3669, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit bland and flat.  Would like to see maybe a boost in saturation or contrast to bring out the colors more.  Focus is great on this close-up.  Shows nice texture.</td>', 'Seems a bit bland and flat.  Would like to see maybe a boost in saturation or contrast to bring out the colors more.  Focus is great on this close-up.  Shows nice texture.', '2005-07-06 03:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510300, 199157, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the old feeling of this. Sepia might be a nice effect.</td>', 'Love the old feeling of this. Sepia might be a nice effect.', '2005-07-06 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510301, 199810, 3932, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely met the challenge and found a circle, or two, or a bunch :) I think there are to many circles to make this composition effective for me though. It''s busy to me and that detracts from it''s attractiveness.  - 5 - JeB</td>', 'You''ve definitely met the challenge and found a circle, or two, or a bunch :) I think there are to many circles to make this composition effective for me though. It''s busy to me and that detracts from it''s attractiveness.  - 5 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510303, 200720, 12573, '<td valign="top">Your white balance seems to be far too warm (orange), at least on my monitor.  The perspective is a little odd and it seems you''d have done better to go either completely topdown or more of a severe angle.  As it is, the angle creates a very "normal" perspective as though I were sitting there looking at the cereal. The background material is distrcting and has far too much detail.  The spoon could be omitted to greater effect.  Decent effort, though.</td>', 'Your white balance seems to be far too warm (orange), at least on my monitor.  The perspective is a little odd and it seems you''d have done better to go either completely topdown or more of a severe angle.  As it is, the angle creates a very "normal" perspective as though I were sitting there looking at the cereal. The background material is distrcting and has far too much detail.  The spoon could be omitted to greater effect.  Decent effort, though.', '2005-07-06 03:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510304, 200092, 3932, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! I think a different backdrop would have worked better with this shot to draw more focus to the plate and ultimately the cereal itself...  - 6 - JeB</td>', 'Neat idea! I think a different backdrop would have worked better with this shot to draw more focus to the plate and ultimately the cereal itself...  - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510305, 200638, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing cause I did a similar one and it was awful. Yours is really good. The lighting is nicely done.  Love the clarity of the eye.  Great hat. Great title!!</td>', 'I''m laughing cause I did a similar one and it was awful. Yours is really good. The lighting is nicely done.  Love the clarity of the eye.  Great hat. Great title!!', '2005-07-06 03:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510306, 199040, 15711, '<td valign="top">Peaceful and hazy.  Maybe a touch more contrast??</td>', 'Peaceful and hazy.  Maybe a touch more contrast??', '2005-07-06 03:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510307, 200235, 3932, '<td valign="top">Is this a sphere contest? :) just kidding :) This is a neat shot,neat concept. I think you should have used a different coler pin, instead of the green, as the focal point. It''s darker in the middle of the shot, and the green just blends right in for me. - 6 - JeB</td>', 'Is this a sphere contest? :) just kidding :) This is a neat shot,neat concept. I think you should have used a different coler pin, instead of the green, as the focal point. It''s darker in the middle of the shot, and the green just blends right in for me. - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510309, 199368, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great blue! Pretty. Well captured.</td>', 'Great blue! Pretty. Well captured.', '2005-07-06 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510311, 200187, 12573, '<td valign="top">Not really seeing a circle, but I''ll give you the benefit of doubt.  The subject is interesting and has attitude, but the hat and the position of the hands seems unnatural.  Also, taking an engaging photo of someone wearing dark sunglasses is difficult.  Next time, perhaps try to incorporate something with similar style that allows us to see the eyes.</td>', 'Not really seeing a circle, but I''ll give you the benefit of doubt.  The subject is interesting and has attitude, but the hat and the position of the hands seems unnatural.  Also, taking an engaging photo of someone wearing dark sunglasses is difficult.  Next time, perhaps try to incorporate something with similar style that allows us to see the eyes.', '2005-07-06 03:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510312, 200422, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a vintage auto! What happened on the bottom left of the bumper? It seems really soft... i guess maybe picking up some of the grass on the chrome? - 7 - JeB</td>', 'Great shot of a vintage auto! What happened on the bottom left of the bumper? It seems really soft... i guess maybe picking up some of the grass on the chrome? - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510314, 200714, 15711, '<td valign="top">BRAVO!! Woody does it again.  Very clever.  So much fun. Love it.</td>', 'BRAVO!! Woody does it again.  Very clever.  So much fun. Love it.', '2005-07-06 03:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510315, 199060, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect cloud in the hoop. I tried this and mine was awful.  You did a great job. Super color of the sky.</td>', 'Perfect cloud in the hoop. I tried this and mine was awful.  You did a great job. Super color of the sky.', '2005-07-06 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510316, 200076, 37250, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Stylish and fun.  Good use of the angle also, something that i am not normally fond of but that I find works well in this photo ~8~<br/> <br/>Eric...</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Stylish and fun.  Good use of the angle also, something that i am not normally fond of but that I find works well in this photo ~8~ Eric...', '2005-07-06 03:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510317, 200463, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great shot1 I think would have been executed a bit better to have the circle more on the left or right of dead center and let the rope balance the composition out on the other hemisphere. The shadow is a bit distracting, but I''m sure it will look great afetr some more editing! - 7 - JeB</td>', 'Great idea and great shot1 I think would have been executed a bit better to have the circle more on the left or right of dead center and let the rope balance the composition out on the other hemisphere. The shadow is a bit distracting, but I''m sure it will look great afetr some more editing! - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510318, 200741, 3669, '<td valign="top">ACK...Not another flower macro!!  No, seriously...you should have entered this in the macro challenge.  It is nicely done.  The focus and lighting are great.  The soft colors are very nice.  The water drops add a nice touch...not overdone like some.  I like the crop and the background is soft and nuetral. The circle is there.  I guess I have to give it a 10...good job :-)  Good luck in the challenge and I hope you don''t have too many groans about it being a flower.</td>', 'ACK...Not another flower macro!!  No, seriously...you should have entered this in the macro challenge.  It is nicely done.  The focus and lighting are great.  The soft colors are very nice.  The water drops add a nice touch...not overdone like some.  I like the crop and the background is soft and nuetral. The circle is there.  I guess I have to give it a 10...good job :-)  Good luck in the challenge and I hope you don''t have too many groans about it being a flower.', '2005-07-06 03:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510320, 200686, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a super stop action.  What fun. (were you nauseated afterward?) I''d bring up the sky saturation a tad.<br/> <br/>FUN!!</td>', 'Wow this is a super stop action.  What fun. (were you nauseated afterward?) I''d bring up the sky saturation a tad. FUN!!', '2005-07-06 03:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510321, 199030, 3932, '<td valign="top">This composition seems off... the front left kiss being out of focus hurts it I think because it is the most predominate subject in the composition, yet, just a bit out of focus. Although, I understand you were going for the circle on the base of the kiss... - 6 - JeB</td>', 'This composition seems off... the front left kiss being out of focus hurts it I think because it is the most predominate subject in the composition, yet, just a bit out of focus. Although, I understand you were going for the circle on the base of the kiss... - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510322, 200483, 12573, '<td valign="top">Decent image of a very popular subject.  The background is sufficiently blurry to keep my focus on the circular weed.  The image does not have any serious technical faults, yet it does not appeal to me.  Perhaps if there were a pair of lips in the frame, blowing the seeds to the wind.  Something to spark my interest.</td>', 'Decent image of a very popular subject.  The background is sufficiently blurry to keep my focus on the circular weed.  The image does not have any serious technical faults, yet it does not appeal to me.  Perhaps if there were a pair of lips in the frame, blowing the seeds to the wind.  Something to spark my interest.', '2005-07-06 03:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510323, 200225, 39571, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you were going for, but having the cd in focus would help.</td>', 'I like the idea you were going for, but having the cd in focus would help.', '2005-07-06 03:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510324, 198456, 15711, '<td valign="top">Contemporary! Like tomato skeletons. Great imaginative image.</td>', 'Contemporary! Like tomato skeletons. Great imaginative image.', '2005-07-06 03:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510326, 199107, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d love this with a dark background and a single light source. Nice rich coloration of the globe.</td>', 'I''d love this with a dark background and a single light source. Nice rich coloration of the globe.', '2005-07-06 03:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510327, 198157, 35827, '<td valign="top">what a masterpiece.</td>', 'what a masterpiece.', '2005-07-06 03:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510328, 200587, 3932, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised that there are not more fans :) I thought about it - but didn''t do it. You did a great job on this shot - it has a wonderful feeling of perspective to it... It has a lot of depth and the blue tinge works well. A little tighter cropping on the right would have worked better imo, to remove the object on the bottom left and the plastic trim of the fan. - 6 -JeB</td>', 'I''m surprised that there are not more fans :) I thought about it - but didn''t do it. You did a great job on this shot - it has a wonderful feeling of perspective to it... It has a lot of depth and the blue tinge works well. A little tighter cropping on the right would have worked better imo, to remove the object on the bottom left and the plastic trim of the fan. - 6 -JeB', '2005-07-06 03:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510329, 200119, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOOD BOY! Love this one. It''s different and original. Great stop action!</td>', 'GOOD BOY! Love this one. It''s different and original. Great stop action!', '2005-07-06 03:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510331, 199263, 39381, '<td valign="top">I''m new to this. I just started this whole photography thing about 3 weeks ago, so forgive me for not knowing the lingo. With that said, I think this is an excellent photo.</td>', 'I''m new to this. I just started this whole photography thing about 3 weeks ago, so forgive me for not knowing the lingo. With that said, I think this is an excellent photo.', '2005-07-06 03:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510332, 198345, 15711, '<td valign="top">Different. I like the imaginative approach. Great clarity and colors.</td>', 'Different. I like the imaginative approach. Great clarity and colors.', '2005-07-06 03:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510333, 200016, 12573, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool image.  Without the "bubble", this would be mediocre.  As it is, it''s quite nice.  I wonder what that dark patch in the upper right is though.  I understand it couldn''t be cropped out, but it''s still a distraction.  Imagine the bubble without the reflections...I think it would be slight improvement.  Still, I give it an 8.</td>', 'Pretty cool image.  Without the "bubble", this would be mediocre.  As it is, it''s quite nice.  I wonder what that dark patch in the upper right is though.  I understand it couldn''t be cropped out, but it''s still a distraction.  Imagine the bubble without the reflections...I think it would be slight improvement.  Still, I give it an 8.', '2005-07-06 03:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510334, 198820, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great time pieces! Neat shot - love the colors.  The clock on the right (the middle one I guess) seems slightly out of place to me... I suppose because it''s not too far back from the first one, or that it''s cut off by quite a bit or both.  - 6 - JeB</td>', 'Great time pieces! Neat shot - love the colors.  The clock on the right (the middle one I guess) seems slightly out of place to me... I suppose because it''s not too far back from the first one, or that it''s cut off by quite a bit or both.  - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510335, 200272, 17925, '<td valign="top">wld have suit the theme "waves" more than circle...</td>', 'wld have suit the theme "waves" more than circle...', '2005-07-06 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510336, 200079, 15711, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of color. LIght and dark is great on this one. What is it???</td>', 'Awesome use of color. LIght and dark is great on this one. What is it???', '2005-07-06 03:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510337, 200389, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very simple, but nice.  The lighting is perfect with nice shadow.  Well focused.  This reminds me of an drawing class study subject.  Shows a little grain, but oh well.  Meets challenge criteria.  Good composition.  I can''t think of any reason not to give it a 10</td>', 'Very simple, but nice.  The lighting is perfect with nice shadow.  Well focused.  This reminds me of an drawing class study subject.  Shows a little grain, but oh well.  Meets challenge criteria.  Good composition.  I can''t think of any reason not to give it a 10', '2005-07-06 03:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510338, 200718, 17925, '<td valign="top">i like the sharpness.. makes the sweets look tasty.. wld be nicer if e sweets were laid out more naturally</td>', 'i like the sharpness.. makes the sweets look tasty.. wld be nicer if e sweets were laid out more naturally', '2005-07-06 03:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510339, 200011, 39571, '<td valign="top">very nice photo. Would suggest perhaps a more vertical image, as I think the subject is more suited to a vertical point of view. still a great photo tho.</td>', 'very nice photo. Would suggest perhaps a more vertical image, as I think the subject is more suited to a vertical point of view. still a great photo tho.', '2005-07-06 03:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510340, 200571, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow! Root beer (or ale?) never looked so good. The use of shadow and lighting is excellent!</td>', 'Wow! Root beer (or ale?) never looked so good. The use of shadow and lighting is excellent!', '2005-07-06 03:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510341, 200076, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow - you spent some time arranging her hair! This is a neat idea that meets the challenge. There are a few spots on her face that are a bit hot - but I''m sure will look fine outside of the challenge with some editing. Neat idea. - 6 - JeB</td>', 'Wow - you spent some time arranging her hair! This is a neat idea that meets the challenge. There are a few spots on her face that are a bit hot - but I''m sure will look fine outside of the challenge with some editing. Neat idea. - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510343, 197947, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great angle!!! Nice contrast and depth.</td>', 'Great angle!!! Nice contrast and depth.', '2005-07-06 03:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510344, 198627, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great natural find.  That''s really neat!! Nice coloration. NOt overly exposed.</td>', 'Great natural find.  That''s really neat!! Nice coloration. NOt overly exposed.', '2005-07-06 03:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510345, 200203, 28882, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-07-06 03:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510347, 199846, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a poster. This is interesting. Nice color choices. FUN!</td>', 'Looks like a poster. This is interesting. Nice color choices. FUN!', '2005-07-06 03:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510348, 200097, 3669, '<td valign="top">A little on the blurry side, but hard not to that with firework pictures.  The red sky is kind of weird.  Did you manipulate the hue in post-processing?  I''m not sure I like it...really distracts from the firework burst.</td>', 'A little on the blurry side, but hard not to that with firework pictures.  The red sky is kind of weird.  Did you manipulate the hue in post-processing?  I''m not sure I like it...really distracts from the firework burst.', '2005-07-06 03:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510349, 200660, 12573, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping work you''ve done here, but it does not save the rim from being overexposed by at least 2/3 of a stop.  The harshness of midday sun can sometimes work to your advantage, but I wonder if some softer, overcast lighting would have been better.  Your choice of background and is superb and begins to tell us a story about the bike and it''s roots.  Perhaps including the legs of a young boy dressed in 50s and conversion to black and white would bring out the rustic feeling of the image.  Good effort.</td>', 'I like the cropping work you''ve done here, but it does not save the rim from being overexposed by at least 2/3 of a stop.  The harshness of midday sun can sometimes work to your advantage, but I wonder if some softer, overcast lighting would have been better.  Your choice of background and is superb and begins to tell us a story about the bike and it''s roots.  Perhaps including the legs of a young boy dressed in 50s and conversion to black and white would bring out the rustic feeling of the image.  Good effort.', '2005-07-06 03:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510350, 200444, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great. Love the architectural feel to it. Great contrast and lighting on this.</td>', 'This is great. Love the architectural feel to it. Great contrast and lighting on this.', '2005-07-06 03:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510351, 200570, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea and I think you should explore it further. The shadows are distracting... both from the balls and what seems to be a pole. Perhaps another perspective, a bit lower would work on this/ I''m not sure of the background though :( It just doesn''t seem to "pop" to me... - 5 - jeB</td>', 'This is a neat idea and I think you should explore it further. The shadows are distracting... both from the balls and what seems to be a pole. Perhaps another perspective, a bit lower would work on this/ I''m not sure of the background though :( It just doesn''t seem to "pop" to me... - 5 - jeB', '2005-07-06 03:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510353, 199017, 2441, '<td valign="top">I like the colours on this one, it also seems like it is glowing.</td>', 'I like the colours on this one, it also seems like it is glowing.', '2005-07-06 03:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510354, 200050, 15711, '<td valign="top">Unposed.  Great colors. This is really well done. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Unposed.  Great colors. This is really well done. Nice lighting.', '2005-07-06 03:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510355, 200571, 2441, '<td valign="top">This was a weel thought of idea and title, put a smile on my face.</td>', 'This was a weel thought of idea and title, put a smile on my face.', '2005-07-06 03:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510356, 200631, 15711, '<td valign="top">Slinky on acid! WOW what great vivid coloration.  I almost need to wear sunglasses to view it.  This is a fun photo.</td>', 'Slinky on acid! WOW what great vivid coloration.  I almost need to wear sunglasses to view it.  This is a fun photo.', '2005-07-06 03:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510357, 199868, 3932, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!!!!! I wish the focus would have been constant and clear throughout - I think it would complete this particular shot. The green M&amp;M''s already do a great job of leading me to the focal point, so the lack of focus distracts me... although I know complete focus is difficult on a macro like this. - 7 - JeB</td>', 'Neat idea!!!!! I wish the focus would have been constant and clear throughout - I think it would complete this particular shot. The green M&M''s already do a great job of leading me to the focal point, so the lack of focus distracts me... although I know complete focus is difficult on a macro like this. - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510358, 197824, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice effect...looks like it has just been fired.  I like the smoky"ness" and cool colors.  A bit bright to the right of the barrel.  8</td>', 'Nice effect...looks like it has just been fired.  I like the smoky"ness" and cool colors.  A bit bright to the right of the barrel.  8', '2005-07-06 03:29:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1510359, 200004, 39571, '<td valign="top">I would suggest a different point of view so the clutch was not breaking the lines of the tire and disc brake, as well it would improve the backdrop.</td>', 'I would suggest a different point of view so the clutch was not breaking the lines of the tire and disc brake, as well it would improve the backdrop.', '2005-07-06 03:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510360, 200211, 39381, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2005-07-06 03:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510362, 199501, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Neat perspective! I like this shot a lot! It works very well! - 8 JeB</td>', 'Great shot! Neat perspective! I like this shot a lot! It works very well! - 8 JeB', '2005-07-06 03:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510365, 198066, 12573, '<td valign="top">Smoke indeed.  But not that interesting.  With so little context (trees on the bottom right) I''m left to wonder why the smoke is there and what dramatic event might be occurring to cause the smoke.  I think a super wide angle lens with something relevant (like the fire causing the smoke :P ) in the foreground would have improved this shot.</td>', 'Smoke indeed.  But not that interesting.  With so little context (trees on the bottom right) I''m left to wonder why the smoke is there and what dramatic event might be occurring to cause the smoke.  I think a super wide angle lens with something relevant (like the fire causing the smoke :P ) in the foreground would have improved this shot.', '2005-07-06 03:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510366, 199835, 2441, '<td valign="top">I like the content, but it seems to lose is with the lack of focus at the far end.  Also a little to much glare distracts from the main body of the picture.</td>', 'I like the content, but it seems to lose is with the lack of focus at the far end.  Also a little to much glare distracts from the main body of the picture.', '2005-07-06 03:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510367, 200016, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I don''t really like seeing the reflection of the camera in the water drop.  Very creative idea.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I don''t really like seeing the reflection of the camera in the water drop.  Very creative idea.', '2005-07-06 03:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510368, 200003, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW. I''m dizzy. This is a great time lapse photo.  Love the glow of the lights.</td>', 'WOW. I''m dizzy. This is a great time lapse photo.  Love the glow of the lights.', '2005-07-06 03:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510369, 200550, 3932, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide if this composition is as strong as it could be... I don''t know if it would be stronger with or without the woman. I think it might be stronger without - her red contrasts so much with the rest of the photo, that she draws me away from the "circle" lake itself, reducing it''s efficiency as a major entity of the photo. - 7 - JeB</td>', 'I''m trying to decide if this composition is as strong as it could be... I don''t know if it would be stronger with or without the woman. I think it might be stronger without - her red contrasts so much with the rest of the photo, that she draws me away from the "circle" lake itself, reducing it''s efficiency as a major entity of the photo. - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510371, 200573, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the duplicity of the time!! Is that a subliminal message???? Ok, I''ll give it a 10.</td>', 'Love the duplicity of the time!! Is that a subliminal message???? Ok, I''ll give it a 10.', '2005-07-06 03:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510372, 199780, 3932, '<td valign="top">Neat neat shot. Is this stained glass, or?</td>', 'Neat neat shot. Is this stained glass, or?', '2005-07-06 03:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510374, 200495, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus.  I like the soft feel of this picture.  The reflection in the eye just isn''t as nice.  The area above the pupil is a little too bright.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus.  I like the soft feel of this picture.  The reflection in the eye just isn''t as nice.  The area above the pupil is a little too bright.', '2005-07-06 03:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510376, 199516, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s what I call A BUNCH OF ZINNIAS. Such lovely colors.  Great contrast. Texture is good.</td>', 'That''s what I call A BUNCH OF ZINNIAS. Such lovely colors.  Great contrast. Texture is good.', '2005-07-06 03:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510377, 200460, 39571, '<td valign="top">I would try re-taking this shot, but in a location that did not have the harsh contrast between the sunlight and the shadows, as well as a more flat backdrop, as opposed to the pile of bricks.<br/> <br/>The sunlight creates a very stark and high contrast image that could be greatly improved upon with even lighting for the entire subject.</td>', 'I would try re-taking this shot, but in a location that did not have the harsh contrast between the sunlight and the shadows, as well as a more flat backdrop, as opposed to the pile of bricks. The sunlight creates a very stark and high contrast image that could be greatly improved upon with even lighting for the entire subject.', '2005-07-06 03:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510378, 200716, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a great fireworks shot. After just shooting on the 4th, I realize how difficult it is to get just a single burst in the frame. I wish the pyrotechnic guys would work with us a bit more!!! :) This is a strong photo, but the bottom bursts is so strong and intense against the black sky that it detracts from the big burst, that I think should/is the main focus point of the shot. - 6 - JeB</td>', 'This is a great fireworks shot. After just shooting on the 4th, I realize how difficult it is to get just a single burst in the frame. I wish the pyrotechnic guys would work with us a bit more!!! :) This is a strong photo, but the bottom bursts is so strong and intense against the black sky that it detracts from the big burst, that I think should/is the main focus point of the shot. - 6 - JeB', '2005-07-06 03:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510379, 200076, 2441, '<td valign="top">This is good, well thought out.</td>', 'This is good, well thought out.', '2005-07-06 03:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510380, 200517, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT MACRO. I can almost hear him breathing.</td>', 'GREAT MACRO. I can almost hear him breathing.', '2005-07-06 03:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
