(1510385, 200016, 15711, '<td valign="top">Talk about POP! That is rerally cool. I feel like I should move out of the way. Great bright colors.</td>', 'Talk about POP! That is rerally cool. I feel like I should move out of the way. Great bright colors.', '2005-07-06 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510386, 200503, 12573, '<td valign="top">A nicely exposed and centered shot of the moon.  Rather grainy and lacking detail though.  I realize it''s difficult to get a detailed shot of the moon without selling the farm, but this image is weak among the finer examples of astrophotography I''ve seen.  If you want to supplement the image to make up for lack of detail, back off and include something in silhouette like a person pointing to the moon or house on a hill.  Having very little compositional or artistic impact, this image must be judged on it''s technical merits--an area which it is somewhat lacking.</td>', 'A nicely exposed and centered shot of the moon.  Rather grainy and lacking detail though.  I realize it''s difficult to get a detailed shot of the moon without selling the farm, but this image is weak among the finer examples of astrophotography I''ve seen.  If you want to supplement the image to make up for lack of detail, back off and include something in silhouette like a person pointing to the moon or house on a hill.  Having very little compositional or artistic impact, this image must be judged on it''s technical merits--an area which it is somewhat lacking.', '2005-07-06 03:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510387, 199143, 3669, '<td valign="top">It looks like this picture needs to be rotated clockwise a few degrees.  My eyes want to study the lines instead of the circle.</td>', 'It looks like this picture needs to be rotated clockwise a few degrees.  My eyes want to study the lines instead of the circle.', '2005-07-06 03:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510388, 199816, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great stock photo. Couldn''t be more clear or vivid. Love the colors.</td>', 'Great stock photo. Couldn''t be more clear or vivid. Love the colors.', '2005-07-06 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
