(1510400, 200308, 3669, '<td valign="top">I guess if I want to be challenge picky, there are spheres instead of circles in this picture.  I like the creativness of this picture, though.  The water from what I would assume to be a fountain makes for a nice effect.  It would look cool to have the focus on the water instead.</td>', 'I guess if I want to be challenge picky, there are spheres instead of circles in this picture.  I like the creativness of this picture, though.  The water from what I would assume to be a fountain makes for a nice effect.  It would look cool to have the focus on the water instead.', '2005-07-06 03:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
