(1510402, 199717, 12573, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  If only you''d have cropped out the corners I''d be a lot more interested in this image.  As it is, the viewer is made aware that those beautiful lines of light have an end and so the mystery is lost.  Try cropping those corners and my guess is that you''ll like the shot even more.  Good eye, though.</td>', 'This is nice!  If only you''d have cropped out the corners I''d be a lot more interested in this image.  As it is, the viewer is made aware that those beautiful lines of light have an end and so the mystery is lost.  Try cropping those corners and my guess is that you''ll like the shot even more.  Good eye, though.', '2005-07-06 03:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
