(1510405, 199600, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH this is great.  Love the expression and the multiple circles.  Awesome. Speedo would love this one.</td>', 'OH this is great.  Love the expression and the multiple circles.  Awesome. Speedo would love this one.', '2005-07-06 03:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510407, 199910, 12573, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Cropping work is thoughtful and pleasant.  I see just enough of the glass to understand what the lime is doing there.  I wonder if you could have thrown the background out of focus even more though.  Also, perhaps backing up a bit and making the slice smaller in the frame would improve the shot.  The colors in the background complement the lime nicely.  A 7 for you!</td>', 'This is nice.  Cropping work is thoughtful and pleasant.  I see just enough of the glass to understand what the lime is doing there.  I wonder if you could have thrown the background out of focus even more though.  Also, perhaps backing up a bit and making the slice smaller in the frame would improve the shot.  The colors in the background complement the lime nicely.  A 7 for you!', '2005-07-06 03:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510410, 200121, 3669, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like the bubble is in focus.  Kind of gets lost in the background.  Perhaps being able to get closer to the bubble when taking it and not having so much background would help get this picture off the ground.</td>', 'It doesn''t look like the bubble is in focus.  Kind of gets lost in the background.  Perhaps being able to get closer to the bubble when taking it and not having so much background would help get this picture off the ground.', '2005-07-06 03:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
