(1512145, 199081, 5354, '<td valign="top">I really strugglr to comment on these without sounding rude. There is little or no merit intaking a snap of some CD arranged to represent the Olympic emblem. There is no attempt to add interest with additional lighting, no story to tell, no WOW added. Just ... CDs<br/>I''m sorry thats brutal, but just meeting the challenge and photographing something circular is a waste of everyones time.<br/> <br/>I really do mean to help by making hard but truthful comments, I want you to take this  and say to yourself ''how could I have added something to the image to make the voters want to come back and look again''.<br/> <br/>I hope you don''t take this the wrong way.</td>', 'I really strugglr to comment on these without sounding rude. There is little or no merit intaking a snap of some CD arranged to represent the Olympic emblem. There is no attempt to add interest with additional lighting, no story to tell, no WOW added. Just ... CDsI''m sorry thats brutal, but just meeting the challenge and photographing something circular is a waste of everyones time. I really do mean to help by making hard but truthful comments, I want you to take this  and say to yourself ''how could I have added something to the image to make the voters want to come back and look again''. I hope you don''t take this the wrong way.', '2005-07-06 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
