(1512166, 199107, 27789, '<td valign="top">you''ve definitely nailed the challenge topic.  i think a few things could be done to spice this shot up and make it more compelling: i like the lighting on the globe but think it could be pushed further so that there was a greater difference between the highlights and the shadows, the background feels a little uncontrolled, with the folds in the blanket and the top right corner, the angle of the globe feels a little uninteresting, right smack dab across the equator, and a different angle might help.  These are just my own personal opinions, so take them for what they''re worth.  5</td>', 'you''ve definitely nailed the challenge topic.  i think a few things could be done to spice this shot up and make it more compelling: i like the lighting on the globe but think it could be pushed further so that there was a greater difference between the highlights and the shadows, the background feels a little uncontrolled, with the folds in the blanket and the top right corner, the angle of the globe feels a little uninteresting, right smack dab across the equator, and a different angle might help.  These are just my own personal opinions, so take them for what they''re worth.  5', '2005-07-06 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
