(1512185, 200430, 24512, '<td valign="top">Relevance to challenge (2): 1 - Cirlces are present but not dominant<br/>Color/Lighting/Exposure (2):  0.5 - Lighting/shadows are harsh and distract from the photo.  The bright orange of the pipes doesn''t blend well with the other colors<br/>Sharpness/Picture Quality (2): 1.5<br/>Composition (2): 0.5 - downward angle on the wall feels awkward, a tighter crop might have a better feel.<br/>Creativity/Originality (2): 0.5 - The bright orange of this pipe is eyecatching but otherwise not very exciting.<br/></td>', 'Relevance to challenge (2): 1 - Cirlces are present but not dominantColor/Lighting/Exposure (2):  0.5 - Lighting/shadows are harsh and distract from the photo.  The bright orange of the pipes doesn''t blend well with the other colorsSharpness/Picture Quality (2): 1.5Composition (2): 0.5 - downward angle on the wall feels awkward, a tighter crop might have a better feel.Creativity/Originality (2): 0.5 - The bright orange of this pipe is eyecatching but otherwise not very exciting.', '2005-07-06 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
