(1512323, 198864, 24454, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice circle composition.   I like it alot.   It''s nice how the reflection of the surroundings i si the ball.   Nice colors too.</td>', 'That''s a nice circle composition.   I like it alot.   It''s nice how the reflection of the surroundings i si the ball.   Nice colors too.', '2005-07-06 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
