(1512329, 198938, 2000, '<td valign="top">I had taken a few shots like this and chose not to submit because they''re not complete circles.  Fungi are fun to shoot though, and overall this is a great shot... I just don''t fit it so well into the challenge.  Your shot and my shot would both do very well in the Macro challenge.</td>', 'I had taken a few shots like this and chose not to submit because they''re not complete circles.  Fungi are fun to shoot though, and overall this is a great shot... I just don''t fit it so well into the challenge.  Your shot and my shot would both do very well in the Macro challenge.', '2005-07-06 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512330, 199761, 39664, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2005-07-06 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
