(1512341, 200398, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like that you got the hay bales while there was still some color to them... it adds an element of interest, along with alternating circles of green-ish and tan-ish.  Nice DOF too... 8 for now.</td>', 'I like that you got the hay bales while there was still some color to them... it adds an element of interest, along with alternating circles of green-ish and tan-ish.  Nice DOF too... 8 for now.', '2005-07-06 13:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512342, 200261, 39664, '<td valign="top">Nice china!  I really like your composition.</td>', 'Nice china!  I really like your composition.', '2005-07-06 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512343, 200530, 38087, '<td valign="top">flowers....with a twist....<br/>sorry I had to...haha  I like this!</td>', 'flowers....with a twist....sorry I had to...haha  I like this!', '2005-07-06 13:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512344, 199051, 35044, '<td valign="top">yellow colour cast unattractive.  subject very central - getting in a bit closer/cropping harder, might have added depth and interest.</td>', 'yellow colour cast unattractive.  subject very central - getting in a bit closer/cropping harder, might have added depth and interest.', '2005-07-06 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512346, 200428, 24512, '<td valign="top">Relevance to challenge (2): 2<br/>Color/Lighting/Exposure (2): 1-nice black background, subject stands out well.<br/>Sharpness/Picture Quality (2): 0.5-small<br/>Composition (2): 0.5-contrived, but you get half a point for the patience to set this up.<br/>Creativity/Originality (2): 1<br/></td>', 'Relevance to challenge (2): 2Color/Lighting/Exposure (2): 1-nice black background, subject stands out well.Sharpness/Picture Quality (2): 0.5-smallComposition (2): 0.5-contrived, but you get half a point for the patience to set this up.Creativity/Originality (2): 1', '2005-07-06 13:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512347, 200013, 772, '<td valign="top">Why did you choose to selectively desaturate and create eye catching pieces of this image that pull the viewer away from the subject?  This is an all too common method I see around here and I simply can''t understand why people choose to do it.</td>', 'Why did you choose to selectively desaturate and create eye catching pieces of this image that pull the viewer away from the subject?  This is an all too common method I see around here and I simply can''t understand why people choose to do it.', '2005-07-06 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512348, 200096, 2000, '<td valign="top">Part of me needs to know what this is... it''s just the way I work.  Since I can''t really tell, and the shot is too dark to make out much beyond bubbles, I just can''t give a high score.</td>', 'Part of me needs to know what this is... it''s just the way I work.  Since I can''t really tell, and the shot is too dark to make out much beyond bubbles, I just can''t give a high score.', '2005-07-06 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512349, 200016, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow! How''d you do this?</td>', 'Wow! How''d you do this?', '2005-07-06 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512350, 198493, 39830, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to a how you did that. :O)</td>', 'Looking forward to a how you did that. :O)', '2005-07-06 13:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512351, 198531, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love this photo.   The sharpness is spectacular, and your use of black and white, plus the way you have composed this is just perfect!   10</td>', 'Wow!  I love this photo.   The sharpness is spectacular, and your use of black and white, plus the way you have composed this is just perfect!   10', '2005-07-06 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512355, 200555, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice subject matter.  wood colours feel  a little dull.  lighting very flat - might be better in early mornign or late evening. lacking in real interest.</td>', 'nice subject matter.  wood colours feel  a little dull.  lighting very flat - might be better in early mornign or late evening. lacking in real interest.', '2005-07-06 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512356, 200495, 24454, '<td valign="top">Interesting colorization.   It looks a little like a painting.   I like it.</td>', 'Interesting colorization.   It looks a little like a painting.   I like it.', '2005-07-06 13:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512357, 198335, 2000, '<td valign="top">Here I thought this challenge had everything but... and you got the kitchen sink.  Very cool shot, neat colors and exposure.  9 for now... that may go up later on.</td>', 'Here I thought this challenge had everything but... and you got the kitchen sink.  Very cool shot, neat colors and exposure.  9 for now... that may go up later on.', '2005-07-06 13:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512359, 200283, 35044, '<td valign="top">not sure what this is, but it is too light - all that contrast wasted without deep blacks to lose yourself in!</td>', 'not sure what this is, but it is too light - all that contrast wasted without deep blacks to lose yourself in!', '2005-07-06 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512360, 200003, 39664, '<td valign="top">This must be somewhere over the big pond because they are all driving on the wrong side of the road!  Nice shot!</td>', 'This must be somewhere over the big pond because they are all driving on the wrong side of the road!  Nice shot!', '2005-07-06 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
