(1512363, 200043, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this.  There are several vintage car pictures in this challenge, but I never tire of looking at them.  All of them are different, and exceptionally well done.   Great job!!</td>', 'I love this.  There are several vintage car pictures in this challenge, but I never tire of looking at them.  All of them are different, and exceptionally well done.   Great job!!', '2005-07-06 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
