(1512375, 200724, 2000, '<td valign="top">I found the circles, but it took a second.  The layout of this seems to need a mirror image - if the circles were on the left I would have seen them right away.</td>', 'I found the circles, but it took a second.  The layout of this seems to need a mirror image - if the circles were on the left I would have seen them right away.', '2005-07-06 13:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
