(1512403, 199388, 2000, '<td valign="top">Simply blown out in the midde... I believe this is one of those rubber ''cause'' bracelets, and that would be a circle.  The only focal circles in the shot are the ''O''s in the words.</td>', 'Simply blown out in the midde... I believe this is one of those rubber ''cause'' bracelets, and that would be a circle.  The only focal circles in the shot are the ''O''s in the words.', '2005-07-06 14:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
