(1512442, 200592, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really neat.  Good focus.  I like the texture of the circle.  Neat looking.  I like how you have placed the subject to the left of the photo.  Lack of color works here.  I think it helps to concentrate on the texture.  Nice black background.  nothing distracting there.  I think the lighting was good also for showing the little pointy things.  Kind of looks like a firework on a stick.  lol  Overall pleasing to look at and technically well done.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Really neat.  Good focus.  I like the texture of the circle.  Neat looking.  I like how you have placed the subject to the left of the photo.  Lack of color works here.  I think it helps to concentrate on the texture.  Nice black background.  nothing distracting there.  I think the lighting was good also for showing the little pointy things.  Kind of looks like a firework on a stick.  lol  Overall pleasing to look at and technically well done.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-06 14:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
