(1512458, 200392, 25577, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped it just a bit tighter on the bottom just enough to loose the edge of the roof...it creates static in the composition, great eye on subject, my favorite motion circle.</td>', 'I would have cropped it just a bit tighter on the bottom just enough to loose the edge of the roof...it creates static in the composition, great eye on subject, my favorite motion circle.', '2005-07-06 14:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
