(1512691, 200694, 35149, '<td valign="top">I love pics of the eyes - I would like to have seen the reflection of the circle of your camera lense in the eyes..That would have made it a 10 for me still very great shot (9)</td>', 'I love pics of the eyes - I would like to have seen the reflection of the circle of your camera lense in the eyes..That would have made it a 10 for me still very great shot (9)', '2005-07-06 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512693, 199588, 35329, '<td valign="top">How fortunate to find such an original circle. I wish the color popped a little more...maybe just more saturation or a little more contrast (not too much tho).</td>', 'How fortunate to find such an original circle. I wish the color popped a little more...maybe just more saturation or a little more contrast (not too much tho).', '2005-07-06 15:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512697, 200442, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot - I love the way the bubbles happen to be arranged in the frame and the sense of motion from the child running.  I wish the white balance was whiter and the little car and toy dump truck weren''t there - it would simplify the composition.  But overall a great shot.  8</td>', 'Very fun shot - I love the way the bubbles happen to be arranged in the frame and the sense of motion from the child running.  I wish the white balance was whiter and the little car and toy dump truck weren''t there - it would simplify the composition.  But overall a great shot.  8', '2005-07-06 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512699, 197887, 35329, '<td valign="top">I love ones that I haven''t seen a million times. Nice use of light and color.</td>', 'I love ones that I haven''t seen a million times. Nice use of light and color.', '2005-07-06 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512705, 200003, 35329, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the motion shot. A little different to let it stand out. Good job.</td>', 'I like this take on the motion shot. A little different to let it stand out. Good job.', '2005-07-06 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512709, 200569, 35329, '<td valign="top">I nearly took this same image. ;)</td>', 'I nearly took this same image. ;)', '2005-07-06 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512710, 200352, 39664, '<td valign="top">Simple and delicious!</td>', 'Simple and delicious!', '2005-07-06 15:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512711, 199424, 39675, '<td valign="top">how did you get the background to be totally white?  Love the feel of the photo. - 10</td>', 'how did you get the background to be totally white?  Love the feel of the photo. - 10', '2005-07-06 15:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512713, 199955, 29269, '<td valign="top">It is too small (no, I''m not complaining, just realizing that DPC format is not conducive to panoramic photos - you are using max width here). For this reason, I would avoid submitting panoramas to DPC challenges.<br/>It seems as if the bottom and the right side are cut off - that the canvas is a pixel or two bigger than it should be.<br/>Otherwise, in my opinion of course, there should either be more of the sky shown in the photo, or no sky at all. This way it looks artificially cut off. The field itself is lacking contrast in the details.</td>', 'It is too small (no, I''m not complaining, just realizing that DPC format is not conducive to panoramic photos - you are using max width here). For this reason, I would avoid submitting panoramas to DPC challenges.It seems as if the bottom and the right side are cut off - that the canvas is a pixel or two bigger than it should be.Otherwise, in my opinion of course, there should either be more of the sky shown in the photo, or no sky at all. This way it looks artificially cut off. The field itself is lacking contrast in the details.', '2005-07-06 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512715, 198387, 39664, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know Tums came in those colors!  :-)  Cute idea!</td>', 'I didn''t know Tums came in those colors!  :-)  Cute idea!', '2005-07-06 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1);
