(1513033, 200076, 6667, '<td valign="top">Seems somewhat over sharpened. Neat idea and beautiful model. One more comment: wish the background was of a lighter or darker depth to further accent the hair ringlets.  Except for her, the tone is too grayish. Needs more contrast to really be effective (IMHO).  BOL</td>', 'Seems somewhat over sharpened. Neat idea and beautiful model. One more comment: wish the background was of a lighter or darker depth to further accent the hair ringlets.  Except for her, the tone is too grayish. Needs more contrast to really be effective (IMHO).  BOL', '2005-07-06 16:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
