(1513046, 199877, 31403, '<td valign="top">very cool, do you have an outtake where the center circle is off-center?  The centered composition is the only thing I would change - excellent photo and great creative vision - 8</td>', 'very cool, do you have an outtake where the center circle is off-center?  The centered composition is the only thing I would change - excellent photo and great creative vision - 8', '2005-07-06 16:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513047, 199368, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love these plants.   They photograph so well.  I love the blue tones you used to make this unique and stand out.</td>', 'I love these plants.   They photograph so well.  I love the blue tones you used to make this unique and stand out.', '2005-07-06 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513051, 199888, 6667, '<td valign="top">. . . and IMJEALOUS .  Very nice. BOL 7  My only comment is ( and my own personal preference) that the image be larger.</td>', '. . . and IMJEALOUS .  Very nice. BOL 7  My only comment is ( and my own personal preference) that the image be larger.', '2005-07-06 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513053, 199717, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.   I love the color and the sharp focus.</td>', 'This is beautiful.   I love the color and the sharp focus.', '2005-07-06 16:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513055, 198923, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this!   I just love the soft pastel colors that fade into the white.   This is really one of my favorites.   10</td>', 'I love this!   I just love the soft pastel colors that fade into the white.   This is really one of my favorites.   10', '2005-07-06 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513056, 199119, 31403, '<td valign="top">crop it down tighter so that building on the left and the shapes on the right are gone, and you''ve got a 10!  I really really like this, the color is very nice, and the blown highlights really work for me - so don''t let those other commenters tell you it''s too bright, cause they are wrong!  :)  8</td>', 'crop it down tighter so that building on the left and the shapes on the right are gone, and you''ve got a 10!  I really really like this, the color is very nice, and the blown highlights really work for me - so don''t let those other commenters tell you it''s too bright, cause they are wrong!  :)  8', '2005-07-06 16:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513058, 200750, 5354, '<td valign="top">OMG coins and CD''s, I''m sorry but this is just boring. I know thats rude but please give the voters something interesting to look at. Do us the honour of putting a little thought into your submissin and not just finding the first three round things and taking a photo. DPC is about challenging photography not a scavenger hunt.</td>', 'OMG coins and CD''s, I''m sorry but this is just boring. I know thats rude but please give the voters something interesting to look at. Do us the honour of putting a little thought into your submissin and not just finding the first three round things and taking a photo. DPC is about challenging photography not a scavenger hunt.', '2005-07-06 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513063, 200309, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww. . . .you''ve touched a soft spot in my heart.   Beautiful colors, and its just a lovely display of circles.</td>', 'Awwwwwww. . . .you''ve touched a soft spot in my heart.   Beautiful colors, and its just a lovely display of circles.', '2005-07-06 16:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513064, 200737, 39675, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me want to see the entire car (as a classic car collector)</td>', 'This shot makes me want to see the entire car (as a classic car collector)', '2005-07-06 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513068, 198768, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s really cool.  The black circle in the upper right is unfortunate, but such a small nit pick.  Very well done, and a beautiful image 8</td>', 'that''s really cool.  The black circle in the upper right is unfortunate, but such a small nit pick.  Very well done, and a beautiful image 8', '2005-07-06 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513071, 200703, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the light from the right.  Seems to lack some sharpness.</td>', 'I like the sky and the light from the right.  Seems to lack some sharpness.', '2005-07-06 16:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513073, 198735, 39278, '<td valign="top">i just love it...its the first picture i vote and so ill be generous...very optimistic dunno why:)</td>', 'i just love it...its the first picture i vote and so ill be generous...very optimistic dunno why:)', '2005-07-06 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513074, 200076, 35804, '<td valign="top">Such a cute idea! IMO this would have been so much nicer with better light...the light here seems a bit harsh and direct...too "flash"...some side lighting aimed mainly at the curls with just hints of the models face would have been fantastic. ..and though I am a huge fan of B &amp; W I really think this would be nice in color against a darker background...regardless, this is still a really fun idea!</td>', 'Such a cute idea! IMO this would have been so much nicer with better light...the light here seems a bit harsh and direct...too "flash"...some side lighting aimed mainly at the curls with just hints of the models face would have been fantastic. ..and though I am a huge fan of B & W I really think this would be nice in color against a darker background...regardless, this is still a really fun idea!', '2005-07-06 16:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513075, 199070, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very creative way to meet the challenge. I like it. 6</td>', 'Very creative way to meet the challenge. I like it. 6', '2005-07-06 16:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513077, 200463, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative. Nice line.</td>', 'Creative. Nice line.', '2005-07-06 16:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
