(1513132, 200115, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is great, I love the concept, but there is too much information.  If you had just the tire of the mower over to the back of his heel in the shot, then all the distractions of the background and foreground are gone, the angle of the foot is so cool, the fact that it''s a dress shoe, and the grass flying - it has so much going for it - and so much to distract.  So do this all again at a different time of day, and I''ll give you your 10!  Really nice work - great eye 7</td>', 'this is great, I love the concept, but there is too much information.  If you had just the tire of the mower over to the back of his heel in the shot, then all the distractions of the background and foreground are gone, the angle of the foot is so cool, the fact that it''s a dress shoe, and the grass flying - it has so much going for it - and so much to distract.  So do this all again at a different time of day, and I''ll give you your 10!  Really nice work - great eye 7', '2005-07-06 16:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
