(1513339, 198958, 3932, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that the voters aren''t going to pay attention to your circle as much as they should... a big circle saying NO lol... I love the irony of the shot. The saturation of the sky, and the contrast of the white clouds and black sign work very well. - 8 - JeB</td>', 'I have a feeling that the voters aren''t going to pay attention to your circle as much as they should... a big circle saying NO lol... I love the irony of the shot. The saturation of the sky, and the contrast of the white clouds and black sign work very well. - 8 - JeB', '2005-07-06 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513343, 199544, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, i think it would be a stronger composition without the dark "wheel" object in the background.  - 6- JeB</td>', 'This is a neat shot, i think it would be a stronger composition without the dark "wheel" object in the background.  - 6- JeB', '2005-07-06 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513344, 200239, 3932, '<td valign="top">I love handmade paper!!! It makes for excellent mats! There is a little bit of harsh lighting that distracts me a bit, as well as the front left paper in the foreground being out of focus. For some reason, my eyes keep looking at that point. - 6 JeB</td>', 'I love handmade paper!!! It makes for excellent mats! There is a little bit of harsh lighting that distracts me a bit, as well as the front left paper in the foreground being out of focus. For some reason, my eyes keep looking at that point. - 6 JeB', '2005-07-06 17:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513346, 199816, 3932, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great colors! I am not an expert on lighting so I can''t make suggestions no the lighting, but the shadows being cast distract me. Maybe counter balancing the light on the other side would help? - 7 - JeB</td>', 'Good idea, great colors! I am not an expert on lighting so I can''t make suggestions no the lighting, but the shadows being cast distract me. Maybe counter balancing the light on the other side would help? - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 17:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
