(1513351, 200557, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow, what exactly is this object??? Neat circles even though they aren''t COMPLETE circles, I complete them in my head, which means it fits the challenge to me! :) The blackness of this makes me think I am in space, which works with the title, I believe. Nice focus and clarity - 8 - JeB</td>', 'Wow, what exactly is this object??? Neat circles even though they aren''t COMPLETE circles, I complete them in my head, which means it fits the challenge to me! :) The blackness of this makes me think I am in space, which works with the title, I believe. Nice focus and clarity - 8 - JeB', '2005-07-06 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
