(1513380, 198963, 3932, '<td valign="top">Neat shot... it''s a reflection of the spinning/falling chip, right? :) I like the negative space used in this shot... and normally I wouldn''t favor the muted tones, but it works well in this shot.Very original! - 8 - JeB</td>', 'Neat shot... it''s a reflection of the spinning/falling chip, right? :) I like the negative space used in this shot... and normally I wouldn''t favor the muted tones, but it works well in this shot.Very original! - 8 - JeB', '2005-07-06 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
