(1513711, 198426, 37719, '<td valign="top">Too bright!  The lighting is very harsh and makes the shot hard to look at and takes away from some of the natural geometry oin the shot.</td>', 'Too bright!  The lighting is very harsh and makes the shot hard to look at and takes away from some of the natural geometry oin the shot.', '2005-07-06 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513712, 200119, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is a photo I think could benefit from a wider angle. It''s nice to see the detail in the fur and whiskers, but the action could be better portrayed by pulling back a little and showing us the whole dog.</td>', 'This is a photo I think could benefit from a wider angle. It''s nice to see the detail in the fur and whiskers, but the action could be better portrayed by pulling back a little and showing us the whole dog.', '2005-07-06 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513715, 198056, 36353, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The colors are rich and the view is interesting. The title is the same as mine as well!</td>', 'I love this shot. The colors are rich and the view is interesting. The title is the same as mine as well!', '2005-07-06 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513719, 200448, 35645, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but it''s just enough out of focus to make me not want to look at it. It makes me feel like I''ve forgotten my glasses.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but it''s just enough out of focus to make me not want to look at it. It makes me feel like I''ve forgotten my glasses.', '2005-07-06 18:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513721, 198174, 37719, '<td valign="top">I wish the reflected light wasn''t boosted so much.  Makes it hard to look at.  I think it would have been a stronger entry if not so much processing and more natural.  The bell of an instrument has a lot of character in and of itself.  I wish I could see more of it.</td>', 'I wish the reflected light wasn''t boosted so much.  Makes it hard to look at.  I think it would have been a stronger entry if not so much processing and more natural.  The bell of an instrument has a lot of character in and of itself.  I wish I could see more of it.', '2005-07-06 18:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513725, 200393, 3932, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of contininuity!!!!  This will be a very strong image with just a little editing! - 7 - JeB</td>', 'Awesome use of contininuity!!!!  This will be a very strong image with just a little editing! - 7 - JeB', '2005-07-06 18:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513726, 200115, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint and composition.</td>', 'Good viewpoint and composition.', '2005-07-06 18:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513727, 200294, 37719, '<td valign="top">On first pass, I passed.  On second I began to appreciate it for the creativity of the shot.  On third pass you got me.  Good idea, well executed, creative!  Nice job!</td>', 'On first pass, I passed.  On second I began to appreciate it for the creativity of the shot.  On third pass you got me.  Good idea, well executed, creative!  Nice job!', '2005-07-06 18:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513730, 200709, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - nice detail and very good clarity/focus.  I find the contrast between the straight lines of the wood and the circles of the iron very well complemented.  My only desire3 would be to see the shot from a more straight on perspective.  But oh well.  Nice job!  Well done!</td>', 'I like this shot - nice detail and very good clarity/focus.  I find the contrast between the straight lines of the wood and the circles of the iron very well complemented.  My only desire3 would be to see the shot from a more straight on perspective.  But oh well.  Nice job!  Well done!', '2005-07-06 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513736, 200714, 37719, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the chuckle!  Every time I viewed this I chuckled and bumped you up another notch.  The shot is clear and I like the balance between reflection and directness in the lighting.  Could be a little softer on Woody, but the circle is nice.  Ducky, well....</td>', 'Thanks for the chuckle!  Every time I viewed this I chuckled and bumped you up another notch.  The shot is clear and I like the balance between reflection and directness in the lighting.  Could be a little softer on Woody, but the circle is nice.  Ducky, well....', '2005-07-06 19:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513743, 198507, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very refreshing change.  Well done.</td>', 'A very refreshing change.  Well done.', '2005-07-06 19:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513744, 198843, 37719, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been stronger with different lighting and a slightly different crop - lose the left side to the hay and perhaps a little less sky.  It looks like it was taken in mid afternoon.  Levels adjust to bring out more detail in the hay maybe?</td>', 'I think this could have been stronger with different lighting and a slightly different crop - lose the left side to the hay and perhaps a little less sky.  It looks like it was taken in mid afternoon.  Levels adjust to bring out more detail in the hay maybe?', '2005-07-06 19:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513748, 199075, 37719, '<td valign="top">Hmm....I see no circles.  A lot of C''s, but no circles.  Nothing in the shot invokes a feeling of passion either.</td>', 'Hmm....I see no circles.  A lot of C''s, but no circles.  Nothing in the shot invokes a feeling of passion either.', '2005-07-06 19:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513752, 198916, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice shot, wish it was larger</td>', 'nice shot, wish it was larger', '2005-07-06 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513757, 200564, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the b/w - sepia? toning of the picture.  Good balance in the shadows - definitely add to the shot.  The DoF may have been a little better, but all in all a very nice capture.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the b/w - sepia? toning of the picture.  Good balance in the shadows - definitely add to the shot.  The DoF may have been a little better, but all in all a very nice capture.  Nice job!', '2005-07-06 19:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513761, 200560, 39976, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower!</td>', 'Interesting flower!', '2005-07-06 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513763, 200189, 24642, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge.  Great lighting, good viewpoint, brilliant composition and totally captures the spirit of youth.  -10</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge.  Great lighting, good viewpoint, brilliant composition and totally captures the spirit of youth.  -10', '2005-07-06 19:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513765, 198400, 24642, '<td valign="top">I can hear the message.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'I can hear the message.Good work.', '2005-07-06 19:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513767, 200444, 24642, '<td valign="top">Well done classic.</td>', 'Well done classic.', '2005-07-06 19:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513768, 198768, 37719, '<td valign="top">Got me on the second pass, hooked me on the third.  I really like the colors in this shot.  The lighting is good too.  I appreciate how you got the inside of the spring to reflect the light, but not the top.  The angle is good too since the shadow doesn''t compete with the subject.  Perspective on the shot if perfect.  My only criticisms would be the dark spot in upper right and oof in lower left.  Perhaps a different crop to bring the subject out of the distance and more up front?</td>', 'Got me on the second pass, hooked me on the third.  I really like the colors in this shot.  The lighting is good too.  I appreciate how you got the inside of the spring to reflect the light, but not the top.  The angle is good too since the shadow doesn''t compete with the subject.  Perspective on the shot if perfect.  My only criticisms would be the dark spot in upper right and oof in lower left.  Perhaps a different crop to bring the subject out of the distance and more up front?', '2005-07-06 19:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513769, 200737, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.</td>', 'Great use of light.', '2005-07-06 19:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513770, 199358, 39566, '<td valign="top">very, very cute!</td>', 'very, very cute!', '2005-07-06 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513774, 200316, 37719, '<td valign="top">Creative and using some imagination - not in abundance in this challenge.  I like the reflected lines in the shot.  The light and dark areas in the glass are incongruent which makes the dark and light separation work all the more.  Nice shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Creative and using some imagination - not in abundance in this challenge.  I like the reflected lines in the shot.  The light and dark areas in the glass are incongruent which makes the dark and light separation work all the more.  Nice shot.  Well done!', '2005-07-06 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513776, 200013, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work.  A very refreshing change to see a real-life shot.</td>', 'Good work.  A very refreshing change to see a real-life shot.', '2005-07-06 19:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513777, 200174, 39566, '<td valign="top">I really like this, very unique.</td>', 'I really like this, very unique.', '2005-07-06 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513781, 198136, 37719, '<td valign="top">Did you know this is not round?  JOKING!  This is a great shot!  I love the colors and lighting.  Very well done.  It has a very fluid look which I think lends it a mysterious aura so to speak.  You were obviously close to your subject which makes the lighting even more important and you pulled it off nicely!    The mystery is deepened all the more by the bubbles.  Turns you in a different direction and gets you thinking along a different set of lines.  A lot from this shot with very little.  A favorite for sure!  10 from me.  Nice job!  Very creative and imaginative!  Rare in this challenge.  Extremely well done!</td>', 'Did you know this is not round?  JOKING!  This is a great shot!  I love the colors and lighting.  Very well done.  It has a very fluid look which I think lends it a mysterious aura so to speak.  You were obviously close to your subject which makes the lighting even more important and you pulled it off nicely!    The mystery is deepened all the more by the bubbles.  Turns you in a different direction and gets you thinking along a different set of lines.  A lot from this shot with very little.  A favorite for sure!  10 from me.  Nice job!  Very creative and imaginative!  Rare in this challenge.  Extremely well done!', '2005-07-06 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513785, 199995, 39566, '<td valign="top">tacky</td>', 'tacky', '2005-07-06 19:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513786, 199715, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!  Not sure what it is but doesn''t really matter either.  Colors are great!  Strong and subtle at the same time.  Lighting is good - no glare/reflected spots.  Interesting and creative.  Well done!</td>', 'Very interesting photo!  Not sure what it is but doesn''t really matter either.  Colors are great!  Strong and subtle at the same time.  Lighting is good - no glare/reflected spots.  Interesting and creative.  Well done!', '2005-07-06 19:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513794, 200005, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nce shot.  Well composed and good clarity.</td>', 'Nce shot.  Well composed and good clarity.', '2005-07-06 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513805, 198489, 33672, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail.</td>', 'Amazing detail.', '2005-07-06 19:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513819, 198349, 19944, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a circle. Otherwise I really like the motion.</td>', 'I don''t see a circle. Otherwise I really like the motion.', '2005-07-06 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513821, 200718, 1024, '<td valign="top">The focus is just a little bit soft.  Your colors are vibrant though.  This is a shot you might want to try again but using a tripod.</td>', 'The focus is just a little bit soft.  Your colors are vibrant though.  This is a shot you might want to try again but using a tripod.', '2005-07-06 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1513822, 199059, 1024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful complimentary colors</td>', 'Beautiful complimentary colors', '2005-07-06 19:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513829, 200440, 33672, '<td valign="top">The comp and idea are great, but there''s a need for more "pop" in the colors and contrast.</td>', 'The comp and idea are great, but there''s a need for more "pop" in the colors and contrast.', '2005-07-06 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513834, 200571, 19780, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a cookie and I thought ... YUM!<br/> <br/>Then I realized it was foam, no less yummy.<br/> <br/>The colors and direction light are wonderfully accomplished for such an everyday subject. <br/> <br/>The centered composition is balanced by the off-centered lighting and full-black background. 9</td>', 'At first I thought this was a cookie and I thought ... YUM! Then I realized it was foam, no less yummy. The colors and direction light are wonderfully accomplished for such an everyday subject.  The centered composition is balanced by the off-centered lighting and full-black background. 9', '2005-07-06 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513844, 200284, 38592, '<td valign="top">I think this would work a little better with a tighter crop and perhaps a bit closer.</td>', 'I think this would work a little better with a tighter crop and perhaps a bit closer.', '2005-07-06 19:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513847, 200584, 38592, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the James Bond image.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of the James Bond image.  Nice shot.', '2005-07-06 19:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513850, 200560, 38592, '<td valign="top">Great subject however I think there is too much noise.</td>', 'Great subject however I think there is too much noise.', '2005-07-06 19:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513860, 198843, 34759, '<td valign="top">The sunlight seemed very bright, which resulted in a washed out look.  I think messing with the levels and contrast would have improved this a lot. It''s a nice composition.</td>', 'The sunlight seemed very bright, which resulted in a washed out look.  I think messing with the levels and contrast would have improved this a lot. It''s a nice composition.', '2005-07-06 20:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513864, 200742, 34759, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great idea!</td>', 'I really like this. Great idea!', '2005-07-06 20:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513867, 197946, 36888, '<td valign="top">seems a little flat, but I still like the shot</td>', 'seems a little flat, but I still like the shot', '2005-07-06 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513871, 200334, 35947, '<td valign="top">This is really cool!  Only issue IMO is the 2 extra bright spots.</td>', 'This is really cool!  Only issue IMO is the 2 extra bright spots.', '2005-07-06 20:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513876, 200314, 35947, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems pretty dark.</td>', 'Lighting seems pretty dark.', '2005-07-06 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513879, 199544, 35135, '<td valign="top">Make my funk the P-Funk...</td>', 'Make my funk the P-Funk...', '2005-07-06 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513891, 200076, 15266, '<td valign="top">A creative take on the challenge, I like that.  Nice lighting and a lovely subject, but the image is a bit flat. Bumping contrast a touch might help, but probably needed to add another, softer light source low and near her face.  (That would also serve to remove the dark shadow beneath her face.)  8</td>', 'A creative take on the challenge, I like that.  Nice lighting and a lovely subject, but the image is a bit flat. Bumping contrast a touch might help, but probably needed to add another, softer light source low and near her face.  (That would also serve to remove the dark shadow beneath her face.)  8', '2005-07-06 20:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513892, 200305, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the textures in this one, great clarity and colors.  Nice job</td>', 'I love the textures in this one, great clarity and colors.  Nice job', '2005-07-06 20:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513893, 199882, 15266, '<td valign="top">So far, my favorite of the challenge.  Only wish it were larger and with a bit more light on the front of the wrapper.</td>', 'So far, my favorite of the challenge.  Only wish it were larger and with a bit more light on the front of the wrapper.', '2005-07-06 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513896, 200720, 1024, '<td valign="top">Circles within a circle.  The spoon adds a bit of drama as well.  This maybe the best of the cereal photos.</td>', 'Circles within a circle.  The spoon adds a bit of drama as well.  This maybe the best of the cereal photos.', '2005-07-06 20:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513897, 200444, 15266, '<td valign="top">Graceful and elegant.  Nicely exposed.</td>', 'Graceful and elegant.  Nicely exposed.', '2005-07-06 20:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513900, 198604, 40130, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2005-07-06 20:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513904, 200292, 1024, '<td valign="top">There is something about the stark beauty of a flower shot in black and white.  i am such a sucker for these!</td>', 'There is something about the stark beauty of a flower shot in black and white.  i am such a sucker for these!', '2005-07-06 20:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513905, 198489, 35947, '<td valign="top">OMG!!!  Is it real?  Great expression!</td>', 'OMG!!!  Is it real?  Great expression!', '2005-07-06 20:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513907, 200584, 15266, '<td valign="top">Stylish and classy.  The composition works well.  I would like to see more light on the front of the subject, thus more detail in his clothing and face.........or total silhouette.</td>', 'Stylish and classy.  The composition works well.  I would like to see more light on the front of the subject, thus more detail in his clothing and face.........or total silhouette.', '2005-07-06 20:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513909, 198603, 35947, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2005-07-06 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513910, 199874, 1024, '<td valign="top">The overall concept is great, but unfortunately some of your highlights are really washed out.</td>', 'The overall concept is great, but unfortunately some of your highlights are really washed out.', '2005-07-06 20:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513913, 200735, 1024, '<td valign="top">A wonderful childhood photograph, but the border is a bit too much.</td>', 'A wonderful childhood photograph, but the border is a bit too much.', '2005-07-06 20:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513914, 198619, 15266, '<td valign="top">Aweeeeee someone requested validation.  They just didn''t get the tech involved I suppose.  I really like this shot, only wish there was more light on his face.  Seems so much light hit the shirt (wrinkled), but very little got to the main part of the face (no catchlights in left eye).</td>', 'Aweeeeee someone requested validation.  They just didn''t get the tech involved I suppose.  I really like this shot, only wish there was more light on his face.  Seems so much light hit the shirt (wrinkled), but very little got to the main part of the face (no catchlights in left eye).', '2005-07-06 20:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513936, 199882, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Love the motion!</td>', 'Great shot!  Love the motion!', '2005-07-06 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513938, 200203, 40128, '<td valign="top">this is not a circle!</td>', 'this is not a circle!', '2005-07-06 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
