(1513995, 197966, 19066, '<td valign="top">I see what you were getting at, but i think the crop ruined an otherwise great shot.  Either crop closer to hide the rounded edges of the tray, or zoom out  to include more of the background... perhaps against a black backdrop.</td>', 'I see what you were getting at, but i think the crop ruined an otherwise great shot.  Either crop closer to hide the rounded edges of the tray, or zoom out  to include more of the background... perhaps against a black backdrop.', '2005-07-06 20:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
