(1514082, 198916, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot, but you need to size your photo so that it is 640 pixels on the longest side!  This photo is way too small!  Great perspective and nice use of shallow DOF.  Connection to circle concept may be a bit weak, though, for most voters'' tastes.  Looking forward to seeing more entries from you that are 640 pixels long and/or wide!</td>', 'This is a really cool shot, but you need to size your photo so that it is 640 pixels on the longest side!  This photo is way too small!  Great perspective and nice use of shallow DOF.  Connection to circle concept may be a bit weak, though, for most voters'' tastes.  Looking forward to seeing more entries from you that are 640 pixels long and/or wide!', '2005-07-06 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514083, 200336, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat, very graphic image. Don''t think I could have done any better. Like how the ones on the outside are out of focus. It would  pop better if the ones in focus were really sharp, and maybe if there was a little more contrast? Little  linty things take away a little, but I do like it.</td>', 'This is a really neat, very graphic image. Don''t think I could have done any better. Like how the ones on the outside are out of focus. It would  pop better if the ones in focus were really sharp, and maybe if there was a little more contrast? Little  linty things take away a little, but I do like it.', '2005-07-06 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514085, 199934, 31200, '<td valign="top">simple and eye catching..very nicely done...</td>', 'simple and eye catching..very nicely done...', '2005-07-06 21:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
