(1514099, 199903, 20530, '<td valign="top">Grew up around rodeos and don''t really care for them, because of what the animals go through. That''s just my opinion and it won''t affect my scoring on this shot. That  is about as perfect as a shot like that can get. Love the DOF and how the dust helps to seperate the foreground and background. If you don''t make money on this type of photograph, you certainly could.</td>', 'Grew up around rodeos and don''t really care for them, because of what the animals go through. That''s just my opinion and it won''t affect my scoring on this shot. That  is about as perfect as a shot like that can get. Love the DOF and how the dust helps to seperate the foreground and background. If you don''t make money on this type of photograph, you certainly could.', '2005-07-06 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
