(1514209, 198780, 27763, '<td valign="top">IMO, a shot like this should be perfectly horizontal or tilted at a crazy angle.  As it is, you are only tilted at a slight angle, and I don''t like that.  It just looks like you didn''t pay attention to details (i.e. looks like you just forgot to straighten it)</td>', 'IMO, a shot like this should be perfectly horizontal or tilted at a crazy angle.  As it is, you are only tilted at a slight angle, and I don''t like that.  It just looks like you didn''t pay attention to details (i.e. looks like you just forgot to straighten it)', '2005-07-06 22:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514210, 198736, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this, your choice of background color, and the border which enhances it very nicely. Well positioned within the frame, and nicely lit. Good eye! 7</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this, your choice of background color, and the border which enhances it very nicely. Well positioned within the frame, and nicely lit. Good eye! 7', '2005-07-06 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514211, 200392, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Good job.</td>', 'Cool.  Good job.', '2005-07-06 22:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514212, 200203, 35605, '<td valign="top">Base Score 5<br/>LCP +2<br/>Top 5 in challenge +1<br/>Added to my favorites +1<br/>Total Score 9<br/> <br/>Highest score I''ve given since I started my new scoring system...I don''t give 10''s, but this one is close...I love so much about it...<br/> <br/>Very Crisp<br/>Great lines (would have won the leading lines challenge)<br/>Great colors<br/>Great Composition<br/>Good choice of frame...<br/> <br/>That''s enough...moving on now or I''ll never quit raving about this one...<br/> <br/>GREAT!</td>', 'Base Score 5LCP +2Top 5 in challenge +1Added to my favorites +1Total Score 9 Highest score I''ve given since I started my new scoring system...I don''t give 10''s, but this one is close...I love so much about it... Very CrispGreat lines (would have won the leading lines challenge)Great colorsGreat CompositionGood choice of frame... That''s enough...moving on now or I''ll never quit raving about this one... GREAT!', '2005-07-06 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
