(1514223, 200733, 35605, '<td valign="top">Base Score 5<br/>LCP +2<br/>Total Score 7<br/> <br/>Nice shot...only negative for me it that I would crop the subject a little more onto the upper left third mark...Good choice on background and frame</td>', 'Base Score 5LCP +2Total Score 7 Nice shot...only negative for me it that I would crop the subject a little more onto the upper left third mark...Good choice on background and frame', '2005-07-06 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514224, 197879, 38072, '<td valign="top">Hmm..   a nice picture, but it''s barely a circle -- to me.  I think it could have been very interesting if you could have caught the sun more in line with the face of the wall there -- casting some nice shadows too.</td>', 'Hmm..   a nice picture, but it''s barely a circle -- to me.  I think it could have been very interesting if you could have caught the sun more in line with the face of the wall there -- casting some nice shadows too.', '2005-07-06 22:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514227, 200356, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like "ball full of circles" idea.  The bright side of the ball is a little bright, but I know how difficult that can be to rectify in the open challenges -- I''ve struggled with it myself.</td>', 'I like "ball full of circles" idea.  The bright side of the ball is a little bright, but I know how difficult that can be to rectify in the open challenges -- I''ve struggled with it myself.', '2005-07-06 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514228, 199138, 38072, '<td valign="top">Difficult to see what I''m looking at -- it could have been a lot better without the OOF leaf in front of the subject.  Also, the circle (the eye) is pretty small to pick up as a major element of the shot. -- 3</td>', 'Difficult to see what I''m looking at -- it could have been a lot better without the OOF leaf in front of the subject.  Also, the circle (the eye) is pretty small to pick up as a major element of the shot. -- 3', '2005-07-06 22:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514230, 200456, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like the nice dark background, and the focus is good over the whole image.</td>', 'I like the nice dark background, and the focus is good over the whole image.', '2005-07-06 22:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514231, 198956, 31403, '<td valign="top">if this was a visual scavenger hunt, you would score a 10 for sure.  that is one big cirle - however the harsh light, the shadow of someone who didn''t move makes this look like a one time snap shot.  Sadly, those will never do well on DPC.  I mean this well, it''s a fun photo.  I hope it helps you see why it is scoring low.</td>', 'if this was a visual scavenger hunt, you would score a 10 for sure.  that is one big cirle - however the harsh light, the shadow of someone who didn''t move makes this look like a one time snap shot.  Sadly, those will never do well on DPC.  I mean this well, it''s a fun photo.  I hope it helps you see why it is scoring low.', '2005-07-06 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
