(1514234, 198056, 38072, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  I eyed a few manholes for this challenge as well.  The gold color is nice.  I would have liked to see the whole lid in sharp focus.  6</td>', 'I really like this one.  I eyed a few manholes for this challenge as well.  The gold color is nice.  I would have liked to see the whole lid in sharp focus.  6', '2005-07-06 22:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
