(1514258, 198357, 3080, '<td valign="top">With over 540 images to vote and comment on, I wish people could refrain from entering photos that they themselves don''t even like just so they can have ''something'' in the challenge.  I''m assuming you already know what''s ''wrong'' with the photo, but with the large number of entries, I"m trying to give a large number of comments, so I''ll tell you what I see.<br/>A good percentage of the image isout of focus.  By the largeness of the outter circle, it appears that THAT would be the main subject and therefor would seem that that part should be in focus.  I realize that you were shooting for the center to be the ''main subject'' but it just doesn''t come across that way to me.  The lighting is harsh.  Reflections in the CD are very distracting and the large white reflection at the top is blown out/white.  The center circle doesn''t appears to be not in the center of the CD, making this look like a quick kind of shot.  The centered composition isn''t very visually appealing and the greyish kind of background doesn''t really acentuate the subject very well.  I hope this doesn''t come across as too harsh, but in the same respect, I hope it helps you out in your further photography.  ~Heather~</td>', 'With over 540 images to vote and comment on, I wish people could refrain from entering photos that they themselves don''t even like just so they can have ''something'' in the challenge.  I''m assuming you already know what''s ''wrong'' with the photo, but with the large number of entries, I"m trying to give a large number of comments, so I''ll tell you what I see.A good percentage of the image isout of focus.  By the largeness of the outter circle, it appears that THAT would be the main subject and therefor would seem that that part should be in focus.  I realize that you were shooting for the center to be the ''main subject'' but it just doesn''t come across that way to me.  The lighting is harsh.  Reflections in the CD are very distracting and the large white reflection at the top is blown out/white.  The center circle doesn''t appears to be not in the center of the CD, making this look like a quick kind of shot.  The centered composition isn''t very visually appealing and the greyish kind of background doesn''t really acentuate the subject very well.  I hope this doesn''t come across as too harsh, but in the same respect, I hope it helps you out in your further photography.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-06 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514266, 200310, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here.  I would have loved to see this with a faster shutter to stop some of that motion blur -- maybe not all of it, but some at least.  It would have been great to get this without all the white-clad spectators behind too -- it''s difficult to see the two participants -- especially the one on the left.  4</td>', 'I like the concept here.  I would have loved to see this with a faster shutter to stop some of that motion blur -- maybe not all of it, but some at least.  It would have been great to get this without all the white-clad spectators behind too -- it''s difficult to see the two participants -- especially the one on the left.  4', '2005-07-06 22:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514268, 199922, 30275, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think I''d like the circle a little further from the edge</td>', 'Nice, but I think I''d like the circle a little further from the edge', '2005-07-06 22:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
