(1514803, 200742, 3669, '<td valign="top">I appreciate your creativity with this shot.  Well set up (I think I would get impatient doing this)  The red lifesaver adds nice contrast.  My only complaint is that I feel it is a little too dark at the bottom...making the red one dull.  I would like to see more uniformed lighting.  9</td>', 'I appreciate your creativity with this shot.  Well set up (I think I would get impatient doing this)  The red lifesaver adds nice contrast.  My only complaint is that I feel it is a little too dark at the bottom...making the red one dull.  I would like to see more uniformed lighting.  9', '2005-07-07 01:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
