(1514880, 200194, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and the DOF is good here.  Lighting seems a bit harsh though.  Th berries have bright light reflections on them and the shadows also seem like a bit of a distraction.  Background is nice, nothing distracting there.  I like the diagonal placement of the stem. I think a different crop of the right might have been a wiser choice.  Maybe not to cut off the right side of the stem/leaves.  Waterdrops add interest to the photo as well.  I like how they are there...but not overdone.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice focus and the DOF is good here.  Lighting seems a bit harsh though.  Th berries have bright light reflections on them and the shadows also seem like a bit of a distraction.  Background is nice, nothing distracting there.  I like the diagonal placement of the stem. I think a different crop of the right might have been a wiser choice.  Maybe not to cut off the right side of the stem/leaves.  Waterdrops add interest to the photo as well.  I like how they are there...but not overdone.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-07 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
