(1514908, 198440, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that this nicely decorated cake was taken at.  More interesting then a straight on shot.  You need a little more lighting, however.  The colors do not stand out very well and makes the picture a little dull and flat.  Also, you should have moved the cake more to the middle of the table so you would have a complete background.  ...And lastly, needs better focus.</td>', 'I like the angle that this nicely decorated cake was taken at.  More interesting then a straight on shot.  You need a little more lighting, however.  The colors do not stand out very well and makes the picture a little dull and flat.  Also, you should have moved the cake more to the middle of the table so you would have a complete background.  ...And lastly, needs better focus.', '2005-07-07 02:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514912, 198659, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to comment as I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  To me, it appears to be a low resolution photo since it seems to contain a lot of artifact.  The yellow border seems out of place.  Nice circle.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to comment as I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  To me, it appears to be a low resolution photo since it seems to contain a lot of artifact.  The yellow border seems out of place.  Nice circle.', '2005-07-07 02:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
