(1514915, 200701, 3669, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the creativity of this shot.  Took some thought in setting up.  You were able to pick up some nice prism colors.  The yellow hue kind of ruins it though.  Try more lighting to various sides of the ball instead of directly above and make your background more seamless.</td>', 'I appreciate the creativity of this shot.  Took some thought in setting up.  You were able to pick up some nice prism colors.  The yellow hue kind of ruins it though.  Try more lighting to various sides of the ball instead of directly above and make your background more seamless.', '2005-07-07 02:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
