(1514924, 200557, 20214, '<td valign="top">I love abstract photos and this is one of the better ones that I have seen as of late. I like the crop, it works well with your photo. Good luck.</td>', 'I love abstract photos and this is one of the better ones that I have seen as of late. I like the crop, it works well with your photo. Good luck.', '2005-07-07 02:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
