(1514934, 199073, 772, '<td valign="top">It''s always helpful to read the rules since you checked the box that indicated that you had done so :)  The idea here is good but the editing (which is illegal in this challenge) is rather poor.  <br/> <br/>Addendum:  I shouldn''t assume this is illegal.  I did vote it as if it was legal.  I just don''t like the remnants of whatever editing was used.  It looks too strange to me and I can''t see or find purpose in those remnants.</td>', 'It''s always helpful to read the rules since you checked the box that indicated that you had done so :)  The idea here is good but the editing (which is illegal in this challenge) is rather poor.   Addendum:  I shouldn''t assume this is illegal.  I did vote it as if it was legal.  I just don''t like the remnants of whatever editing was used.  It looks too strange to me and I can''t see or find purpose in those remnants.', '2005-07-07 03:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
