(1514999, 200445, 3669, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the creativity to your shot.  The running water and suds make for a nicely composed picture.  I don''t really care for the pink hue, though.  I think that this would look really cool lightened up a little and changed to B&amp;W.</td>', 'I appreciate the creativity to your shot.  The running water and suds make for a nicely composed picture.  I don''t really care for the pink hue, though.  I think that this would look really cool lightened up a little and changed to B&W.', '2005-07-07 04:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515001, 200208, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and colors.  I hadn''t really thought about something as everyday as a stove being pretty.  I like the glow the flames make.</td>', 'Nice focus and colors.  I hadn''t really thought about something as everyday as a stove being pretty.  I like the glow the flames make.', '2005-07-07 05:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515003, 198923, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the muted colors here.  Another example of simple household objects turned into art.  I really like your choice of border too.  Good job...I hope you are scoring well.</td>', 'I really like the muted colors here.  Another example of simple household objects turned into art.  I really like your choice of border too.  Good job...I hope you are scoring well.', '2005-07-07 05:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
