(1515009, 200648, 3669, '<td valign="top">The subtle white on white makes for an interesting picture.  Could you have removed the label from the cans before taking the picture?  The dark pattern on the label distracts from your white theme.</td>', 'The subtle white on white makes for an interesting picture.  Could you have removed the label from the cans before taking the picture?  The dark pattern on the label distracts from your white theme.', '2005-07-07 05:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
