(1515045, 200656, 22748, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of artifacts in it, maybe they are from scaling, maybe from compression, probably both. But it makes the image look rough and pixellated, unfortunately.</td>', 'This image has a lot of artifacts in it, maybe they are from scaling, maybe from compression, probably both. But it makes the image look rough and pixellated, unfortunately.', '2005-07-07 05:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515109, 200261, 38078, '<td valign="top">this is really a wonderful and delicious photo.   the stream is so clear and every detail of the cup and saucer is precise and delicate.   I believe that if members were only allowed to vote in the morning, you would take the ribbon.  Good luck.  You deserve to end up in the top 10 percent.</td>', 'this is really a wonderful and delicious photo.   the stream is so clear and every detail of the cup and saucer is precise and delicate.   I believe that if members were only allowed to vote in the morning, you would take the ribbon.  Good luck.  You deserve to end up in the top 10 percent.', '2005-07-07 07:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
