(1515637, 199875, 34759, '<td valign="top">I know you''re probably getting tons of comments about the size of your picture, so I won''t mention that. ;)  I think the shot has potential.. but the surrounding objects are distracting, like the pole in the background and the roof (?) on the right side. I think closer shot taken from beneath or at a different angle would have been more interesting.</td>', 'I know you''re probably getting tons of comments about the size of your picture, so I won''t mention that. ;)  I think the shot has potential.. but the surrounding objects are distracting, like the pole in the background and the roof (?) on the right side. I think closer shot taken from beneath or at a different angle would have been more interesting.', '2005-07-07 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
