(1516352, 198464, 38793, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo in the challenge.  I hope it does well.  <br/>I really like the angel the photo was taken at.  The model is perfect, and I love the white background.</td>', 'This is my favorite photo in the challenge.  I hope it does well.  I really like the angel the photo was taken at.  The model is perfect, and I love the white background.', '2005-07-07 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516357, 200328, 23913, '<td valign="top">i really like the tones of this image....harch and warm at the same time.<br/> <br/>i wish that it was more texture like it seems very smooth and for the nature of the shot i would like it to be very rough and more wood like less laminant.......looking.<br/> <br/>maybe more of a macro would''ve brought this out and still give the circle aspect</td>', 'i really like the tones of this image....harch and warm at the same time. i wish that it was more texture like it seems very smooth and for the nature of the shot i would like it to be very rough and more wood like less laminant.......looking. maybe more of a macro would''ve brought this out and still give the circle aspect', '2005-07-07 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516361, 200347, 38793, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit.  It''s intriguing, and it makes me wonder.  Way to go, it''s one of my favorites.  I like the black and white treatment, it works well with the subject, however I wish the entire outer circle was in the frame, but I understand that you probably needed to crop out distractions.  Way to go, I hope it does well.</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit.  It''s intriguing, and it makes me wonder.  Way to go, it''s one of my favorites.  I like the black and white treatment, it works well with the subject, however I wish the entire outer circle was in the frame, but I understand that you probably needed to crop out distractions.  Way to go, I hope it does well.', '2005-07-07 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516362, 199874, 23913, '<td valign="top">there is frame on only the left side of this image and it very thin.....it is white which makes me think that u might have messed up a crop or enlargement of the canvis.....<br/> <br/>other than that it is a very soft image... - the over exposed spots this image is fine<br/> <br/>a slower speed (ISO) should''ve been used or a faster shutter...then the over exposed portions would not be so vast or bother some to the eye</td>', 'there is frame on only the left side of this image and it very thin.....it is white which makes me think that u might have messed up a crop or enlargement of the canvis..... other than that it is a very soft image... - the over exposed spots this image is fine a slower speed (ISO) should''ve been used or a faster shutter...then the over exposed portions would not be so vast or bother some to the eye', '2005-07-07 17:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516374, 200720, 23913, '<td valign="top">very warm lighting almost to warm for my tast i think it would''ve helped this to have set your white bal. according to your light very nice still life set up though.<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'very warm lighting almost to warm for my tast i think it would''ve helped this to have set your white bal. according to your light very nice still life set up though. good luck', '2005-07-07 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
