(1516447, 199060, 27293, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a quite boring subject. But something is missing here... Cant tell what it is, i guess something in motion that would contradict the static metal structure... Perhaps even something as simple as a bird, or maybe the motion blur of the net in the wind, something. And also, i think this could be zoomed out a little bit. That would create an image of the hoop in its environment, as opposed to a static, again, image, almost like in a dictionary.</td>', 'Interesting take on a quite boring subject. But something is missing here... Cant tell what it is, i guess something in motion that would contradict the static metal structure... Perhaps even something as simple as a bird, or maybe the motion blur of the net in the wind, something. And also, i think this could be zoomed out a little bit. That would create an image of the hoop in its environment, as opposed to a static, again, image, almost like in a dictionary.', '2005-07-07 17:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516448, 197947, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very good. Minus two points for a little grain and a little less than needed dof. Outstanding composition, though.</td>', 'Very good. Minus two points for a little grain and a little less than needed dof. Outstanding composition, though.', '2005-07-07 17:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
