(1516558, 198619, 38492, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the ''good'' side of the halo, and the distinctively mischevious gleam in his eye! - the shadow on his left eye really highlights this. The only minor niggle I have is the strong shadow cast on his neck.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the ''good'' side of the halo, and the distinctively mischevious gleam in his eye! - the shadow on his left eye really highlights this. The only minor niggle I have is the strong shadow cast on his neck.', '2005-07-07 18:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516559, 200444, 35804, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t comment on this last night becuae I was a bit speechless at the moment...I think my brain had somewhat shut down after so many un circle images..and then I happened upon this image and saw that there was hope, and I was happy. The light is gorgeous and the clarity quite nice...the tonality is delicious...superb...very nicely done...I hope this will do well.</td>', 'I couldn''t comment on this last night becuae I was a bit speechless at the moment...I think my brain had somewhat shut down after so many un circle images..and then I happened upon this image and saw that there was hope, and I was happy. The light is gorgeous and the clarity quite nice...the tonality is delicious...superb...very nicely done...I hope this will do well.', '2005-07-07 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
