(1516605, 200726, 32513, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo, but the reflection is hurting it. I recomend setting up a large piece of black posterboard and cutting a hole in it for your lens, or, failing that, just keep light off of you and the camera, that will do the trick as well.</td>', 'This is a cool photo, but the reflection is hurting it. I recomend setting up a large piece of black posterboard and cutting a hole in it for your lens, or, failing that, just keep light off of you and the camera, that will do the trick as well.', '2005-07-07 18:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
