(1516664, 200092, 6667, '<td valign="top">So simple! So neat!  First thought that came to mind was, "Why couldn''t I think of this!"  The very best of luck.  Would bumb it up from 7 but the hand (and I realize it is not the main subject) is somewhat fuzzy.  One other note . . . and I rtealize I am getting picayune. . . there is a fingerprint between 12 and 1. Ok! there is more. (Please understand I am only making all these comments because I think it is so neat and would like future attemps to make it.)  Hot  spots (white areas need to be toned down with a flash or light diffuser.  Somewhat over sharpend.  And finally. . .whole milk not skim!</td>', 'So simple! So neat!  First thought that came to mind was, "Why couldn''t I think of this!"  The very best of luck.  Would bumb it up from 7 but the hand (and I realize it is not the main subject) is somewhat fuzzy.  One other note . . . and I rtealize I am getting picayune. . . there is a fingerprint between 12 and 1. Ok! there is more. (Please understand I am only making all these comments because I think it is so neat and would like future attemps to make it.)  Hot  spots (white areas need to be toned down with a flash or light diffuser.  Somewhat over sharpend.  And finally. . .whole milk not skim!', '2005-07-07 19:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516719, 200736, 35645, '<td valign="top">Aside from the allusion in the title, I do not see any circles. The heavy post-processing gives the photo a very retro, almost Warhol-ish feel, which may appeal to some voters, but unfortunatley does not appeal to me. I like the contrast between the lips and skin, and had she had something round in her mouth (a popsicle or lollipop or such - as blatantly sexual as they may have been), I think it would have met the challenge better. The photo already has an erotic feel to it (which I like), and I think you could have taken it just a little further.</td>', 'Aside from the allusion in the title, I do not see any circles. The heavy post-processing gives the photo a very retro, almost Warhol-ish feel, which may appeal to some voters, but unfortunatley does not appeal to me. I like the contrast between the lips and skin, and had she had something round in her mouth (a popsicle or lollipop or such - as blatantly sexual as they may have been), I think it would have met the challenge better. The photo already has an erotic feel to it (which I like), and I think you could have taken it just a little further.', '2005-07-07 20:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516720, 200560, 38476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.', '2005-07-07 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
