(1516897, 199882, 3669, '<td valign="top">You did great on the motion effect of the lifesaver.  i am very impressed.  There just seems to be a pink hue and a general haze over the picture, especially in the background.  I can''t help but wonder if this would be better in B&amp;W with an adjustment in contast to bring the lifesaver out more.  Just a thought on an already well done photo.</td>', 'You did great on the motion effect of the lifesaver.  i am very impressed.  There just seems to be a pink hue and a general haze over the picture, especially in the background.  I can''t help but wonder if this would be better in B&W with an adjustment in contast to bring the lifesaver out more.  Just a thought on an already well done photo.', '2005-07-07 21:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516910, 199872, 3669, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice here.  Highlights your subject well.  Sharp focus...shows nice texture.  At first I thought the right was kind of wasted space and could be cropped, but then again, it shows the rural"ness" of the area.  The clouds are nice and adds more depthness to the photo.  Too bad in this challenge that you couldn''t clone out the post in the background.</td>', 'The lighting is nice here.  Highlights your subject well.  Sharp focus...shows nice texture.  At first I thought the right was kind of wasted space and could be cropped, but then again, it shows the rural"ness" of the area.  The clouds are nice and adds more depthness to the photo.  Too bad in this challenge that you couldn''t clone out the post in the background.', '2005-07-07 21:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516915, 200627, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  The tree branch frames the subject nicely.  I think the soft focus does well here.  Kudos for not overexposing the sun.  I love the colors.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  The tree branch frames the subject nicely.  I think the soft focus does well here.  Kudos for not overexposing the sun.  I love the colors.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-07 21:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
