(1517038, 200110, 19746, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, possibly would have gone with a shallower DOF if possible.  Great rhythm created here and the tones are fantastic.  I''m wondering what this would have looked like in colour?  I can imagine it being absolutely incredbile in the right conditions, but pretty dull under the wrong ones.<br/> <br/>Good luck for the challenge with your original and interesting entry.<br/> <br/>Alex (8)</td>', 'Awesome shot, possibly would have gone with a shallower DOF if possible.  Great rhythm created here and the tones are fantastic.  I''m wondering what this would have looked like in colour?  I can imagine it being absolutely incredbile in the right conditions, but pretty dull under the wrong ones. Good luck for the challenge with your original and interesting entry. Alex (8)', '2005-07-07 22:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517043, 199105, 33947, '<td valign="top">The coloration on each berry is extremely special. I can''t tell whether frost has doen it or they just look that way naturally, but regardless, they''re neat. Nice depth of field and clarity, too. Very appealing shot.</td>', 'The coloration on each berry is extremely special. I can''t tell whether frost has doen it or they just look that way naturally, but regardless, they''re neat. Nice depth of field and clarity, too. Very appealing shot.', '2005-07-07 22:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517052, 200106, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the angle is particularly appealing in this shot, It has a skewed look to it.  Compositionally from this perspective, I think it would have been stronger if you arrainged the glassed  diagonally using the "thirds".</td>', 'I don''t think the angle is particularly appealing in this shot, It has a skewed look to it.  Compositionally from this perspective, I think it would have been stronger if you arrainged the glassed  diagonally using the "thirds".', '2005-07-07 22:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517061, 200545, 19746, '<td valign="top">Is this roadrunner?  I recognize the umbrella from a shot on your website<br/> <br/>Apologies to the photographer if I''m mistaken :) <br/> <br/>Anyhow, this is a well composed shot, I like how you''ve made your subject dark and unidentifiable placing most of the attention on the umbrella.  I just wish that it wasn''t a barbie umbrella ;) <br/> <br/>Technically faultless IMO, not much I would have changed here apart from the brand name umbrella.<br/> <br/>An 8 from me and good luck with the challenge<br/>Alex</td>', 'Is this roadrunner?  I recognize the umbrella from a shot on your website Apologies to the photographer if I''m mistaken :)  Anyhow, this is a well composed shot, I like how you''ve made your subject dark and unidentifiable placing most of the attention on the umbrella.  I just wish that it wasn''t a barbie umbrella ;)  Technically faultless IMO, not much I would have changed here apart from the brand name umbrella. An 8 from me and good luck with the challengeAlex', '2005-07-07 22:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
