(1517472, 198066, 37234, '<td valign="top">A bit fuzzy, IMHO. I like the sun shining thru the smoke, but I think there needs to be some sort of "anchor" in the foreground to give the photo perspective. Maybe more of the tree with the sun in the upper left corner (keeping rule of thirds in mind)???</td>', 'A bit fuzzy, IMHO. I like the sun shining thru the smoke, but I think there needs to be some sort of "anchor" in the foreground to give the photo perspective. Maybe more of the tree with the sun in the upper left corner (keeping rule of thirds in mind)???', '2005-07-08 00:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
