(1517483, 199433, 37234, '<td valign="top">OK, I think the major problem I have with this photo is that the focal point is obscured by the reflections of the flash and several surrounding objects. If it were a clear sphere, the reflections might prove interesting, but since there''s a compass in there, you have 2 major elements (reflections and compass) competeing for attention.</td>', 'OK, I think the major problem I have with this photo is that the focal point is obscured by the reflections of the flash and several surrounding objects. If it were a clear sphere, the reflections might prove interesting, but since there''s a compass in there, you have 2 major elements (reflections and compass) competeing for attention.', '2005-07-08 00:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
