(1517492, 199143, 37234, '<td valign="top">I believe your image needs some USM. Addiionally, the "extra" stuff on the walls proves a bit distracting. I tend to feel that if you are going to shoot a single object in the center of the scene, make sure it has no distractors, or that everything surrounding it is in balance.</td>', 'I believe your image needs some USM. Addiionally, the "extra" stuff on the walls proves a bit distracting. I tend to feel that if you are going to shoot a single object in the center of the scene, make sure it has no distractors, or that everything surrounding it is in balance.', '2005-07-08 00:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
