(1517498, 199761, 35804, '<td valign="top">This I think is the coolest bubble picture I have seen on DPC...this is awesome...the color are rich and deep and I also like the fact that the image sems a little grainy...those highlights at the bottom right of each bubble are perfection and really add to the depth...just really nicely done.</td>', 'This I think is the coolest bubble picture I have seen on DPC...this is awesome...the color are rich and deep and I also like the fact that the image sems a little grainy...those highlights at the bottom right of each bubble are perfection and really add to the depth...just really nicely done.', '2005-07-08 00:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
