(1517502, 199479, 37234, '<td valign="top">Whew! Too close for me. Feel like I''m entering Mordor! On the serious side, I''m trying to figure out if I''m looking at something modified using Photoshop "art" filters - the either natural or induced "noise" detracts from the image, IMHO.</td>', 'Whew! Too close for me. Feel like I''m entering Mordor! On the serious side, I''m trying to figure out if I''m looking at something modified using Photoshop "art" filters - the either natural or induced "noise" detracts from the image, IMHO.', '2005-07-08 00:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517504, 200199, 3080, '<td valign="top">This has teh appearance of being WAY oversharpened.  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the ''stem'' of the firework as it is kind of a distraction to the whole ''circle'' concept.  I think there are probably better options for a crop with the fireworks.  I know you are probably going to be faced with the question ''what makes their firework shot better than mine'' since there are so many in this challenge.  I think the answer to that might be that the centered comp doesn''t really work for this, the appearance of being oversharpened and the lack of bright colors which some of the other do have.  The focus does appear to be good, and your background is also good containing no lit up smoke or distracting other elements.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This has teh appearance of being WAY oversharpened.  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the ''stem'' of the firework as it is kind of a distraction to the whole ''circle'' concept.  I think there are probably better options for a crop with the fireworks.  I know you are probably going to be faced with the question ''what makes their firework shot better than mine'' since there are so many in this challenge.  I think the answer to that might be that the centered comp doesn''t really work for this, the appearance of being oversharpened and the lack of bright colors which some of the other do have.  The focus does appear to be good, and your background is also good containing no lit up smoke or distracting other elements.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-08 00:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517507, 200448, 37234, '<td valign="top">Truly, I think this would have been a stunning shot if it was in better focus and/or had some  USM. The thumbnail caught my attention, but unfortunately, the larger image reveals the focusing flaws. Great idea, you should work on this one until you perfect it.</td>', 'Truly, I think this would have been a stunning shot if it was in better focus and/or had some  USM. The thumbnail caught my attention, but unfortunately, the larger image reveals the focusing flaws. Great idea, you should work on this one until you perfect it.', '2005-07-08 01:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
