(1518448, 200308, 35044, '<td valign="top">great idea, interesting, but you need wither a faster shutter speed, to make the drops hang in frae perfectly still, or a slower shutter speed to make them flow (result is like sand or salt being poured).  This is half way, and does neither.</td>', 'great idea, interesting, but you need wither a faster shutter speed, to make the drops hang in frae perfectly still, or a slower shutter speed to make them flow (result is like sand or salt being poured).  This is half way, and does neither.', '2005-07-08 12:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518450, 200739, 35044, '<td valign="top">pretty, but I really want to be in a bit closer (tighter crop) - you have clipped the outside edges, and if  doing that, then realy get in there and focus on the detail in the flower, not the surrounding bushes.  composition v central - would suggest putting flower centre onto a third line when recropping.</td>', 'pretty, but I really want to be in a bit closer (tighter crop) - you have clipped the outside edges, and if  doing that, then realy get in there and focus on the detail in the flower, not the surrounding bushes.  composition v central - would suggest putting flower centre onto a third line when recropping.', '2005-07-08 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518453, 200745, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful detail with wonderful textures, lovely low viewpoint and perfect composition. Presenting this in toned black and white really ensures one''s focus on light, shade, texture and shape. There''s also a haunting sense of time conveyed by this image and of seasons gone.</td>', 'A beautiful detail with wonderful textures, lovely low viewpoint and perfect composition. Presenting this in toned black and white really ensures one''s focus on light, shade, texture and shape. There''s also a haunting sense of time conveyed by this image and of seasons gone.', '2005-07-08 12:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518455, 200530, 4477, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I like how the flowers are more noticable in the center.</td>', 'Great idea!  I like how the flowers are more noticable in the center.', '2005-07-08 12:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518456, 200005, 35044, '<td valign="top">great tones.  Love the contrast.  Very approporiate image.  Person on LHS is not quite a distraction nor focal point, though he is noticeable - might be better with him not there, or with him as a greater part of the subject.  Still v nice.</td>', 'great tones.  Love the contrast.  Very approporiate image.  Person on LHS is not quite a distraction nor focal point, though he is noticeable - might be better with him not there, or with him as a greater part of the subject.  Still v nice.', '2005-07-08 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518457, 200584, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful framing, excellent off-centre composition, perfect pose, great silhouette with just a touch of light detail across the torso, very reminiscent of bond but far more funky, works perfectly in this high contrast black and white.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful framing, excellent off-centre composition, perfect pose, great silhouette with just a touch of light detail across the torso, very reminiscent of bond but far more funky, works perfectly in this high contrast black and white.', '2005-07-08 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518460, 197967, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely richness of colour and sense of depth to the scene. A feeling of age and tranquility here.</td>', 'Lovely richness of colour and sense of depth to the scene. A feeling of age and tranquility here.', '2005-07-08 12:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518462, 198604, 35044, '<td valign="top">Ooh - pretty!  great capture.  Nice contrast and well caught with the reflections.  Have you painted your ceiling black especially?<br/> <br/>Only criticism is in your cropping: not quite central, to my eye.  Needs to be perfect for an impact, central composition like this.  Still a good score from me!</td>', 'Ooh - pretty!  great capture.  Nice contrast and well caught with the reflections.  Have you painted your ceiling black especially? Only criticism is in your cropping: not quite central, to my eye.  Needs to be perfect for an impact, central composition like this.  Still a good score from me!', '2005-07-08 12:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518464, 200335, 35044, '<td valign="top">Clever and attractive.  Great tones on the clockface.  Like the razor sharp look.  Nice.</td>', 'Clever and attractive.  Great tones on the clockface.  Like the razor sharp look.  Nice.', '2005-07-08 12:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518465, 200346, 3087, '<td valign="top">Title weakens impact of overall presentation for me. There seems to be a lot of noise in the red object but I''m assuming that''s just it''s natural texture coming through. A really strong and abstract composition with nice colour contrast.</td>', 'Title weakens impact of overall presentation for me. There seems to be a lot of noise in the red object but I''m assuming that''s just it''s natural texture coming through. A really strong and abstract composition with nice colour contrast.', '2005-07-08 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518466, 199778, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, nice choice of colours too.</td>', 'Nicely done, nice choice of colours too.', '2005-07-08 12:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518470, 199870, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting on the model though a little too harsh on the side of that wall mounted woven object for my taste. I can''t make out what the three rounded objects are and they intrigue me. Interesting and unusual.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting on the model though a little too harsh on the side of that wall mounted woven object for my taste. I can''t make out what the three rounded objects are and they intrigue me. Interesting and unusual.', '2005-07-08 12:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518472, 200567, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, utterly quirky. Don''t like the bluey-green colourcast thats especially evident in their shadows.</td>', 'Nicely done, utterly quirky. Don''t like the bluey-green colourcast thats especially evident in their shadows.', '2005-07-08 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518476, 200174, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fascinating portrait with such unusual composition. The position of her head at the centre of the circles is just right, so too is her unusual expression. Not sure about the faded white foreground and background.</td>', 'Fascinating portrait with such unusual composition. The position of her head at the centre of the circles is just right, so too is her unusual expression. Not sure about the faded white foreground and background.', '2005-07-08 12:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518479, 200731, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely study of shape and texture, enhanced by black and white treatment.</td>', 'Lovely study of shape and texture, enhanced by black and white treatment.', '2005-07-08 12:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518480, 200460, 35044, '<td valign="top">suspicions on your frame being legal within the editing rules but will ignore for vote.<br/> <br/>Image suffers from over exposure in top half: you must get the lighting right, it is critical to a good image.  If the bike was in the light or the shade, it would have been much better.  Half and half means that you will either have one half under or over exposed (here, over exposed).  Colours are washed out generally (increase satuaration), and the image is not sharp (use Unsharp Mask as the last editing step when preparing for submission).  The composition is poor - the bike is photographed side on against a dull background: change angle, bend down, get some intersting angles and see if you can find a better way of capturing this image.  Take a photo that meets the challenge, not meet a challenge and hope that the photo will do.</td>', 'suspicions on your frame being legal within the editing rules but will ignore for vote. Image suffers from over exposure in top half: you must get the lighting right, it is critical to a good image.  If the bike was in the light or the shade, it would have been much better.  Half and half means that you will either have one half under or over exposed (here, over exposed).  Colours are washed out generally (increase satuaration), and the image is not sharp (use Unsharp Mask as the last editing step when preparing for submission).  The composition is poor - the bike is photographed side on against a dull background: change angle, bend down, get some intersting angles and see if you can find a better way of capturing this image.  Take a photo that meets the challenge, not meet a challenge and hope that the photo will do.', '2005-07-08 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518481, 199835, 3087, '<td valign="top">Content fascinating. Over exposed leading to loss of highlight detail in top areas of frame. This is one case where I think I''d prefer more depth of field.</td>', 'Content fascinating. Over exposed leading to loss of highlight detail in top areas of frame. This is one case where I think I''d prefer more depth of field.', '2005-07-08 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518484, 200118, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, an interesting colour and motion to the figure behind - makes the person look quite ghostly.</td>', 'Nicely done, an interesting colour and motion to the figure behind - makes the person look quite ghostly.', '2005-07-08 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518486, 200726, 35044, '<td valign="top">focus not perfect (tough with macro - use smaller aperture values to increase DoF) and sufferring from blown highlights (soften the lighting with some cloth in front of the lamp, or underexpose and play with curves &amp; levels in PS).</td>', 'focus not perfect (tough with macro - use smaller aperture values to increase DoF) and sufferring from blown highlights (soften the lighting with some cloth in front of the lamp, or underexpose and play with curves & levels in PS).', '2005-07-08 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518489, 200121, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea but focus on bubble not sharp enough for me.</td>', 'Lovely idea but focus on bubble not sharp enough for me.', '2005-07-08 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518490, 200345, 35044, '<td valign="top">pretty!  suffers a little because a common theme, and none of these shots really stand out photographically for me.</td>', 'pretty!  suffers a little because a common theme, and none of these shots really stand out photographically for me.', '2005-07-08 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
