(1518512, 199105, 35044, '<td valign="top">pretty - good subject.  maybe a bit too natural - a bit of selection or cleaning here and there would not have spoiled the natuiral look, but there are a coupe of ugly ones.  slight DoF issues - front and back.  Not enough to be a feature, not enough to seem intentional - I would prefer to see bigger or shallower DoF.<br/> <br/></td>', 'pretty - good subject.  maybe a bit too natural - a bit of selection or cleaning here and there would not have spoiled the natuiral look, but there are a coupe of ugly ones.  slight DoF issues - front and back.  Not enough to be a feature, not enough to seem intentional - I would prefer to see bigger or shallower DoF. ', '2005-07-08 12:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518513, 200421, 35044, '<td valign="top">not sure what this is (or is supposed to be).  DoF issues in forground.  Colours are pixellated in foreground/suffering from too much curves?  (looks like heavy-ish PS post processing to me).</td>', 'not sure what this is (or is supposed to be).  DoF issues in forground.  Colours are pixellated in foreground/suffering from too much curves?  (looks like heavy-ish PS post processing to me).', '2005-07-08 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518516, 200013, 35044, '<td valign="top">topical!  Not sure that the selective desat works that well here - face tones look all wrong.  Also, he has dropped his baton (but is still holding his hand as if he has one!).</td>', 'topical!  Not sure that the selective desat works that well here - face tones look all wrong.  Also, he has dropped his baton (but is still holding his hand as if he has one!).', '2005-07-08 12:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518517, 199877, 35044, '<td valign="top">interesting - great colours.  could be fractionally sharper.  more contrast might have worked well.  Overall I like!</td>', 'interesting - great colours.  could be fractionally sharper.  more contrast might have worked well.  Overall I like!', '2005-07-08 12:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518520, 199381, 35044, '<td valign="top">quite a central composition - not necessarily the most interesting.  A bit plain generally, though technically competent.</td>', 'quite a central composition - not necessarily the most interesting.  A bit plain generally, though technically competent.', '2005-07-08 12:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518521, 200503, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot!  I''ve never seen one quite like it, and am curious to find out how you did it (and why the inner crescent line is so wobbly - is that geographic features?)  Anyway, great shot; I loved looking at it!</td>', 'This is an incredible shot!  I''ve never seen one quite like it, and am curious to find out how you did it (and why the inner crescent line is so wobbly - is that geographic features?)  Anyway, great shot; I loved looking at it!', '2005-07-08 12:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518523, 200031, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea!  big background shadow is distracting.  might have like more of the model''s eyes in shot.</td>', 'nice idea!  big background shadow is distracting.  might have like more of the model''s eyes in shot.', '2005-07-08 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518526, 198783, 35044, '<td valign="top">pretty - centred composition works here.  Fractional lack of sharpness at focal point is distracting - does not work as well as a "soft focus" type shot for me.</td>', 'pretty - centred composition works here.  Fractional lack of sharpness at focal point is distracting - does not work as well as a "soft focus" type shot for me.', '2005-07-08 12:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518534, 200352, 35044, '<td valign="top">very true!<br/> <br/>Colours in biscuit look a bit cold.  Maybe the white background - lots of blues in its shadow, and light is very harsh.  I might try to soften fractionally, with more reds in colour balance, less cyan. fractionally soft due to DoF issues, I think (use narrower aperture to reduce issue).</td>', 'very true! Colours in biscuit look a bit cold.  Maybe the white background - lots of blues in its shadow, and light is very harsh.  I might try to soften fractionally, with more reds in colour balance, less cyan. fractionally soft due to DoF issues, I think (use narrower aperture to reduce issue).', '2005-07-08 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518538, 200447, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice shape though query circular.  tones are dull and washed out for me: enrichening tones with colour adjustment, plus more contrast, darker image, might have worked (though would take some playing with PS).</td>', 'nice shape though query circular.  tones are dull and washed out for me: enrichening tones with colour adjustment, plus more contrast, darker image, might have worked (though would take some playing with PS).', '2005-07-08 12:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518545, 200456, 35044, '<td valign="top">colours look very heavily saturated (starting to get blown out) and contrast v high.  Noice image, thoughg - just a biot of a shame about the technicals.</td>', 'colours look very heavily saturated (starting to get blown out) and contrast v high.  Noice image, thoughg - just a biot of a shame about the technicals.', '2005-07-08 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518547, 200496, 12573, '<td valign="top">Nice eye to see this.  It''s a very common image that many can relate to.  Not sure if it''s my monitor, but the image seems out of focus in areas that matter.  The color is fine, if a little on the warm side.  I think a white background might have helped to make the pennies pop a little more.  Good effort.</td>', 'Nice eye to see this.  It''s a very common image that many can relate to.  Not sure if it''s my monitor, but the image seems out of focus in areas that matter.  The color is fine, if a little on the warm side.  I think a white background might have helped to make the pennies pop a little more.  Good effort.', '2005-07-08 12:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518548, 199059, 35044, '<td valign="top">great colour and composition.  reflections on RHS are a distraction - appears to be different surface quality to LHS (glossy v matte).</td>', 'great colour and composition.  reflections on RHS are a distraction - appears to be different surface quality to LHS (glossy v matte).', '2005-07-08 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518549, 200594, 35044, '<td valign="top">sufferring from subject matter exhaustion... and fireworks are tough to get right.  Ideally, you would have tripod and v long exposure to catch a few at a time.</td>', 'sufferring from subject matter exhaustion... and fireworks are tough to get right.  Ideally, you would have tripod and v long exposure to catch a few at a time.', '2005-07-08 12:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518550, 200728, 12573, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  The image seems about 1/2 stop overexposed on my monitor--the stem of the glass is getting washed out by the highlights.  I love the overall high key effect though and your cropping is fantastic.  Other than the slight overexposure, I see nothing wrong with this image. 8</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  The image seems about 1/2 stop overexposed on my monitor--the stem of the glass is getting washed out by the highlights.  I love the overall high key effect though and your cropping is fantastic.  Other than the slight overexposure, I see nothing wrong with this image. 8', '2005-07-08 12:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518551, 200623, 35044, '<td valign="top">cool!  fractionally soft, but I like the high contrast and the close crop.</td>', 'cool!  fractionally soft, but I like the high contrast and the close crop.', '2005-07-08 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518554, 199781, 35044, '<td valign="top">macro has left the outside of the wheel out of the DoF.  The subjkect matter is used, but I quite like the look.  Colours are v muted - wI would increase saturation a little.  Missing a "wow" factor, plus focus/DoF issue result in bit of a knock down in my score, I''m afraid.</td>', 'macro has left the outside of the wheel out of the DoF.  The subjkect matter is used, but I quite like the look.  Colours are v muted - wI would increase saturation a little.  Missing a "wow" factor, plus focus/DoF issue result in bit of a knock down in my score, I''m afraid.', '2005-07-08 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518556, 200434, 35044, '<td valign="top">over saturated, out of focus.  Need to use a tripod for these kind of shots, really.  White baalnce all off (too much yellow).<br/> <br/>For all that, I quite like it.</td>', 'over saturated, out of focus.  Need to use a tripod for these kind of shots, really.  White baalnce all off (too much yellow). For all that, I quite like it.', '2005-07-08 12:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518560, 198593, 35044, '<td valign="top">seems to me that this is the wrong way around: out to be legs on left, ball on right.  Light on front of legs, not back.  pink, blue, red and green are not commonly found together - I think that the pink and red clash.  Otherwiose, nice DoF, good idea.</td>', 'seems to me that this is the wrong way around: out to be legs on left, ball on right.  Light on front of legs, not back.  pink, blue, red and green are not commonly found together - I think that the pink and red clash.  Otherwiose, nice DoF, good idea.', '2005-07-08 12:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518562, 199143, 35044, '<td valign="top">moody post processing treatment. slightly fuzzy (focus/stradier hand required, I think) and whites in centre are blown out.   image is almost centresd but not quite - you need on eor the other, as this just looks a bit sloppily cropped, at the moment.  like colour in bricks.</td>', 'moody post processing treatment. slightly fuzzy (focus/stradier hand required, I think) and whites in centre are blown out.   image is almost centresd but not quite - you need on eor the other, as this just looks a bit sloppily cropped, at the moment.  like colour in bricks.', '2005-07-08 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1518563, 200336, 35044, '<td valign="top">pretty and good idea, though I think that I have seen similar done better: slightly soft and are to right is too far outside DoF.</td>', 'pretty and good idea, though I think that I have seen similar done better: slightly soft and are to right is too far outside DoF.', '2005-07-08 12:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
