(1519326, 200277, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s a fairy ring. I''m gussing it occasionally sprouts a circle of mushrooms? Interesting concept, however it doesn''t have enough detail, focus or substance to hold my interest very long. But when the mushrooms come it might be a cool shot. Keep shooting!</td>', 'That''s a fairy ring. I''m gussing it occasionally sprouts a circle of mushrooms? Interesting concept, however it doesn''t have enough detail, focus or substance to hold my interest very long. But when the mushrooms come it might be a cool shot. Keep shooting!', '2005-07-08 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
