(1519363, 200686, 20530, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I like how the sides are cropped so that you can''t see what the ring is attached to. I wonder if it wouldn''t create some more excitement  if, instead of being centered, the subjects were closer to the top of frame. Seems like it could have a little more "Pop" though I can''t really explain this. Color saturation maybe?</td>', 'Great action shot. I like how the sides are cropped so that you can''t see what the ring is attached to. I wonder if it wouldn''t create some more excitement  if, instead of being centered, the subjects were closer to the top of frame. Seems like it could have a little more "Pop" though I can''t really explain this. Color saturation maybe?', '2005-07-08 17:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
