(1519914, 198735, 15242, '<td valign="top">very plain, boring and everyday...  I wouldn''t hang my breakfast on the wall.  It lacks punch.  Also, a textured background rarely works.</td>', 'very plain, boring and everyday...  I wouldn''t hang my breakfast on the wall.  It lacks punch.  Also, a textured background rarely works.', '2005-07-08 21:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519917, 200308, 15242, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what is in focus?  Typically a photo needs a main subject that draws your attention and the rest of the photo complements it.  Here the whole photo is screaming at me and I can''t tell what it''s trying to say.</td>', 'I can''t tell what is in focus?  Typically a photo needs a main subject that draws your attention and the rest of the photo complements it.  Here the whole photo is screaming at me and I can''t tell what it''s trying to say.', '2005-07-08 21:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519920, 200089, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This has the wow factor that a lot of photos are missing.  If you haven''t already tried it, maybe a crop to comply to rule of thirds could make it even better?</td>', 'Very nice.  This has the wow factor that a lot of photos are missing.  If you haven''t already tried it, maybe a crop to comply to rule of thirds could make it even better?', '2005-07-08 21:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519921, 200717, 15242, '<td valign="top">Focus is not soft enough to be soft and not crisp enough to be in focus.  Also, the colors are very dull.</td>', 'Focus is not soft enough to be soft and not crisp enough to be in focus.  Also, the colors are very dull.', '2005-07-08 21:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519923, 198701, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not all that interesting or attractive.  Maybe back up a little and get more of the web in?</td>', 'Not all that interesting or attractive.  Maybe back up a little and get more of the web in?', '2005-07-08 21:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519924, 198440, 15242, '<td valign="top">Happy birthday Rob, but sorry, this photo has no business being in a photo competition.  Other then the angle, this is nothing more then a party snapshot.  Note, eight other people will say the same thing, but next time use the full 640pix allowed.</td>', 'Happy birthday Rob, but sorry, this photo has no business being in a photo competition.  Other then the angle, this is nothing more then a party snapshot.  Note, eight other people will say the same thing, but next time use the full 640pix allowed.', '2005-07-08 21:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519926, 199358, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ouch. :(</td>', 'Ouch. :(', '2005-07-08 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519927, 200239, 15242, '<td valign="top">The DOF is very shallow and focused on a weird part of the exposure.  Fix that and I''d like it much better  as it is a good composition and subject.</td>', 'The DOF is very shallow and focused on a weird part of the exposure.  Fix that and I''d like it much better  as it is a good composition and subject.', '2005-07-08 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519928, 200479, 3032, '<td valign="top">The exposure is too short to show the true beauty of the fireworks.</td>', 'The exposure is too short to show the true beauty of the fireworks.', '2005-07-08 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519930, 199067, 15242, '<td valign="top">too much going on for my tastes, but I do like all the shapes and the word square being there.  Very geometric.</td>', 'too much going on for my tastes, but I do like all the shapes and the word square being there.  Very geometric.', '2005-07-08 21:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519932, 199934, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice, good idea.  Maybe move them a little closer together?</td>', 'Nice, good idea.  Maybe move them a little closer together?', '2005-07-08 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519934, 200584, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very nice, all around (sorry for the pun).  My favorite thus far.</td>', 'Very nice, all around (sorry for the pun).  My favorite thus far.', '2005-07-08 21:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519936, 198049, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very blurry and blotchy.  You should have polished it first.</td>', 'Very blurry and blotchy.  You should have polished it first.', '2005-07-08 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519939, 200197, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very simple and effective.  Great use of rule of thirds, angle and DOF.  A good lesson on how something simple can be made into a really good photo.</td>', 'Very simple and effective.  Great use of rule of thirds, angle and DOF.  A good lesson on how something simple can be made into a really good photo.', '2005-07-08 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519942, 200255, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very snapshot-ish.  It''s missing a quality to make it a good photo.</td>', 'Very snapshot-ish.  It''s missing a quality to make it a good photo.', '2005-07-08 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519946, 200187, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great portrait but I bet you''re getting hit with the where''s the circles comments?</td>', 'Great portrait but I bet you''re getting hit with the where''s the circles comments?', '2005-07-08 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519951, 199049, 15242, '<td valign="top">Very snapshot-ish.  The shadows are distracting.  A close up of the hub with the hose as a background would be much more effective.</td>', 'Very snapshot-ish.  The shadows are distracting.  A close up of the hub with the hose as a background would be much more effective.', '2005-07-08 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519958, 198781, 15242, '<td valign="top">Needs a solid background and the yellow could be pumped up in PS a bit.</td>', 'Needs a solid background and the yellow could be pumped up in PS a bit.', '2005-07-08 21:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519961, 198531, 3080, '<td valign="top">Coming back for comment.   Very lovely image.  Nice and crisp and clear.  Perfect focus.  I think the black and white was a good choice here.  I like the crop you chose and it looks really great coming in from the right of the photo.  This is my favorite of the challenge so far.  I only have one suggestion and that is a minor one, but stands out like a sore thumb to me.  That is the background.  It''s tilted to the left.  The grass line and the pole (the one that appears to be sticking out of the hood) are both leaning to the left.  Just a minor thing, but noticable...with the beauty of this image, it''s probably just an oversight, but something to be more careful about. Congrats on this image...pleasing to look at, and nicely done.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Coming back for comment.   Very lovely image.  Nice and crisp and clear.  Perfect focus.  I think the black and white was a good choice here.  I like the crop you chose and it looks really great coming in from the right of the photo.  This is my favorite of the challenge so far.  I only have one suggestion and that is a minor one, but stands out like a sore thumb to me.  That is the background.  It''s tilted to the left.  The grass line and the pole (the one that appears to be sticking out of the hood) are both leaning to the left.  Just a minor thing, but noticable...with the beauty of this image, it''s probably just an oversight, but something to be more careful about. Congrats on this image...pleasing to look at, and nicely done.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-08 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519964, 199899, 15242, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but your take on it isn''t very interesting.  Maybe an angle from standing on one of the rocks and not getting the whole thing in frame?</td>', 'Interesting subject, but your take on it isn''t very interesting.  Maybe an angle from standing on one of the rocks and not getting the whole thing in frame?', '2005-07-08 21:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519970, 200225, 39339, '<td valign="top">though the rainbow effect is VERY cool, i would love to see the subject focused a bit more -- the cd seems very blurry, which may have been your intent.</td>', 'though the rainbow effect is VERY cool, i would love to see the subject focused a bit more -- the cd seems very blurry, which may have been your intent.', '2005-07-08 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519971, 200355, 15242, '<td valign="top">Cute, nice editing.  A shallow DOF might work a little better.</td>', 'Cute, nice editing.  A shallow DOF might work a little better.', '2005-07-08 22:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519975, 200240, 39339, '<td valign="top">i wish you had zoomed in on the circles more.  this photo would have more impact if the circle(s) were the focus.</td>', 'i wish you had zoomed in on the circles more.  this photo would have more impact if the circle(s) were the focus.', '2005-07-08 22:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519978, 198963, 15242, '<td valign="top">I can''t really say what I don''t like about it because there really isn''t much there to not like.  The empty space isn''t bad if there is a good subject, but sadly the empty space is the best part of the photo.</td>', 'I can''t really say what I don''t like about it because there really isn''t much there to not like.  The empty space isn''t bad if there is a good subject, but sadly the empty space is the best part of the photo.', '2005-07-08 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519980, 200033, 33379, '<td valign="top">very nice capture</td>', 'very nice capture', '2005-07-08 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519981, 200450, 15242, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop and more dramatic lighting?</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop and more dramatic lighting?', '2005-07-08 22:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519983, 198144, 33899, '<td valign="top">WHOAHHH...i mean, good lighting and composition and color contrast and telephoto lens lol very funny</td>', 'WHOAHHH...i mean, good lighting and composition and color contrast and telephoto lens lol very funny', '2005-07-08 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519984, 199787, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the way you set this up.  I think that it works really well to the left of the photo, not dead center. Lighting is good, focus is ok, seems a little soft on the bottles, but I think that''s just the bottles themselves, sometimes glass does that. My only real suggestion would be to find 2 other bottles that had solid bottoms.  The top 2 that are on the left side are partially empty and you can see that in the photos.  Not really a big deal, but makes it seem less uniform.  I like the background and you did a very nice job of levelling your ''horizon'' line. Visually appealing image.  One of my top picks so far. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the way you set this up.  I think that it works really well to the left of the photo, not dead center. Lighting is good, focus is ok, seems a little soft on the bottles, but I think that''s just the bottles themselves, sometimes glass does that. My only real suggestion would be to find 2 other bottles that had solid bottoms.  The top 2 that are on the left side are partially empty and you can see that in the photos.  Not really a big deal, but makes it seem less uniform.  I like the background and you did a very nice job of levelling your ''horizon'' line. Visually appealing image.  One of my top picks so far. ~Heather~', '2005-07-08 22:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519987, 200004, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2005-07-08 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519991, 200664, 38072, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best of the sparklers -- for one thing, the circle is *round*  I''m wondering though, is the gal there spinning a sparkler on a string or something?</td>', 'I think this is the best of the sparklers -- for one thing, the circle is *round*  I''m wondering though, is the gal there spinning a sparkler on a string or something?', '2005-07-08 22:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519992, 198125, 33379, '<td valign="top">spicy? what are they 12?</td>', 'spicy? what are they 12?', '2005-07-08 22:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520000, 198471, 38072, '<td valign="top">Amazing perspective with a nice lighting/color contrast between the inside and the outside.    I wish the reflection of the flourscent lights wasn''t there outside the "tube"  7</td>', 'Amazing perspective with a nice lighting/color contrast between the inside and the outside.    I wish the reflection of the flourscent lights wasn''t there outside the "tube"  7', '2005-07-08 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520001, 200119, 33379, '<td valign="top">wow excellent capture!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'wow excellent capture!!!!!!!!!', '2005-07-08 22:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520003, 200444, 38072, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''m not sure if a spiral counts as a circle, but I''m going to pretend it does (afterall, it''s only perspective that makes this not look totally circular, right?)   9</td>', 'Very nice.  I''m not sure if a spiral counts as a circle, but I''m going to pretend it does (afterall, it''s only perspective that makes this not look totally circular, right?)   9', '2005-07-08 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520005, 199903, 38072, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the way the dust behind the rider subdues the contrast of the background and really makes the subject stand out.  Good circle there too! 7</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the way the dust behind the rider subdues the contrast of the background and really makes the subject stand out.  Good circle there too! 7', '2005-07-08 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1);
