(1520006, 198157, 33379, '<td valign="top">this is strange, thats why i like it!! not a whole lot of circle showing though.</td>', 'this is strange, thats why i like it!! not a whole lot of circle showing though.', '2005-07-08 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520007, 200324, 39349, '<td valign="top">Anytime you smoke a tire you get at least a 6 in my book!</td>', 'Anytime you smoke a tire you get at least a 6 in my book!', '2005-07-08 22:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520008, 200571, 19841, '<td valign="top">Technically fine, wonderfully creative, and tasty too!</td>', 'Technically fine, wonderfully creative, and tasty too!', '2005-07-08 22:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520011, 200584, 19841, '<td valign="top">Cool!  shades of James Bond.  Nice range of tones, especially on the figure.</td>', 'Cool!  shades of James Bond.  Nice range of tones, especially on the figure.', '2005-07-08 22:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520014, 200313, 38072, '<td valign="top">A pretty good shot I think.  I like the idea of capturing the bullseye dart as it hits the target.  I think that it''s hard to see the dart in this shot though.  If you could have caught the timing such that the dart was in flight for half the exposure, and stuck still for the other half so it would show up more clearly on the board it might have been easier to see and still had the blur of motion.</td>', 'A pretty good shot I think.  I like the idea of capturing the bullseye dart as it hits the target.  I think that it''s hard to see the dart in this shot though.  If you could have caught the timing such that the dart was in flight for half the exposure, and stuck still for the other half so it would show up more clearly on the board it might have been easier to see and still had the blur of motion.', '2005-07-08 22:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520020, 200380, 38072, '<td valign="top">I wish I could tell better what I''m looking at here.  It''s for me to judge a photo when I can''t tell what I''m seeing.</td>', 'I wish I could tell better what I''m looking at here.  It''s for me to judge a photo when I can''t tell what I''m seeing.', '2005-07-08 22:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
