(1520960, 200450, 35947, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Might help to have a more defined focal pt.  Maybe a person in the circle.?</td>', 'Neat idea.  Might help to have a more defined focal pt.  Maybe a person in the circle.?', '2005-07-09 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520962, 200336, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very colorful!</td>', 'Very colorful!', '2005-07-09 11:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520964, 200567, 19841, '<td valign="top">Gotta watch out for those beer rings on the countertop.  You''ll get your ants drunk.  Fascinating image.</td>', 'Gotta watch out for those beer rings on the countertop.  You''ll get your ants drunk.  Fascinating image.', '2005-07-09 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520977, 200186, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2005-07-09 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520979, 200436, 7531, '<td valign="top">Like it, especially the depth of field and the accurate colour</td>', 'Like it, especially the depth of field and the accurate colour', '2005-07-09 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521021, 200106, 12311, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and well-composed.  The only thing I would have changed is to have the umbrella on the right in focus.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and well-composed.  The only thing I would have changed is to have the umbrella on the right in focus.', '2005-07-09 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521022, 197824, 37961, '<td valign="top">This was a really good idea. I love the smoking barrell. However a better crop and possibly showing more of the gun would have given it more impact.</td>', 'This was a really good idea. I love the smoking barrell. However a better crop and possibly showing more of the gun would have given it more impact.', '2005-07-09 12:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521024, 199388, 37961, '<td valign="top">Maybe the poor countries should start marketing &amp; selling these bracelets to make money. I like the light on white concept.</td>', 'Maybe the poor countries should start marketing & selling these bracelets to make money. I like the light on white concept.', '2005-07-09 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521025, 199877, 37961, '<td valign="top">This was a tad dark and I felt needed some more light. The image is good, lighting needs a boost.</td>', 'This was a tad dark and I felt needed some more light. The image is good, lighting needs a boost.', '2005-07-09 12:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521027, 198493, 37961, '<td valign="top">Upside down coke cans? Pretty neat. Ball-bearings would be cool to do this with as well.</td>', 'Upside down coke cans? Pretty neat. Ball-bearings would be cool to do this with as well.', '2005-07-09 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521029, 199059, 37961, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and nice lighting.</td>', 'Pretty colors and nice lighting.', '2005-07-09 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521030, 200288, 39900, '<td valign="top">Nice ill give u 5</td>', 'Nice ill give u 5', '2005-07-09 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521031, 200557, 37961, '<td valign="top">What is this thing? Kinda neat. Just a little confusing.</td>', 'What is this thing? Kinda neat. Just a little confusing.', '2005-07-09 12:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521032, 200013, 12311, '<td valign="top">Looks like Sly Stone... Nice job!</td>', 'Looks like Sly Stone... Nice job!', '2005-07-09 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521033, 199847, 37961, '<td valign="top">Best CD pic Ive seen so far. Cool colors.</td>', 'Best CD pic Ive seen so far. Cool colors.', '2005-07-09 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521038, 200200, 37961, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the cropping here, the bottom part is distracting, but the focus and sharpness of the speakers on the top is good.</td>', 'Don''t care for the cropping here, the bottom part is distracting, but the focus and sharpness of the speakers on the top is good.', '2005-07-09 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521039, 200309, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2005-07-09 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521040, 199995, 37961, '<td valign="top">Brave idea.</td>', 'Brave idea.', '2005-07-09 12:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521042, 200584, 37961, '<td valign="top">Nudity at the end of the tunnel may have gotten you a higher score by some...LOL</td>', 'Nudity at the end of the tunnel may have gotten you a higher score by some...LOL', '2005-07-09 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521045, 200578, 37961, '<td valign="top">This looks a little too formulated to me. The concept is good, but maybe a different angle. Maybe more like Arnold Swartzenegger in The Terminator.</td>', 'This looks a little too formulated to me. The concept is good, but maybe a different angle. Maybe more like Arnold Swartzenegger in The Terminator.', '2005-07-09 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521051, 200490, 23053, '<td valign="top">I really like your crop here.   Maybe a different time of day to give you a more interesting sky.  Granted, that is a small detail (but for some reason on DPC, a good sky is a major factor to some voters).</td>', 'I really like your crop here.   Maybe a different time of day to give you a more interesting sky.  Granted, that is a small detail (but for some reason on DPC, a good sky is a major factor to some voters).', '2005-07-09 12:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521054, 198998, 23053, '<td valign="top">This shot is very flat and lacks any...''pop'', you know?  I think a different set up, maybe something else to compliment the orb...something....could really make this an interesting subject.</td>', 'This shot is very flat and lacks any...''pop'', you know?  I think a different set up, maybe something else to compliment the orb...something....could really make this an interesting subject.', '2005-07-09 12:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521060, 199059, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great color and contrast.  I''d like to see less harsh lighting (normally I like harsh lighting, but to me it doesn''t fit here) and maybe a less set-up feel (speaking of ''set-up'', I can''t talk...look at my photo at the end of the challenge).  So, what am I saying?  I''m a hypocrite.  Again, great color.  I''ll leave now...thanks.</td>', 'Great color and contrast.  I''d like to see less harsh lighting (normally I like harsh lighting, but to me it doesn''t fit here) and maybe a less set-up feel (speaking of ''set-up'', I can''t talk...look at my photo at the end of the challenge).  So, what am I saying?  I''m a hypocrite.  Again, great color.  I''ll leave now...thanks.', '2005-07-09 12:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521064, 199673, 23053, '<td valign="top">Given the challenge, I think your central subject is a bit weak.  Granted, circles are here, but I wouldn''t really have picked up on them that much had I not been directed to.  The photo in and of itself is good, moody, and interesting.</td>', 'Given the challenge, I think your central subject is a bit weak.  Granted, circles are here, but I wouldn''t really have picked up on them that much had I not been directed to.  The photo in and of itself is good, moody, and interesting.', '2005-07-09 12:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521066, 199816, 23053, '<td valign="top">Until I picked up on the shadows, I was going to score this a bit lower, but they really add interest to this shot, notably inside the slinky.</td>', 'Until I picked up on the shadows, I was going to score this a bit lower, but they really add interest to this shot, notably inside the slinky.', '2005-07-09 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521070, 198923, 23053, '<td valign="top">Cool effect and nice pastel coloring.  I''m not quite sure how you achieved this - who knows, maybe its a Macro V outtake, but the overall feel is light and playful.  So, good on you.</td>', 'Cool effect and nice pastel coloring.  I''m not quite sure how you achieved this - who knows, maybe its a Macro V outtake, but the overall feel is light and playful.  So, good on you.', '2005-07-09 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521105, 198663, 36462, '<td valign="top">I think that this may have been better if more focus had been given to the larger circular object: the chair or the  lounger?  The image is very busy, and as it is the light shining directly on the disco ball(?) is very distracting.</td>', 'I think that this may have been better if more focus had been given to the larger circular object: the chair or the  lounger?  The image is very busy, and as it is the light shining directly on the disco ball(?) is very distracting.', '2005-07-09 13:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521110, 200029, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, however the lighting is a bit harsh, and the image a bit busy</td>', 'I like the angle, however the lighting is a bit harsh, and the image a bit busy', '2005-07-09 13:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521118, 200486, 36462, '<td valign="top">Ying and Yang is all about balance, and yet the green seems to me to through it all out of balance.</td>', 'Ying and Yang is all about balance, and yet the green seems to me to through it all out of balance.', '2005-07-09 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521123, 198387, 36462, '<td valign="top">quirky!  I like the idea!   I personally would have enjoyed this a lot more had the background been different.</td>', 'quirky!  I like the idea!   I personally would have enjoyed this a lot more had the background been different.', '2005-07-09 13:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521124, 198515, 36462, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus.  Nice stop action otherwise.</td>', 'Seems out of focus.  Nice stop action otherwise.', '2005-07-09 13:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521126, 198858, 36462, '<td valign="top">I still haven''t figured out what this is?   :)  I like this very much, it is very interesting.  The only complaint that I have, is that the image seems a tad overprocessed.</td>', 'I still haven''t figured out what this is?   :)  I like this very much, it is very interesting.  The only complaint that I have, is that the image seems a tad overprocessed.', '2005-07-09 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521128, 200740, 37130, '<td valign="top">How many comments have you had about TO DARK. I am being knocked silly.</td>', 'How many comments have you had about TO DARK. I am being knocked silly.', '2005-07-09 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521130, 199530, 36462, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this image a whole lot more had there not been a person in the center.  She seems out of place, and in my opinion is distracting to the architectural aspect of the image.</td>', 'I would have liked this image a whole lot more had there not been a person in the center.  She seems out of place, and in my opinion is distracting to the architectural aspect of the image.', '2005-07-09 13:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521132, 200530, 3080, '<td valign="top">The subject itself is the flowers, but they are so very tiny that we don''t get much detail out of them at all.  That and they are in a shadow and do not stand out in the photo.  The swirl is a circular shape, but I don''t feel  like it''s suposed to be the main subject, otherwise, what would the purpose of the flowers be at all other than a distraction to the swirl.    The colors are interesting, but I don''t really like the effect at all.  Very abstract with not much to look at.  Just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The subject itself is the flowers, but they are so very tiny that we don''t get much detail out of them at all.  That and they are in a shadow and do not stand out in the photo.  The swirl is a circular shape, but I don''t feel  like it''s suposed to be the main subject, otherwise, what would the purpose of the flowers be at all other than a distraction to the swirl.    The colors are interesting, but I don''t really like the effect at all.  Very abstract with not much to look at.  Just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-09 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521139, 198702, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great tonal quality to this shot, with more circles than originally meets the eye.  This should do well...it better do well, or else!</td>', 'Great tonal quality to this shot, with more circles than originally meets the eye.  This should do well...it better do well, or else!', '2005-07-09 13:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521140, 200550, 36462, '<td valign="top">I love this lake!  Is it a caldera or glacial (or either)?</td>', 'I love this lake!  Is it a caldera or glacial (or either)?', '2005-07-09 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521142, 200463, 23053, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective...well done.</td>', 'Simple and effective...well done.', '2005-07-09 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521143, 200586, 36462, '<td valign="top">interesting.  I can''t help but think that it would be even better in color.</td>', 'interesting.  I can''t help but think that it would be even better in color.', '2005-07-09 13:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521152, 200088, 36462, '<td valign="top">I really really like  this.  Makes me want to jump in for a swim!</td>', 'I really really like  this.  Makes me want to jump in for a swim!', '2005-07-09 13:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521153, 200480, 23053, '<td valign="top">What good eyes you have!  I like how the lines here tend to lead my eyes to the spiral.  An interesting entry since it is natural, not contrived.</td>', 'What good eyes you have!  I like how the lines here tend to lead my eyes to the spiral.  An interesting entry since it is natural, not contrived.', '2005-07-09 13:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521159, 200316, 39973, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I love the colors. Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing b/c the glass need cleaned up a bit. Nothing a little windex couldn''t fix though.</td>', 'Nice shot, I love the colors. Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing b/c the glass need cleaned up a bit. Nothing a little windex couldn''t fix though.', '2005-07-09 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521160, 200718, 39973, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if everything was sharp. It could really help.</td>', 'I would like this better if everything was sharp. It could really help.', '2005-07-09 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521161, 198515, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great composition, great color.  My only concern deals with focus, as nothing seems to be fully in focus, notably the bobber and the splash.  Don''t get me wrong, I am still rating this very high, but I would like to see a bit more sharpness at the bobber.</td>', 'Great concept, great composition, great color.  My only concern deals with focus, as nothing seems to be fully in focus, notably the bobber and the splash.  Don''t get me wrong, I am still rating this very high, but I would like to see a bit more sharpness at the bobber.', '2005-07-09 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521162, 199067, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  It''s crisp, clean, and bright.  I can''t help but wonder if it would be better if the entire right side was cropped out, but then again, there are two whole circles over there.  hmm.  Either way I like it.</td>', 'I like this image.  It''s crisp, clean, and bright.  I can''t help but wonder if it would be better if the entire right side was cropped out, but then again, there are two whole circles over there.  hmm.  Either way I like it.', '2005-07-09 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521163, 200209, 39973, '<td valign="top">I don''t really feel like a circle is dominant here. A little more contrast could really help the spider to pop out too.</td>', 'I don''t really feel like a circle is dominant here. A little more contrast could really help the spider to pop out too.', '2005-07-09 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521171, 199340, 39973, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see a circle as being dominant, or even in the pic. I do like the reflection though.</td>', 'I really don''t see a circle as being dominant, or even in the pic. I do like the reflection though.', '2005-07-09 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521172, 199270, 39973, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit flat, some contrast could help quite a bit. Too bad the sky wasn''t interesting that day, it would be really nice then.</td>', 'Seems a bit flat, some contrast could help quite a bit. Too bad the sky wasn''t interesting that day, it would be really nice then.', '2005-07-09 14:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521174, 200517, 39973, '<td valign="top">If the subject was sharp it would help this shot tremendously.</td>', 'If the subject was sharp it would help this shot tremendously.', '2005-07-09 14:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521175, 199390, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has wonderful potential but is a bit lacking in the contrast and tone department.  Something slightly more moody, a little more to the left of the histogram, would be more pleasing to me.</td>', 'I think this photo has wonderful potential but is a bit lacking in the contrast and tone department.  Something slightly more moody, a little more to the left of the histogram, would be more pleasing to me.', '2005-07-09 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521176, 198794, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like the quirkyness of this man, and the image itself.  Makes me wonder how long he''s been collecting all these buttons, and what''s with the clock?</td>', 'I like the quirkyness of this man, and the image itself.  Makes me wonder how long he''s been collecting all these buttons, and what''s with the clock?', '2005-07-09 14:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521180, 200695, 39973, '<td valign="top">I really don''t feel that a circle is dominant here. It would also be a bit nicer to have the head in sharp focus.</td>', 'I really don''t feel that a circle is dominant here. It would also be a bit nicer to have the head in sharp focus.', '2005-07-09 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521182, 200248, 39973, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the colors and lines.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the colors and lines.', '2005-07-09 14:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521185, 200398, 39973, '<td valign="top">A bit bland for my taste. Maybe some more pop to the colors would help.</td>', 'A bit bland for my taste. Maybe some more pop to the colors would help.', '2005-07-09 14:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521187, 198956, 36462, '<td valign="top">This image caught my eye right away.  However, I would have liked this a lot more had the background been solid and shadows been minimized.</td>', 'This image caught my eye right away.  However, I would have liked this a lot more had the background been solid and shadows been minimized.', '2005-07-09 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521189, 200727, 39973, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here. It domes across a bit dark though, maybe a lighter backgound to seperate the subject.</td>', 'I love the idea here. It domes across a bit dark though, maybe a lighter backgound to seperate the subject.', '2005-07-09 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521192, 198720, 39973, '<td valign="top">If the subject was sharp it would help this shot tremendously.</td>', 'If the subject was sharp it would help this shot tremendously.', '2005-07-09 14:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521193, 200310, 39973, '<td valign="top">Although there is a circle in the photo I don''t feel that it is dominant. i would also like to see a little more stop action. It seems a bit blown out in the highlights as well.</td>', 'Although there is a circle in the photo I don''t feel that it is dominant. i would also like to see a little more stop action. It seems a bit blown out in the highlights as well.', '2005-07-09 14:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521197, 198958, 39973, '<td valign="top">There really dosen''t seem to be a dominant circle here. If the kite was a little lighter it may help the shot too.</td>', 'There really dosen''t seem to be a dominant circle here. If the kite was a little lighter it may help the shot too.', '2005-07-09 14:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
