(1522356, 200184, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice fireworks shot.  It''s a little busy, but is better than most of the others I''ve seen entered.  IMHO, I think it''s cropped a bit too closely - takes away from the awe factor for me.  5</td>', 'Nice fireworks shot.  It''s a little busy, but is better than most of the others I''ve seen entered.  IMHO, I think it''s cropped a bit too closely - takes away from the awe factor for me.  5', '2005-07-10 00:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522357, 200485, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice. I like this shot a lot. it lacks sharpness but I like the duetone</td>', 'very nice. I like this shot a lot. it lacks sharpness but I like the duetone', '2005-07-10 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522359, 197919, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot that meets the challenge well.  I think I''d like it better if it wasn''t dead center of the crop.  Still...  Nice lighting and DOF.  6</td>', 'Very unique shot that meets the challenge well.  I think I''d like it better if it wasn''t dead center of the crop.  Still...  Nice lighting and DOF.  6', '2005-07-10 00:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522360, 198144, 27514, '<td valign="top">distastefull, did she know you were taking this picture</td>', 'distastefull, did she know you were taking this picture', '2005-07-10 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522361, 200648, 27514, '<td valign="top">washed out</td>', 'washed out', '2005-07-10 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522363, 200428, 34659, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting shot.  Meets the challenge well on a couple of levels.  IMHO, I think voters will probably deduct because of the image''s small size.  Because it is so small, you lose some of the detail that would otherwise be apparent (and I ''think'' you have good DOF, but it''s hard to tell).  7</td>', 'Unique and interesting shot.  Meets the challenge well on a couple of levels.  IMHO, I think voters will probably deduct because of the image''s small size.  Because it is so small, you lose some of the detail that would otherwise be apparent (and I ''think'' you have good DOF, but it''s hard to tell).  7', '2005-07-10 00:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522365, 197966, 27514, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. looks like it should be on a coffee shop wall</td>', 'I love this photo. looks like it should be on a coffee shop wall', '2005-07-10 01:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522368, 198471, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Love the lighting and DOF inside the tube, but the background is a little drab.  Not sure how it could be spiced up or de-emphasized more (and I''m probably not expressing myself very well - sorry), but overall it''s still a very good capture.  7</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Love the lighting and DOF inside the tube, but the background is a little drab.  Not sure how it could be spiced up or de-emphasized more (and I''m probably not expressing myself very well - sorry), but overall it''s still a very good capture.  7', '2005-07-10 01:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522372, 199340, 34659, '<td valign="top">Base score 5.  -2 for lack of obvious circle(s), composition +1, beauty/personal appeal +1.  Lighting good/okay (some blown highlights) +0.   =5</td>', 'Base score 5.  -2 for lack of obvious circle(s), composition +1, beauty/personal appeal +1.  Lighting good/okay (some blown highlights) +0.   =5', '2005-07-10 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522377, 199882, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and idea.  Nice movement capture.  The background is a little drab (doesn''t really add to the image IMHO).  I know this is a really picky detail too, but I wanna see the LIFE SAVERS lettering on the mint right-side up.  Overall good entry.  6</td>', 'Cool shot and idea.  Nice movement capture.  The background is a little drab (doesn''t really add to the image IMHO).  I know this is a really picky detail too, but I wanna see the LIFE SAVERS lettering on the mint right-side up.  Overall good entry.  6', '2005-07-10 01:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522383, 200188, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and I think it meets the challenge, but it looks really overprocessed (which detracts from the overall appeal of the image).  4</td>', 'Love the colors and I think it meets the challenge, but it looks really overprocessed (which detracts from the overall appeal of the image).  4', '2005-07-10 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522385, 199995, 29269, '<td valign="top">The packaging is distracting here, the condom by itself would have been sufficient. The bright orange color at the same time out of focus really subtracts from the otherwise original concept in this challenge.</td>', 'The packaging is distracting here, the condom by itself would have been sufficient. The bright orange color at the same time out of focus really subtracts from the otherwise original concept in this challenge.', '2005-07-10 01:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522387, 200578, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose and idea that meets the challenge well.  IMHO, however, the white background really washes out the pale skin (possibly correctable with different lighting too).  It really is a lovely shot, I just think it''s a little overblown on the highlights/white/light areas.  6</td>', 'Beautiful pose and idea that meets the challenge well.  IMHO, however, the white background really washes out the pale skin (possibly correctable with different lighting too).  It really is a lovely shot, I just think it''s a little overblown on the highlights/white/light areas.  6', '2005-07-10 01:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522390, 198515, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great idea and shot.  The poor DOF really detracts from the image though (IMHO).  4</td>', 'Great idea and shot.  The poor DOF really detracts from the image though (IMHO).  4', '2005-07-10 01:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522395, 200694, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot &amp; idea, but the poor DOF really detracts from the image.  There are some blown highlights and the reflection in the eye is not very interesting to me (IMHO).  4</td>', 'Nice shot & idea, but the poor DOF really detracts from the image.  There are some blown highlights and the reflection in the eye is not very interesting to me (IMHO).  4', '2005-07-10 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522401, 199810, 39243, '<td valign="top">For this contest everyone who has the word circle in their title is getting a lower score. This is a copy and paste version that I am including in every photo that I downgrade due to the title. We as members of DPchallenge know the topic of the challenge  we do not need to reread the topic every time we reach a photo. If circle is in the title and it is appropriate I will most likely not down grade, but it better be good.  I am sorry if you do not agree with my method of protest  but scores are all I have.</td>', 'For this contest everyone who has the word circle in their title is getting a lower score. This is a copy and paste version that I am including in every photo that I downgrade due to the title. We as members of DPchallenge know the topic of the challenge  we do not need to reread the topic every time we reach a photo. If circle is in the title and it is appropriate I will most likely not down grade, but it better be good.  I am sorry if you do not agree with my method of protest  but scores are all I have.', '2005-07-10 01:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
