(1522975, 200434, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: Low - Your subject is not appealing, looks like a snapshot<br/>Meets Challenge: Average - Because there are circle visible but not dominate <br/>Technical: Low - Bad lighting, out of focus, white balance problem, noisy, and blown colors.<br/>Composition: Average - Rule of thirds used fairly well<br/>Creativity: Low - Seems to be a quick shot to enter. <br/> <br/>Score: 3</td>', 'Subject Impact: Low - Your subject is not appealing, looks like a snapshotMeets Challenge: Average - Because there are circle visible but not dominate Technical: Low - Bad lighting, out of focus, white balance problem, noisy, and blown colors.Composition: Average - Rule of thirds used fairly wellCreativity: Low - Seems to be a quick shot to enter.  Score: 3', '2005-07-10 10:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
