(1523217, 200739, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice flower, nice sharpness. To apply to a circle challenge, I think it might be better centered and without that leaf on the top. Also, watch the shadow on the petals in the lower right corner.<br/> <br/>It would be a shame to lose the color mixing of the rich greens of the leaves, but I think this pic would have done better if it was cropped in about 30% to really bring out the circular aspects of the flower.</td>', 'Nice flower, nice sharpness. To apply to a circle challenge, I think it might be better centered and without that leaf on the top. Also, watch the shadow on the petals in the lower right corner. It would be a shame to lose the color mixing of the rich greens of the leaves, but I think this pic would have done better if it was cropped in about 30% to really bring out the circular aspects of the flower.', '2005-07-10 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523224, 200750, 28710, '<td valign="top">I think there are too many elements of this picture that have been cut off. I like that you were experimenting a little bit with the CD. I wonder if you could have played around a little with focusing in more on the coins on that surface for a more clear idea of what you are trying to portray. <br/>You might even have tried to do something with the coins from different countries standing on their edges, but I personally would have tried that on a white background...</td>', 'I think there are too many elements of this picture that have been cut off. I like that you were experimenting a little bit with the CD. I wonder if you could have played around a little with focusing in more on the coins on that surface for a more clear idea of what you are trying to portray. You might even have tried to do something with the coins from different countries standing on their edges, but I personally would have tried that on a white background...', '2005-07-10 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523227, 200313, 28710, '<td valign="top">Fun colours, weird look for the dart.</td>', 'Fun colours, weird look for the dart.', '2005-07-10 13:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523230, 200724, 28710, '<td valign="top">I tried to take some pics of butterflies this past weekend. They can be really tricky to get. This is a pretty nice picture. It is a bit of a shame that the wing is cut off in the top right hand corner, but I like the framing otherwise. It probably was impossible at the time to catch, but it also would have been good if you had rotated a little bit to the right to slide that antenna over the brighter background.</td>', 'I tried to take some pics of butterflies this past weekend. They can be really tricky to get. This is a pretty nice picture. It is a bit of a shame that the wing is cut off in the top right hand corner, but I like the framing otherwise. It probably was impossible at the time to catch, but it also would have been good if you had rotated a little bit to the right to slide that antenna over the brighter background.', '2005-07-10 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523233, 200436, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I would have liked a hair more sharpness on the rest of the mushroom in the foreground, but I think that is really splitting hairs. I would be proud if I shot anything this good. The layout is nice too.</td>', 'Nice lighting. I would have liked a hair more sharpness on the rest of the mushroom in the foreground, but I think that is really splitting hairs. I would be proud if I shot anything this good. The layout is nice too.', '2005-07-10 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523234, 200638, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice and snappy. I was distracted by the extra fish-eye in the magnifier. Really sharp.</td>', 'Nice and snappy. I was distracted by the extra fish-eye in the magnifier. Really sharp.', '2005-07-10 13:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523240, 198145, 28710, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I even like the dust on the ground.<br/> <br/>I love the possible triple meaning on the title (although caps would have been nice) and how the eyes first see the circle around the top of the can, then slide in to the circle on the tab, then finally rest on the circle in the rivet for the tab.<br/> <br/>10 for me</td>', 'I really like this shot. I even like the dust on the ground. I love the possible triple meaning on the title (although caps would have been nice) and how the eyes first see the circle around the top of the can, then slide in to the circle on the tab, then finally rest on the circle in the rivet for the tab. 10 for me', '2005-07-10 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523241, 198440, 40181, '<td valign="top">Kinda small in size and the colors seem muted.</td>', 'Kinda small in size and the colors seem muted.', '2005-07-10 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523243, 199621, 28710, '<td valign="top">sweet and soft. I would have liked to see this cropped differently, either to center the light or the dark circle in the middle. I wouldn''t mind the negative space at the bottom so much if that middle circle was really centered.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, I give this high marks.</td>', 'sweet and soft. I would have liked to see this cropped differently, either to center the light or the dark circle in the middle. I wouldn''t mind the negative space at the bottom so much if that middle circle was really centered. Otherwise, I give this high marks.', '2005-07-10 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523246, 200263, 40181, '<td valign="top">Maybe take a picture of something that looks more... aesthetic maybe?  Not saying that it might taste good but it''s not the most beautiful dish i''ve seen in a while =D</td>', 'Maybe take a picture of something that looks more... aesthetic maybe?  Not saying that it might taste good but it''s not the most beautiful dish i''ve seen in a while =D', '2005-07-10 13:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523249, 200356, 40181, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge but uninteresting composition and lighting is too harsh for my tastes.  Try using the rule of thirds to spice it up and finding a place where the lighting is more diffuse.</td>', 'Fits the challenge but uninteresting composition and lighting is too harsh for my tastes.  Try using the rule of thirds to spice it up and finding a place where the lighting is more diffuse.', '2005-07-10 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523250, 198430, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pic on it''s own, but I felt the connection to the challenge was a little too "loose" if I can say that. I think the background also threw me a bit too. Way too distracting. I want to be focused on the theme of your picture and on the challenge, not a mucky background. This would have been much better on a straight flat sheet of black leather, latex or perhaps silk. A number of thick ropes laid cleanly across the horizontal would have even been a better background.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, I quite like the layout of the cuffs. The top one is a little suggestive and fits nicely with your theme.</td>', 'This is a nice pic on it''s own, but I felt the connection to the challenge was a little too "loose" if I can say that. I think the background also threw me a bit too. Way too distracting. I want to be focused on the theme of your picture and on the challenge, not a mucky background. This would have been much better on a straight flat sheet of black leather, latex or perhaps silk. A number of thick ropes laid cleanly across the horizontal would have even been a better background. Otherwise, I quite like the layout of the cuffs. The top one is a little suggestive and fits nicely with your theme.', '2005-07-10 13:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523251, 200737, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice light and color</td>', 'Nice light and color', '2005-07-10 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
