(1523256, 200705, 40181, '<td valign="top">A lot of slinky pictures but I like this one the best.  I think it would be even better if you stuck something at the bottom of the slinky so it looks like the circles are leading somewhere.</td>', 'A lot of slinky pictures but I like this one the best.  I think it would be even better if you stuck something at the bottom of the slinky so it looks like the circles are leading somewhere.', '2005-07-10 13:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523257, 200120, 28710, '<td valign="top">I used to work in grocery, so I appreciate this pic. I am guessing that you couldn''t have had access enough to fill in the gaps at the bottom. I think it might have been nice to see a fruit cut in half. maybe half a lemon mated to half a lime for some nice relationship. I might have also flipped a few of the stickers down.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, it''s a little blown in some parts, particularly on the lemons and a bit wan in it''s saturation.</td>', 'I used to work in grocery, so I appreciate this pic. I am guessing that you couldn''t have had access enough to fill in the gaps at the bottom. I think it might have been nice to see a fruit cut in half. maybe half a lemon mated to half a lime for some nice relationship. I might have also flipped a few of the stickers down. Otherwise, it''s a little blown in some parts, particularly on the lemons and a bit wan in it''s saturation.', '2005-07-10 13:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
