(1523260, 199934, 25921, '<td valign="top">Most of the time I like borders, but somehow I find this type of translucent border distracting.  I''m not sure why....  However I love this shot.  Great symmetry and balance to be found here.   A rare 8 from me.</td>', 'Most of the time I like borders, but somehow I find this type of translucent border distracting.  I''m not sure why....  However I love this shot.  Great symmetry and balance to be found here.   A rare 8 from me.', '2005-07-10 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523262, 200476, 28710, '<td valign="top">2 things to say: <br/> <br/>Tree<br/>Clipped the bottom. <br/> <br/>Nice that you got the axis pretty close to center, but I think I would have been happier if it could have been a bit darker and the saturation on the buckets brought up a bit.</td>', '2 things to say:  TreeClipped the bottom.  Nice that you got the axis pretty close to center, but I think I would have been happier if it could have been a bit darker and the saturation on the buckets brought up a bit.', '2005-07-10 13:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
