(1523267, 199835, 25921, '<td valign="top">This could have been great with a smaller aperature.  As it is, only the two closest ants are in focus, and those don''t seem all that in focus.  I like the idea.  I have seen a similar ant shot already, but I think I like this one better.  May come back to this later.  Well done.</td>', 'This could have been great with a smaller aperature.  As it is, only the two closest ants are in focus, and those don''t seem all that in focus.  I like the idea.  I have seen a similar ant shot already, but I think I like this one better.  May come back to this later.  Well done.', '2005-07-10 13:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523270, 200457, 37961, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea. What are those things? I like the composition here. Creative.</td>', 'Lovely idea. What are those things? I like the composition here. Creative.', '2005-07-10 13:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
