(1523332, 200275, 15242, '<td valign="top">First off, you need to use the full size allowed.  If you don''t know how to do that you should ask someone.  Second, the reflections are way to distracting for this to be a good photo.  You need to used soft light and a slower shutter on something like this.  Focus looks off too.</td>', 'First off, you need to use the full size allowed.  If you don''t know how to do that you should ask someone.  Second, the reflections are way to distracting for this to be a good photo.  You need to used soft light and a slower shutter on something like this.  Focus looks off too.', '2005-07-10 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523336, 198125, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yeehaw! I wonder what it is about circles that got people thinking about girls in bikinis. Not complaining though.<br/> <br/>Too bad about the person/object in the top left corner.<br/> <br/>I guess we will have to put this down to the post in the Challenge suggestion forum for a wet teeshirt or wetlook contest.</td>', 'Yeehaw! I wonder what it is about circles that got people thinking about girls in bikinis. Not complaining though. Too bad about the person/object in the top left corner. I guess we will have to put this down to the post in the Challenge suggestion forum for a wet teeshirt or wetlook contest.', '2005-07-10 14:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
