(1523354, 200491, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yowch. Too bad about the scrunched in bobble in the tweeter there. I noticed there was a really wild optical illusion in this picture. If you focus on the center of the picture, then focus on the mesh, it looks like the vent shadow is turning itself inside out.<br/> <br/>I know the name of that effect, but I can''t bring it to my tongue right now. It is an effect to simulate movement  through patterns. Leonardo da Vinci used it a bit if I recall correctly.<br/> <br/>neat pic though.<br/> <br/>Optical illusions would be a really neat Challenge too. Have to suggest it.</td>', 'Yowch. Too bad about the scrunched in bobble in the tweeter there. I noticed there was a really wild optical illusion in this picture. If you focus on the center of the picture, then focus on the mesh, it looks like the vent shadow is turning itself inside out. I know the name of that effect, but I can''t bring it to my tongue right now. It is an effect to simulate movement  through patterns. Leonardo da Vinci used it a bit if I recall correctly. neat pic though. Optical illusions would be a really neat Challenge too. Have to suggest it.', '2005-07-10 14:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
