(1523694, 200440, 37409, '<td valign="top">I dont want to sound anal ;) but would have been better if you could clean the ball and the cup. Too bad we cant spot edit. It would have been exactly what I was looking for.</td>', 'I dont want to sound anal ;) but would have been better if you could clean the ball and the cup. Too bad we cant spot edit. It would have been exactly what I was looking for.', '2005-07-10 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523696, 200363, 37409, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but the circle actually takes away from it.</td>', 'Lovely shot but the circle actually takes away from it.', '2005-07-10 17:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523702, 199780, 37409, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.. I really cant think of a comment to help it..</td>', 'I love this shot.. I really cant think of a comment to help it..', '2005-07-10 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523703, 200492, 32513, '<td valign="top">I recomend a better background, maybe just something simple, and not too distracting.</td>', 'I recomend a better background, maybe just something simple, and not too distracting.', '2005-07-10 17:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523704, 200095, 37409, '<td valign="top">Maybe it would have been possible to speed up the exposure just a tad.</td>', 'Maybe it would have been possible to speed up the exposure just a tad.', '2005-07-10 17:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523705, 200079, 37409, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. Primary colors make me happy :)</td>', 'I love the colors. Primary colors make me happy :)', '2005-07-10 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523707, 199891, 37409, '<td valign="top">Lots of noise and seems out of focus.</td>', 'Lots of noise and seems out of focus.', '2005-07-10 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523708, 200496, 37409, '<td valign="top">Would have had more of an effect for me if you could have zoomed in more on the coins and gotten sharper image.</td>', 'Would have had more of an effect for me if you could have zoomed in more on the coins and gotten sharper image.', '2005-07-10 17:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523715, 200732, 32513, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the color temperature of your flash is all wrong. Flashes tend to burn at 5,600 Kelvin. That setting sun is burning around 1,000ish Kelvin. You need to put some  type of orange gel over you fill flash, and you have a much more realistic photo.</td>', 'Neat idea, but the color temperature of your flash is all wrong. Flashes tend to burn at 5,600 Kelvin. That setting sun is burning around 1,000ish Kelvin. You need to put some  type of orange gel over you fill flash, and you have a much more realistic photo.', '2005-07-10 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523716, 200191, 37409, '<td valign="top">The focus of the photo isnt a cirle. Its a good photo though.</td>', 'The focus of the photo isnt a cirle. Its a good photo though.', '2005-07-10 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523717, 200733, 37409, '<td valign="top">The reflection seem overblown on the lower right of the coin. Otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'The reflection seem overblown on the lower right of the coin. Otherwise nice shot.', '2005-07-10 17:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523721, 199040, 37409, '<td valign="top">The house in the distance took the focus off the subject.</td>', 'The house in the distance took the focus off the subject.', '2005-07-10 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523726, 199358, 37102, '<td valign="top">I love it...how can I not?1</td>', 'I love it...how can I not?1', '2005-07-10 17:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523735, 199516, 37409, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I like how you abstracted circle. Great colors and compsition. Did you do some sharpening? I think maybe if would have been better rather soft?</td>', 'This is a great photo. I like how you abstracted circle. Great colors and compsition. Did you do some sharpening? I think maybe if would have been better rather soft?', '2005-07-10 17:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
