(1523910, 200174, 19746, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept.  I love the solitary leading line and I would also LOVE to know how you got that background.  Very appropriate model and I like how she''s far smaller than the circle to emphasize said circle as the major element.<br/> <br/>Nice work, a 10 for sheer creativity and brilliant execution on a difficult topic.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Brilliant concept.  I love the solitary leading line and I would also LOVE to know how you got that background.  Very appropriate model and I like how she''s far smaller than the circle to emphasize said circle as the major element. Nice work, a 10 for sheer creativity and brilliant execution on a difficult topic. Alex', '2005-07-10 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
