(1523914, 199934, 19746, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and interesting rhthym created here.  Nice idea but I''m not so sure about the border.  Might lessen the visual impace somewhat but I''m not too fussed about it.  Nice to see someone put a little bit of effort into their entry :)<br/> <br/>Perhaps a little oversaturated on the actual oranges, so much so that the detail on the lines seperating each segment is lost.  <br/> <br/>Good work, 8<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Lovely tones and interesting rhthym created here.  Nice idea but I''m not so sure about the border.  Might lessen the visual impace somewhat but I''m not too fussed about it.  Nice to see someone put a little bit of effort into their entry :) Perhaps a little oversaturated on the actual oranges, so much so that the detail on the lines seperating each segment is lost.   Good work, 8 Alex', '2005-07-10 20:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
