(1524032, 199888, 25921, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this be bigger.  I think you have a good shot here, but the smaller size almost always hurts the votes you get.  I''m not commenting to tell you that though, I am commenting to let you know I like the image.  The composition is good.  I do wonder whether it would have more impact without the license plate though....  Good luck.</td>', 'I would like to have seen this be bigger.  I think you have a good shot here, but the smaller size almost always hurts the votes you get.  I''m not commenting to tell you that though, I am commenting to let you know I like the image.  The composition is good.  I do wonder whether it would have more impact without the license plate though....  Good luck.', '2005-07-10 21:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524036, 198657, 25921, '<td valign="top">This is the only CD shot I have seen so far that appeals to me.  Nice interesting photo of a rather mundane subject.  There are at least a dozen CD photos I think....  this is the best.  Well done.</td>', 'This is the only CD shot I have seen so far that appeals to me.  Nice interesting photo of a rather mundane subject.  There are at least a dozen CD photos I think....  this is the best.  Well done.', '2005-07-10 21:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524039, 200187, 25921, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge, and I must score appropriately, however, I did want to let you know I enjoy this photo.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge, and I must score appropriately, however, I did want to let you know I enjoy this photo.', '2005-07-10 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524046, 199783, 25921, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very original.</td>', 'Great idea, very original.', '2005-07-10 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524078, 200175, 4767, '<td valign="top">an extra point for using the word "circle" in your title.  (To make up for that other idiot who pasted the ''don''t say the word'' comment)!</td>', 'an extra point for using the word "circle" in your title.  (To make up for that other idiot who pasted the ''don''t say the word'' comment)!', '2005-07-10 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524085, 200497, 4767, '<td valign="top">Fun shot!  Creative and (in this competition) original!  7<br/> <br/>However, these are Sousaphones.  Tubas are carried in the arms, not worn over the shoulder like these...</td>', 'Fun shot!  Creative and (in this competition) original!  7 However, these are Sousaphones.  Tubas are carried in the arms, not worn over the shoulder like these...', '2005-07-10 21:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524094, 199874, 4767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tonality on the underside of the peach.  It glows!  The top is so hot it hurts my eyes, though, as is that one leaf on the left.  Perhaps a little something to diffuse that harshness would have given you the 10s this shot almost deserves...</td>', 'Beautiful tonality on the underside of the peach.  It glows!  The top is so hot it hurts my eyes, though, as is that one leaf on the left.  Perhaps a little something to diffuse that harshness would have given you the 10s this shot almost deserves...', '2005-07-10 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
