(1524123, 200208, 29442, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2005-07-10 22:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524128, 200200, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see that you shot this from a different angle rather than straight-on and centered.  Nice choice of b&amp;w.</td>', 'I''m glad to see that you shot this from a different angle rather than straight-on and centered.  Nice choice of b&w.', '2005-07-10 22:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524135, 198493, 30061, '<td valign="top">I think I liked this a little better before I realized that it was soda cans - the stamps on the bottom take a little away from the shot.  However, it''s unique - I love the motion and the choice of black &amp; white over color.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I think I liked this a little better before I realized that it was soda cans - the stamps on the bottom take a little away from the shot.  However, it''s unique - I love the motion and the choice of black & white over color.  Nicely done.', '2005-07-10 22:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524139, 199402, 19746, '<td valign="top">Well spotted shot!  I would have maybe upped the aperture and exposed this for a little longer to try and get some ''soft water'', but if you were handheld then I understand ;) <br/> <br/>Very pretty scene, I think you could crop this better but I''m not sure how.  I especially like the sky reflected by the water in the pipe.  Great job.<br/> <br/>Alex (7)</td>', 'Well spotted shot!  I would have maybe upped the aperture and exposed this for a little longer to try and get some ''soft water'', but if you were handheld then I understand ;)  Very pretty scene, I think you could crop this better but I''m not sure how.  I especially like the sky reflected by the water in the pipe.  Great job. Alex (7)', '2005-07-10 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524140, 198489, 29442, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail!</td>', 'Fantastic detail!', '2005-07-10 22:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524141, 200490, 30061, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot, as well as the title.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot, as well as the title.  Good luck!', '2005-07-10 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524142, 198178, 19746, '<td valign="top">Would have maybe excluded the waterline from this shot, I like the colours though.<br/> <br/>Pity you couldn''t edit out those pesky dust specs.  Nice and original take on the challenge.<br/> <br/>Alex (6)</td>', 'Would have maybe excluded the waterline from this shot, I like the colours though. Pity you couldn''t edit out those pesky dust specs.  Nice and original take on the challenge. Alex (6)', '2005-07-10 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524145, 200013, 19746, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of selective desat, here.  Great take on the challenge as well - this is fantastic.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Fantastic use of selective desat, here.  Great take on the challenge as well - this is fantastic. 9', '2005-07-10 22:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524147, 200638, 19746, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the challenge, very creative.  I would have perhaps made the DOF a little shallower here and tried to get the eye a little more centred.  You''ve done fantastically well with your BG.  Nice work and great idea.  <br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I like this take on the challenge, very creative.  I would have perhaps made the DOF a little shallower here and tried to get the eye a little more centred.  You''ve done fantastically well with your BG.  Nice work and great idea.   8 Alex', '2005-07-10 22:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
