(1525642, 200304, 36616, '<td valign="top">Squares? - sorry bet you had that answer many times.  Like the colours and crop etc. Just doesn''t have any wow for me.</td>', 'Squares? - sorry bet you had that answer many times.  Like the colours and crop etc. Just doesn''t have any wow for me.', '2005-07-11 05:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
