(1525652, 200363, 36616, '<td valign="top">Too much a view through a fuzzy, out of focus major segment of a circle. I''m sure the view was spectacular but it hasn''t been recreated here with too much sky and far distance. Getting the horizon line higher in the pic would help.</td>', 'Too much a view through a fuzzy, out of focus major segment of a circle. I''m sure the view was spectacular but it hasn''t been recreated here with too much sky and far distance. Getting the horizon line higher in the pic would help.', '2005-07-11 06:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
