(1526632, 197977, 39242, '<td valign="top">hahahahahahaha thats funny. Great title.</td>', 'hahahahahahaha thats funny. Great title.', '2005-07-11 13:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526638, 200695, 3080, '<td valign="top">Isn''t he cute?  I love toads and frogs and turtles.  Not snakes though. Anyway...My first impression is that the DOF is off and I want to see his face in focus.  However, realizing that the warts are your ''main focus'' for the challenge, that wouldn''t be a good idea.  In order for the warts to be more of a main focus though, I might have gotten a closer shot of the warts and not even gotten the head of the frog.  Maybe a horizontal line of warts/background, and that''s it.  The area in the lower right is distracting to me since it blends in with the little toad. As is, the circles just don''t seem like the main focus.  They ARE there though, so that counts for something.  LIghting doesn''t seem uniform across the image.  Darker in the back and lighter in the front area.  Maybe a different light could help accentuate the tiny warts.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Isn''t he cute?  I love toads and frogs and turtles.  Not snakes though. Anyway...My first impression is that the DOF is off and I want to see his face in focus.  However, realizing that the warts are your ''main focus'' for the challenge, that wouldn''t be a good idea.  In order for the warts to be more of a main focus though, I might have gotten a closer shot of the warts and not even gotten the head of the frog.  Maybe a horizontal line of warts/background, and that''s it.  The area in the lower right is distracting to me since it blends in with the little toad. As is, the circles just don''t seem like the main focus.  They ARE there though, so that counts for something.  LIghting doesn''t seem uniform across the image.  Darker in the back and lighter in the front area.  Maybe a different light could help accentuate the tiny warts.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-11 13:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526643, 198783, 25742, '<td valign="top">very nice. good comp and good conceptualising. good luck. 8</td>', 'very nice. good comp and good conceptualising. good luck. 8', '2005-07-11 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526654, 200492, 20056, '<td valign="top">Nice, maybe backgroud is distracting</td>', 'Nice, maybe backgroud is distracting', '2005-07-11 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526656, 200288, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good focus and DOF.  I like the detail we can see in the paper.  There is a hair or lint or something over to the right near the bottom of the dark background that is a distraction.  Everything is nice and round, and then boom...there''s a little stick looking thing.  Also, the folds in the paper around the edges (near top and right and bottom) make this look ''sloppy''.  I love the color.  Really nice against the dark background and like I said, the texture is nice.  Would like a cleaner surroundings and smoother edges.  Overall neat idea.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Good focus and DOF.  I like the detail we can see in the paper.  There is a hair or lint or something over to the right near the bottom of the dark background that is a distraction.  Everything is nice and round, and then boom...there''s a little stick looking thing.  Also, the folds in the paper around the edges (near top and right and bottom) make this look ''sloppy''.  I love the color.  Really nice against the dark background and like I said, the texture is nice.  Would like a cleaner surroundings and smoother edges.  Overall neat idea.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-11 13:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526662, 200733, 25742, '<td valign="top">good take on this. good light. no distracting shadows. good luck. 8</td>', 'good take on this. good light. no distracting shadows. good luck. 8', '2005-07-11 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526666, 198634, 20056, '<td valign="top">Very original!</td>', 'Very original!', '2005-07-11 13:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526669, 199529, 3080, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is the crop.  I don''t prefer it.  The red bottle really isn''t adding anything to the photo due to focus and lack of clarity, so I''m wondering if you were to take a photo of just the cap, if that would work better?  Focus appears good on the cap.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the bottom part of the cap.  Hard to read the words there due to light reflection.  The negative space seem awkward to me as well.  I''m thinking this might work better with a square crop with the cap in one corner.  Idea is neat though and definately circle.  ~Heather~</td>', 'First thing I notice is the crop.  I don''t prefer it.  The red bottle really isn''t adding anything to the photo due to focus and lack of clarity, so I''m wondering if you were to take a photo of just the cap, if that would work better?  Focus appears good on the cap.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the bottom part of the cap.  Hard to read the words there due to light reflection.  The negative space seem awkward to me as well.  I''m thinking this might work better with a square crop with the cap in one corner.  Idea is neat though and definately circle.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-11 13:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526674, 200012, 25742, '<td valign="top">not terribly interesting, there is nothing to grab the attention. The ''shroom is cool and of nice colour but not in good focus. Better luck next time. /5</td>', 'not terribly interesting, there is nothing to grab the attention. The ''shroom is cool and of nice colour but not in good focus. Better luck next time. /5', '2005-07-11 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526678, 198173, 25742, '<td valign="top">interesting. some distracting shadows b/c of light from right. If the slices were more symmetrical this would be a winner. good luck.</td>', 'interesting. some distracting shadows b/c of light from right. If the slices were more symmetrical this would be a winner. good luck.', '2005-07-11 13:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526686, 199780, 25742, '<td valign="top">strange. the BG circles are interesting, but I''m not sure what to think of the bubbles. you get extra credit for doing something out of the ordinary, of which there is more than enough in this challenge. /7</td>', 'strange. the BG circles are interesting, but I''m not sure what to think of the bubbles. you get extra credit for doing something out of the ordinary, of which there is more than enough in this challenge. /7', '2005-07-11 13:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
