(1526732, 198831, 30061, '<td valign="top">This had the potential to be a very nice shot.  The focus needs to be clearer, at least on some part of it.  I know how hard it is to get the entire subject in sharp focus.  Also, the background is a little distracting - the gray spots and black specks take away from the berry.  This is a unique idea, it just needs a little more work in the technical areas.  Good luck!</td>', 'This had the potential to be a very nice shot.  The focus needs to be clearer, at least on some part of it.  I know how hard it is to get the entire subject in sharp focus.  Also, the background is a little distracting - the gray spots and black specks take away from the berry.  This is a unique idea, it just needs a little more work in the technical areas.  Good luck!', '2005-07-11 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526743, 199882, 30061, '<td valign="top">How cute!  I love the idea.  Being July, the winter-themed packaging seems a little out of place, but I love everything else - the cropping, the focus, the title. :o)  Very nice shot!!</td>', 'How cute!  I love the idea.  Being July, the winter-themed packaging seems a little out of place, but I love everything else - the cropping, the focus, the title. :o)  Very nice shot!!', '2005-07-11 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526767, 200567, 30061, '<td valign="top">Neat.  The focus is good, but the blue cast around each ant tends to make them look blurrier than they really are.  I''ve had trouble with the blue cast myself (my entry for the Granular challenge suffered from the same thing).  It''s a cool shot, though.  7</td>', 'Neat.  The focus is good, but the blue cast around each ant tends to make them look blurrier than they really are.  I''ve had trouble with the blue cast myself (my entry for the Granular challenge suffered from the same thing).  It''s a cool shot, though.  7', '2005-07-11 13:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
