(1527227, 200252, 38492, '<td valign="top">This is a great image - the brake disk is clearly the main subject - the eye is drawn to it from any part of the photo. The tight crop on the mudguard''s a shame - it''s curve would have lent a greater emphasis to the wheel. I don''t find the overblown highlights a problem, although some might - it gives added emphasis to the tyre. Only minor issue is the bleed into the tree trunk in the background - shooting ever so slightly to the right would have fixed this :)<br/> <br/>&lt;rant&gt; riding a bike without any safety gear is just silly, though. &lt;/rant&gt;<br/></td>', 'This is a great image - the brake disk is clearly the main subject - the eye is drawn to it from any part of the photo. The tight crop on the mudguard''s a shame - it''s curve would have lent a greater emphasis to the wheel. I don''t find the overblown highlights a problem, although some might - it gives added emphasis to the tyre. Only minor issue is the bleed into the tree trunk in the background - shooting ever so slightly to the right would have fixed this :) <rant> riding a bike without any safety gear is just silly, though. </rant>', '2005-07-11 15:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
