(1528047, 200119, 40295, '<td valign="top">Great action shoot - movement is well caught and the placement of the dog and the frisbie are well done. Color could be a bit better but the range a light between the dog and the frisbie was a bit much to get the full effect. Might have been better with a darker frisbie so you didn''t have to deal with that.</td>', 'Great action shoot - movement is well caught and the placement of the dog and the frisbie are well done. Color could be a bit better but the range a light between the dog and the frisbie was a bit much to get the full effect. Might have been better with a darker frisbie so you didn''t have to deal with that.', '2005-07-11 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
