(1528062, 200482, 39939, '<td valign="top">I had originally planned on doing something similar with my father, brother and nephew as subjects, but as my father is in an entirely different country, even a different continent, this task was difficult, not to mention expencive to execute, so I settled for something else.<br/>Lovely composition, even if only a little more could have been cropped off the left side.</td>', 'I had originally planned on doing something similar with my father, brother and nephew as subjects, but as my father is in an entirely different country, even a different continent, this task was difficult, not to mention expencive to execute, so I settled for something else.Lovely composition, even if only a little more could have been cropped off the left side.', '2005-07-11 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528078, 198434, 40295, '<td valign="top">Like the diagnal lines and how the focus fades at just the right place. However the large dark area in the circle while it may be unavoidable is a bit disconcerting to me. I''m not sure how I''d fix it either.</td>', 'Like the diagnal lines and how the focus fades at just the right place. However the large dark area in the circle while it may be unavoidable is a bit disconcerting to me. I''m not sure how I''d fix it either.', '2005-07-11 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1);
