(1528246, 200364, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really a beautiful shot.  (Need to check spelling of title though)  Love the colors and good DOF.  The background is also very good - very stormy and ominous.  Nicely presented and executed.  Really good job.   9</td>', 'Really a beautiful shot.  (Need to check spelling of title though)  Love the colors and good DOF.  The background is also very good - very stormy and ominous.  Nicely presented and executed.  Really good job.   9', '2005-07-11 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528253, 200463, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simple and very well executed.  Love the colors and the white background works very well.  The white in the rope may be a little blown out, but it''s hard to take off many points for anything in this shot.  Reallly well done.  9  Bumping to 10.  Congrats on a great image!</td>', 'Simple and very well executed.  Love the colors and the white background works very well.  The white in the rope may be a little blown out, but it''s hard to take off many points for anything in this shot.  Reallly well done.  9  Bumping to 10.  Congrats on a great image!', '2005-07-11 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
