(1528733, 199138, 39571, '<td valign="top">I would suggest cropping in on the eye more for 2 reasons - it will bring the viewers attention to what you want them to see, instead of the large blurry leaf in the center of the image, and will also eliminate the date stamp on the image.<br/> <br/>Very cool idea though, and I think that cropping it will greatly improve the image.</td>', 'I would suggest cropping in on the eye more for 2 reasons - it will bring the viewers attention to what you want them to see, instead of the large blurry leaf in the center of the image, and will also eliminate the date stamp on the image. Very cool idea though, and I think that cropping it will greatly improve the image.', '2005-07-12 00:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
