(1530109, 199076, 38492, '<td valign="top">There are several basic things wrong with this photo: overexposed CD''s, dusty background, out of focus pencils. <br/>A soft light from front right and front left would help reduce the shadows. the composition is somewhat unimaginative - what story are you trying to portray with these 4 subjects? they don''t seem well related. Good effort on the shot position, though - having the perspective into the table is good for abstracts, and would work well with 4 very similar objects.<br/> <br/></td>', 'There are several basic things wrong with this photo: overexposed CD''s, dusty background, out of focus pencils. A soft light from front right and front left would help reduce the shadows. the composition is somewhat unimaginative - what story are you trying to portray with these 4 subjects? they don''t seem well related. Good effort on the shot position, though - having the perspective into the table is good for abstracts, and would work well with 4 very similar objects. ', '2005-07-12 14:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1530110, 198619, 10985, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great! I love the originality, the light, the white, the pose, the expression, the detail, but the left eye is too dark, which keeps bugging me.</td>', 'Wow! Great! I love the originality, the light, the white, the pose, the expression, the detail, but the left eye is too dark, which keeps bugging me.', '2005-07-12 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1530112, 200115, 32513, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I recomend trying to fill in the foreground with some light, a good speed flash or two off of some reflectors would do the trick. This would give you a less contrasty exposure, and you''d be able to have detail in the sky. But then again, if this is the look your after, thats cool too!</td>', 'I like this photo, but I recomend trying to fill in the foreground with some light, a good speed flash or two off of some reflectors would do the trick. This would give you a less contrasty exposure, and you''d be able to have detail in the sky. But then again, if this is the look your after, thats cool too!', '2005-07-12 14:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1530129, 199872, 12327, '<td valign="top">nice perspective... that''s exactly how I would compose this image.   Wish the thing sticking in the air at the far end wasn''t there, but I assume you couldn''t do much about that.</td>', 'nice perspective... that''s exactly how I would compose this image.   Wish the thing sticking in the air at the far end wasn''t there, but I assume you couldn''t do much about that.', '2005-07-12 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
