(1530147, 199787, 38492, '<td valign="top">The shadow bottom centre is slightly distracting. The only thing I can think of that would increase the interest in this shot would be to cast more colour onto the wall behind, possibly by using a very strong point light source.</td>', 'The shadow bottom centre is slightly distracting. The only thing I can think of that would increase the interest in this shot would be to cast more colour onto the wall behind, possibly by using a very strong point light source.', '2005-07-12 15:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
