(1530186, 198679, 38492, '<td valign="top">There''s some odd anti-aliasing artifacts in here - they shouldn''t be visible at this rez. Possibly sharpened it too much?</td>', 'There''s some odd anti-aliasing artifacts in here - they shouldn''t be visible at this rez. Possibly sharpened it too much?', '2005-07-12 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1530190, 198818, 12327, '<td valign="top">mouthwatering...   I would change the composition slightly to make the two halves form a diagonal (move the one on the right side a bit higher, and I would do it somewhere where that corner line doesn''t show up.</td>', 'mouthwatering...   I would change the composition slightly to make the two halves form a diagonal (move the one on the right side a bit higher, and I would do it somewhere where that corner line doesn''t show up.', '2005-07-12 15:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
