(1530195, 200443, 38492, '<td valign="top">The remaining segment of the far aperture is distracting - without it, it would be a great texture shot, with more, it would be a great framing shot, as it stands, the eye is drawn to the verticals, distracting from the main circle. Why have the borders? The black on the right just adds to the shadow. Still, a great photo!</td>', 'The remaining segment of the far aperture is distracting - without it, it would be a great texture shot, with more, it would be a great framing shot, as it stands, the eye is drawn to the verticals, distracting from the main circle. Why have the borders? The black on the right just adds to the shadow. Still, a great photo!', '2005-07-12 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
