(1530741, 199600, 35804, '<td valign="top">I wish the rings weren''t chopped off...I feel like I want to see the entire set of rings...I think perhaps if the entire "circle" were included there would be a different dynamic happening...ours eyes perhaps would keep following the rings round and round always staying within the image and not be allowed to fall of the picture  where rings have been cropped...this is such a fun image....I wish more people would venture underwater!</td>', 'I wish the rings weren''t chopped off...I feel like I want to see the entire set of rings...I think perhaps if the entire "circle" were included there would be a different dynamic happening...ours eyes perhaps would keep following the rings round and round always staying within the image and not be allowed to fall of the picture  where rings have been cropped...this is such a fun image....I wish more people would venture underwater!', '2005-07-12 19:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
