(1530821, 199995, 39939, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with your opinion, however, wouldn''t it be better if intercourse did not occur out of wedlock, when both parts has taken a physical? Never mind, I couldn''t wait that long if I was ever tempted by the fairer sex. As my father always says: Temptations is the only thing I cannot resist. The same is true here. "Better to have a condom and never need it, than to need it and not have it," indirect quote from Alien Versus Predator.<br/>However much I agree with the message, most of the circle is blocked by the tip of the protection, and it looks a bit filthy which would negate any disease reasons the condom exists, which is why I gave it 5</td>', 'I have to agree with your opinion, however, wouldn''t it be better if intercourse did not occur out of wedlock, when both parts has taken a physical? Never mind, I couldn''t wait that long if I was ever tempted by the fairer sex. As my father always says: Temptations is the only thing I cannot resist. The same is true here. "Better to have a condom and never need it, than to need it and not have it," indirect quote from Alien Versus Predator.However much I agree with the message, most of the circle is blocked by the tip of the protection, and it looks a bit filthy which would negate any disease reasons the condom exists, which is why I gave it 5', '2005-07-12 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
