(1531223, 200261, 38666, '<td valign="top">I have to say, I like that there is no harsh shadows. As for circles, there are so many I couldn''t even count them, also a good thing. I like the edge of the pot peeking into the frame and the pour is good.  But the drink itself (coffee?) looks disgusting, i don''t like the splashes on the countertop, i think the cup itself should be lower on the saucer (in the frame), the space from the edges of the saucer to border MUST be TOTALLY symetrical or not even close, and I would have much preferred this shot in black and white and really contrasty so the liquid is almost pure black and the countertop is almost pure white.  Basically a good idea  that was rushed, and might have scored a 10 otherwise...I''m giving it a 5 for potential. Re-shoot!</td>', 'I have to say, I like that there is no harsh shadows. As for circles, there are so many I couldn''t even count them, also a good thing. I like the edge of the pot peeking into the frame and the pour is good.  But the drink itself (coffee?) looks disgusting, i don''t like the splashes on the countertop, i think the cup itself should be lower on the saucer (in the frame), the space from the edges of the saucer to border MUST be TOTALLY symetrical or not even close, and I would have much preferred this shot in black and white and really contrasty so the liquid is almost pure black and the countertop is almost pure white.  Basically a good idea  that was rushed, and might have scored a 10 otherwise...I''m giving it a 5 for potential. Re-shoot!', '2005-07-12 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
