(1531763, 200668, 24681, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by totaldis:</b></div><hr/><i> why is this photo cropped just above his foot and just below the top of the gyro </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s because it wasn''t taken with the intention of entering the challenge. I was on vacation and came back home to realize that this challenge was going on - looked at my photos, realized this one met the criteria of the challenge, and decided to give it a shot :)</td>', 'Originally posted by totaldis: why is this photo cropped just above his foot and just below the top of the gyro   It''s because it wasn''t taken with the intention of entering the challenge. I was on vacation and came back home to realize that this challenge was going on - looked at my photos, realized this one met the criteria of the challenge, and decided to give it a shot :)', '2005-07-13 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
