(1531769, 197734, 3724, '<td valign="top">Strong background saturation i find attractive it sublimates your field, but with plenty of detail - Your beautiful hydrangea, admitedly under flat light lacks the balanced tonal vitality of the background.  Possibly sharpness in the file is partially to blame, but I think you could coax some more dynamic qualities from that bloom.</td>', 'Strong background saturation i find attractive it sublimates your field, but with plenty of detail - Your beautiful hydrangea, admitedly under flat light lacks the balanced tonal vitality of the background.  Possibly sharpness in the file is partially to blame, but I think you could coax some more dynamic qualities from that bloom.', '2005-07-13 01:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
