(1531855, 200736, 39239, '<td valign="top">well...I should have know better than to try and post an artistic interpretation on this site.  Not surprised at all about the comments, or the votes.  I guess when I start shooting cds and wheels in a circle challenge I will truly come into my own as a photographer :S  I do these challenges for me, to learn more, and to inspire me to shoot.  I do not take these challenges as literally as most on this site (not all mind you).  Now that thats out of the way.<br/> <br/>The not much done in post processing on this shot except with the curves a bit.  I liked the dirty style, and the warholish feel that it had.  Thanks for all the comments...</td>', 'well...I should have know better than to try and post an artistic interpretation on this site.  Not surprised at all about the comments, or the votes.  I guess when I start shooting cds and wheels in a circle challenge I will truly come into my own as a photographer :S  I do these challenges for me, to learn more, and to inspire me to shoot.  I do not take these challenges as literally as most on this site (not all mind you).  Now that thats out of the way. The not much done in post processing on this shot except with the curves a bit.  I liked the dirty style, and the warholish feel that it had.  Thanks for all the comments...', '2005-07-13 02:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
