(1532115, 200348, 18450, '<td valign="top">Very cool creative idea!! I really like this shot!!<br/> <br/>It''d be fun to try and put a very tiny image of some clothes on a clothesline right in the centre.</td>', 'Very cool creative idea!! I really like this shot!! It''d be fun to try and put a very tiny image of some clothes on a clothesline right in the centre.', '2005-07-13 06:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1532124, 198473, 40437, '<td valign="top"><i>There is an illusion factor here. First look the lenses seems to be facing to the left. When you look at the reflection and the edges, you have to convince yourself that it they are actually facing to the right. </i></td>', 'There is an illusion factor here. First look the lenses seems to be facing to the left. When you look at the reflection and the edges, you have to convince yourself that it they are actually facing to the right. ', '2005-07-13 06:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1532127, 199877, 7540, '<td valign="top">WOW, thanks for all the great comments everyone.  This is my first entry and your comments really helped me a lot.  I''m sure there will be many more entries from me in the future.  To digitalknight, I did try cropping the picture differently so the circle wasn''t centred but liked this version the best.</td>', 'WOW, thanks for all the great comments everyone.  This is my first entry and your comments really helped me a lot.  I''m sure there will be many more entries from me in the future.  To digitalknight, I did try cropping the picture differently so the circle wasn''t centred but liked this version the best.', '2005-07-13 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
