(1532185, 198384, 35044, '<td valign="top">I still love this shot, but am amazed you got this clarity of bubbles on a 1/4 shutter speed.  Not sure if you have the function (or the desire), but a slightly faster shutter would have stopped the motion fractionally better.  In taking photos of air bubbles in water from the side on, I found that I needed shutter speeds of 1/3200 in order to stop the bubble completely.</td>', 'I still love this shot, but am amazed you got this clarity of bubbles on a 1/4 shutter speed.  Not sure if you have the function (or the desire), but a slightly faster shutter would have stopped the motion fractionally better.  In taking photos of air bubbles in water from the side on, I found that I needed shutter speeds of 1/3200 in order to stop the bubble completely.', '2005-07-13 07:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
