(1532848, 200115, 31403, '<td valign="top">I still love it - I wondered if anybody else would see it.  I guess that''s art for you - some love some hate.  This has that classic slice of americana feel to it that I think will endure.  Don''t put it away, give it a little digital love and put it proudly on a wall.  The world will come around to it!  (bold statement for a guy with no ribbons, no?)  :)</td>', 'I still love it - I wondered if anybody else would see it.  I guess that''s art for you - some love some hate.  This has that classic slice of americana feel to it that I think will endure.  Don''t put it away, give it a little digital love and put it proudly on a wall.  The world will come around to it!  (bold statement for a guy with no ribbons, no?)  :)', '2005-07-13 13:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
