(1532885, 199998, 31403, '<td valign="top">me really liking something here on DPC seems to be the kiss of death, and I do apologize for that.  How this scores this low is beyond me.  You and I will just have to shoot really shiny stuff with lots of Neat Image to clean up any unwanted realism.<br/> <br/>This is a cool shot - no matter what the DPC crowd said!</td>', 'me really liking something here on DPC seems to be the kiss of death, and I do apologize for that.  How this scores this low is beyond me.  You and I will just have to shoot really shiny stuff with lots of Neat Image to clean up any unwanted realism. This is a cool shot - no matter what the DPC crowd said!', '2005-07-13 13:16:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1532920, 198432, 10634, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on your entry during the challenge, but I would have given it a 6. It is a bit too centered for me. Perhaps tilting it so the vine comes from one corner to the other could have improved the composition a little... and placing the circle a little off-center. Otherwise it is very nice and a good entry. <br/> <br/>Jen</td>', 'I didn''t vote on your entry during the challenge, but I would have given it a 6. It is a bit too centered for me. Perhaps tilting it so the vine comes from one corner to the other could have improved the composition a little... and placing the circle a little off-center. Otherwise it is very nice and a good entry.  Jen', '2005-07-13 13:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
