(1533905, 200444, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least you have some small circles in there ... but I not that the basic impact of the photo comes from a spiral, note a circle--usually the voters are so pedantic about things like that, I''m pretty (pleasantly) surprised at this seeming change in voting perspective. well-done photo regardless degree of "meeting the challenge" ascribed to it--congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'At least you have some small circles in there ... but I not that the basic impact of the photo comes from a spiral, note a circle--usually the voters are so pedantic about things like that, I''m pretty (pleasantly) surprised at this seeming change in voting perspective. well-done photo regardless degree of "meeting the challenge" ascribed to it--congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-07-13 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1533931, 200278, 18090, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who took the time to comment on my photo. I appreciate the tips and the view of eyes other than my own.<br/> <br/>Comment of my own regarding the commenter who felt the need to respond to someone else''s comment: Please take your pi$$ing contest out of the voting and into a forum.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who took the time to comment on my photo. I appreciate the tips and the view of eyes other than my own. Comment of my own regarding the commenter who felt the need to respond to someone else''s comment: Please take your pi$$ing contest out of the voting and into a forum.', '2005-07-13 20:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
