(1534228, 200557, 11738, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by asij:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beagleboy:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like a straight-on photo of a display on a computer monitor to me.  Maybe it''s not the case, but it sure looks like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There is a littel area in Reykjavík (Grafarvog) with this all kind of metal things! kinda art. I placed my camera inside one of those thing and shot this picture in negative, from a low angel in a special prespetiv. Alot of peopel think this is a shot from a monitor but it´s NOT! I´m never gonna take a picture of a picture in a monitor!<br/>It looks excatly like this orginal. just a littel darker </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Very, very cool!  Great work.</td>', 'Originally posted by asij: Originally posted by Beagleboy: Looks like a straight-on photo of a display on a computer monitor to me.  Maybe it''s not the case, but it sure looks like it.   There is a littel area in Reykjavík (Grafarvog) with this all kind of metal things! kinda art. I placed my camera inside one of those thing and shot this picture in negative, from a low angel in a special prespetiv. Alot of peopel think this is a shot from a monitor but it´s NOT! I´m never gonna take a picture of a picture in a monitor!It looks excatly like this orginal. just a littel darker   Very, very cool!  Great work.', '2005-07-13 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
