(1534722, 199073, 39163, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jmsetzler:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s always helpful to read the rules since you checked the box that indicated that you had done so :)  The idea here is good but the editing (which is illegal in this challenge) is rather poor.  <br/> <br/>Addendum:  I shouldn''t assume this is illegal.  I did vote it as if it was legal.  I just don''t like the remnants of whatever editing was used.  It looks too strange to me and I can''t see or find purpose in those remnants. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The editing was legal (photo was validated).  The only reason the remnants were there is because I had to stay within the rules, otherwise I would have removed them too.</td>', 'Originally posted by jmsetzler: It''s always helpful to read the rules since you checked the box that indicated that you had done so :)  The idea here is good but the editing (which is illegal in this challenge) is rather poor.   Addendum:  I shouldn''t assume this is illegal.  I did vote it as if it was legal.  I just don''t like the remnants of whatever editing was used.  It looks too strange to me and I can''t see or find purpose in those remnants.   The editing was legal (photo was validated).  The only reason the remnants were there is because I had to stay within the rules, otherwise I would have removed them too.', '2005-07-14 06:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
