(1536883, 198144, 39111, '<td valign="top">wow, i thought this would do so much better.  i''m new to DPC and am quite surprised at some of the comments you got about this being too sexual in nature.  1: this didn''t really seem like a "sexy" shot to me, maybe b/c i''m not a man?  2: the water dripping off her never seemed to be urine, girls don''t pee out of their bums.  3: i thought the tags added to the candid feel.  sorry, it''s a great shot and the subject should keep it to remind her of her youth!</td>', 'wow, i thought this would do so much better.  i''m new to DPC and am quite surprised at some of the comments you got about this being too sexual in nature.  1: this didn''t really seem like a "sexy" shot to me, maybe b/c i''m not a man?  2: the water dripping off her never seemed to be urine, girls don''t pee out of their bums.  3: i thought the tags added to the candid feel.  sorry, it''s a great shot and the subject should keep it to remind her of her youth!', '2005-07-15 02:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1536939, 200443, 31409, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all comments. I was not able to get a better angle to get that perfect circle, or I would have had to clone out a bar in front of it, as well as the ''distracting'' pieces of the playground at the end of the tunnel. This was one of those moments where I was walking by and spotted the tunnel otherwise I may not have found a good example of a circle for the challenge.</td>', 'Thanks for all comments. I was not able to get a better angle to get that perfect circle, or I would have had to clone out a bar in front of it, as well as the ''distracting'' pieces of the playground at the end of the tunnel. This was one of those moments where I was walking by and spotted the tunnel otherwise I may not have found a good example of a circle for the challenge.', '2005-07-15 03:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
