(1546937, 200294, 32513, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the compliment. I said I had low hopes because of the fact that penny photos, well, any photo of coins in general, gets a really low score on this site. I don''t really know why, but I now think it''s because most of them just look the same.</td>', 'Thank you for the compliment. I said I had low hopes because of the fact that penny photos, well, any photo of coins in general, gets a really low score on this site. I don''t really know why, but I now think it''s because most of them just look the same.', '2005-07-19 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 0),
