(1569164, 199783, 31720, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for all the kind comments.  I had fun setting up this photo and using my actual breakfast for the shot (although, since I''m not a coffee drinker, the mug is actually filled with Diet Coke).  I''m quite happy with how this placed among the other 500+ photographs given the rather unexciting nature of the picture.  I was just hoping to get a few laughs from the people who don''t really wake up until after noon.  Judging from the scores of commentators, I succeeded.</td>', 'Thank you all for all the kind comments.  I had fun setting up this photo and using my actual breakfast for the shot (although, since I''m not a coffee drinker, the mug is actually filled with Diet Coke).  I''m quite happy with how this placed among the other 500+ photographs given the rather unexciting nature of the picture.  I was just hoping to get a few laughs from the people who don''t really wake up until after noon.  Judging from the scores of commentators, I succeeded.', '2005-07-28 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
