(1585495, 200569, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I would have liked some more contrast, or perhaps left it in color.  The field and front portion just seem a bit dark to me.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I would have liked some more contrast, or perhaps left it in color.  The field and front portion just seem a bit dark to me.', '2005-08-03 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
