(1695596, 200569, 37719, '<td valign="top">I almost submitted a similar shot.  Living in a rural area surrounded by farms it is a common sight around here.  But I never thought of one in B/W.  I like this image and the b/w works well here.  I read the other comments...I think the hazy mtn. helps the image.  Keeps you focused on the subject portion of the photo while letting you see the distance.  Nice work!</td>', 'I almost submitted a similar shot.  Living in a rural area surrounded by farms it is a common sight around here.  But I never thought of one in B/W.  I like this image and the b/w works well here.  I read the other comments...I think the hazy mtn. helps the image.  Keeps you focused on the subject portion of the photo while letting you see the distance.  Nice work!', '2005-09-11 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
