(1852716, 200016, 37719, '<td valign="top">Well, since you have seen my glass pics, I guess you know this is my kind of shot.  This is very well done and shows a very creative imagination.  The colors here are fantastic.  The focus is good and the image is very clean and crisp.  it does appear as though it could be in space.  I would not have guessed it was on a cd.  Very well done!</td>', 'Well, since you have seen my glass pics, I guess you know this is my kind of shot.  This is very well done and shows a very creative imagination.  The colors here are fantastic.  The focus is good and the image is very clean and crisp.  it does appear as though it could be in space.  I would not have guessed it was on a cd.  Very well done!', '2005-11-09 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1853891, 199340, 14671, '<td valign="top">Thinking outside the box does not go over well on this site as you can see from some/most of the comments below.  The pond where is was taken is a circular shape and this is a slice of that pond.  The trees are also circular in shape and the water ring around the tree highlights that.</td>', 'Thinking outside the box does not go over well on this site as you can see from some/most of the comments below.  The pond where is was taken is a circular shape and this is a slice of that pond.  The trees are also circular in shape and the water ring around the tree highlights that.', '2005-11-10 04:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
