(1976123, 198144, 47347, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Surprised by some of the comments. Is that all people see? The tags? Oh well, to each his/her own sight. With the pool behind her, all one can immediatly see is that it is water dripping, of course...<br/> <br/>I like the photo for the colours and still effect. I''m a male and no, this does not do anything to me sexually. Not at that age. Pleasant to see, yes, but no reaction.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-24 18:39:56.</i></td>', 'Nice shot. Surprised by some of the comments. Is that all people see? The tags? Oh well, to each his/her own sight. With the pool behind her, all one can immediatly see is that it is water dripping, of course... I like the photo for the colours and still effect. I''m a male and no, this does not do anything to me sexually. Not at that age. Pleasant to see, yes, but no reaction.', '2005-12-24 18:06:46.000000', '2005-12-24 18:39:56.000000', 0),
