(2356079, 199379, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice variation of a common theme. I like the use of reflections here, also the texture inside the pipes are nice to look at. It''s also interesting to see how some elements stand out a bit more than others and form a pattern inside the pattern. The ''sepia'' gives your image the final touch.</td>', 'A nice variation of a common theme. I like the use of reflections here, also the texture inside the pipes are nice to look at. It''s also interesting to see how some elements stand out a bit more than others and form a pattern inside the pattern. The ''sepia'' gives your image the final touch.', '2006-04-29 07:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2360331, 198464, 47117, '<td valign="top">Another great angle. Makes her legs look amazingly long. Very nice perspective.</td>', 'Another great angle. Makes her legs look amazingly long. Very nice perspective.', '2006-04-30 00:29:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2428029, 200686, 33552, '<td valign="top">A slingshot!!! Excellant! I''m a major theme park junkie, and this is one of my favorites! Looks like you got it on the way down, good timing and framing. If you get a chance, shoot this one at night. The cage should be lit for the on-ride camera. Timing would be tough though, You''d have to catch it right at the top before it flips/rolls, or at the bottom when it slows down for a moment. Great expressions!</td>', 'A slingshot!!! Excellant! I''m a major theme park junkie, and this is one of my favorites! Looks like you got it on the way down, good timing and framing. If you get a chance, shoot this one at night. The cage should be lit for the on-ride camera. Timing would be tough though, You''d have to catch it right at the top before it flips/rolls, or at the bottom when it slows down for a moment. Great expressions!', '2006-05-18 00:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2552583, 200723, 16912, '<td valign="top">comment from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread...<br/> <br/>Scott, I viewed the image, then with my initial thoughts read the comments and whilst maybe not a ribbon winner I think it should have scored higher. I think Heather hit the nail on the head, it is too tightly cropped from the top and right and the wisp of light bottom left is distracting. A very unusual shot, I like it.</td>', 'comment from my 1-4-0  thread... Scott, I viewed the image, then with my initial thoughts read the comments and whilst maybe not a ribbon winner I think it should have scored higher. I think Heather hit the nail on the head, it is too tightly cropped from the top and right and the wisp of light bottom left is distracting. A very unusual shot, I like it.', '2006-06-25 20:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
