(3382019, 200106, 18505, '<td valign="top">I am trying to catch up on commenting, and would have loved to have given this image a higher score.  I like the colors and the composition; however, there is a problem with the focus.  The image is very soft, especially on the right side, and there is a great deal of noise in the background.  There also seems to be some pixelation around the edges, so I''m guessing it was either taken in low light or is a very, very tight crop of a much larger image.</td>', 'I am trying to catch up on commenting, and would have loved to have given this image a higher score.  I like the colors and the composition; however, there is a problem with the focus.  The image is very soft, especially on the right side, and there is a great deal of noise in the background.  There also seems to be some pixelation around the edges, so I''m guessing it was either taken in low light or is a very, very tight crop of a much larger image.', '2007-02-19 15:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
